text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn for each Swamp you control.', "As Primal Clay enters the battlefield, it becomes your choice of a 3/3 artifact creature, a 2/2 artifact creature with flying, or a 1/6 Wall artifact creature with defender in addition to its other types. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, count the number of permanents you control. Your life total becomes that number.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, draw a card.\\n{T}: Staff of Nin deals 1 damage to any target.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 200 or more cards in your library, you win the game.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Cathedral of War enters the battlefield tapped.\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{T}: Add {C}.', "Chandra's Fury deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker and 1 damage to each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", 'Copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', 'Create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', 'Create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Create two 2/2 blue Drake creature tokens with flying.', 'Creatures you control gain double strike until end of turn. (They deal both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 until end of turn. Each creature your opponents control blocks this turn if able.', 'Creatures you control have flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, and protection from black and from red.', 'Creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Crimson Muckwader gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Swamp.\\n{2}{B}: Regenerate Crimson Muckwader. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Crusader of Odric's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nWhen Acidic Slime enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', "Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Put a petrification counter on target creature. It gains defender and becomes a colorless artifact in addition to its other types. Its activated abilities can't be activated. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\n{R}: Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Defender, flying\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by Fog Bank.', 'Destroy all nonland permanents.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Destroy target creature an opponent controls. Each other creature that player controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Door to Nothingness enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{W}{W}{U}{U}{B}{B}{R}{R}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Door to Nothingness: Target player loses the game.', 'Dragonskull Summit enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Drowned Catacomb enters the battlefield tapped unless you control an Island or a Swamp.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', "Enchant artifact or creature\\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and can't be blocked.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has lifelink.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has mountainwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Dark Favor enters the battlefield, you lose 1 life.\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Divine Favor enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has flying.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Equipped creature has haste. (It can attack and {T} no matter when it came under your control.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's red.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Equipped creature has trample. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's green.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Equipped creature has vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's white.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Essence Drain deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', "Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{3}{B}: Regenerate Duty-Bound Dead. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Exchange control of two target creatures.', "Exile all permanents. Exile all cards from all hands and graveyards. Each player's life total becomes 1.", 'Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Exile target enchantment.', "Exile target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard and target instant or sorcery card from an opponent's graveyard. Copy those cards. Cast the copies if able without paying their mana costs. Exile Spelltwine.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhenever Odric, Master Tactician and at least three other creatures attack, you choose which creatures block this combat and how those creatures block.', 'First strike\\nWhen Attended Knight enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.', 'Flames of the Firebrand deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nYou may cast green creature spells as though they had flash.', 'Flinthoof Boar gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Mountain.\\n{R}: Flinthoof Boar gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWelkin Tern can block only creatures with flying.", 'Flying, deathtouch, lifelink', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nArctic Aven gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Plains.\\n{W}: Arctic Aven gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nOther creatures you control have exalted. (If a creature has multiple instances of exalted, each triggers separately.)', 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever Nefarox, Overlord of Grixis attacks alone, defending player sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\\nHaste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Thundermaw Hellkite enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to each creature with flying your opponents control. Tap those creatures.', "Flying\\nJace's Phantasm gets +4/+4 as long as an opponent has ten or more cards in their graveyard.", "Flying\\nSlumbering Dragon can't attack or block unless it has five or more +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, put a +1/+1 counter on Slumbering Dragon.", "Flying\\nWar Falcon can't attack unless you control a Knight or a Soldier.", 'Flying\\nWhen Battleflight Eagle enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Bloodhunter Bat enters the battlefield, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sphinx of Uthuun enters the battlefield, reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', "Flying\\nWhenever Shimian Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. Search that player's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Griffin Protector gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{1}{R}{R}{R}: Return Firewing Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Hatchling gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it and untap it. That creature gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Glacial Fortress enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Plains or an Island.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', "Harbor Bandit gets +1/+1 as long as you control an Island.\\n{1}{U}: Harbor Bandit can't be blocked this turn.", 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nReckless Brute attacks each combat if able.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'Indestructible\\nAs Phylactery Lich enters the battlefield, put a phylactery counter on an artifact you control.\\nWhen you control no permanents with phylactery counters on them, sacrifice Phylactery Lich.', 'Indestructible\\nAs Stuffy Doll enters the battlefield, choose a player.\\nWhenever Stuffy Doll is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to the chosen player.\\n{T}: Stuffy Doll deals 1 damage to itself.', "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nAll lands are Islands in addition to their other types.\\nCreatures without flying or islandwalk can't attack.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nHarbor Serpent can't attack unless there are five or more Islands on the battlefield.", 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\\nIf you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Magmaquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each planeswalker.', "Mogg Flunkies can't attack or block alone.", 'Other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{T}: Add {G} for each Elf you control.', "Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\\nAs long as the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus and other Vampire creatures you control get +2/+1 and have flying.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.', 'Primordial Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, double the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra.\\nPrimordial Hydra has trample as long as it has ten or more +1/+1 counters on it.', "Prized Elephant gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Forest.\\n{G}: Prized Elephant gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Protection from black (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", "Protection from white (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything white.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Reach\\n{X}{G}{G}: Silklash Spider deals X damage to each creature with flying.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target green card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return to the battlefield all permanent cards in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn.', 'Rootbound Crag enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain or a Forest.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Search your library for a Plains, Island, Swamp, or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of lands you control, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to X cards, put those cards into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two Forest cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Searing Spear deals 3 damage to any target.', "Serra Avatar's power and toughness are each equal to your life total.\\nWhen Serra Avatar is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Sunpetal Grove enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Forest or a Plains.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Tap all creatures target player controls. Those creatures don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Tap two untapped artifacts you control: Untap target artifact.', 'Tap up to three target creatures.', 'Target creature gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -5/-0 until end of turn.', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Target opponent mills seven cards.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards their hand.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Timberpack Wolf gets +1/+1 for each other creature you control named Timberpack Wolf.', "Tormented Soul can't block and can't be blocked.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Trample\\nWhen Elderscale Wurm enters the battlefield, if your life total is less than 7, your life total becomes 7.\\nAs long as you have 7 or more life, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 7 reduces it to 7 instead.', 'Turn to Slag deals 5 damage to target creature. Destroy all Equipment attached to that creature.', "Veilborn Ghoul can't block.\\nWhenever a Swamp enters the battlefield under your control, you may return Veilborn Ghoul from your graveyard to your hand.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nOther Soldier creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.\\nWhen Captain of the Watch enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.", 'Vigilance, reach', 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to any target.', 'When Archaeomancer enters the battlefield, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Augur of Bolas enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an instant or sorcery card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'When Bond Beetle enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "When Disciple of Bolas enters the battlefield, sacrifice another creature. You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is that creature's power.", 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Goblin Arsonist dies, you may have it deal 1 damage to any target.', "When Ground Seal enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nCards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities.", "When Liliana's Shade enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{B}: Liliana's Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'When Mindclaw Shaman enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals their hand. You may cast an instant or sorcery spell from among those cards without paying its mana cost.', 'When Mwonvuli Beast Tracker enters the battlefield, search your library for a creature card with deathtouch, hexproof, reach, or trample and reveal it. Shuffle and put that card on top.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'When War Priest of Thune enters the battlefield, you may destroy target enchantment.', "When Yeva's Forcemage enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", 'Whenever Scroll Thief deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', "Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, that creature's controller loses 1 life.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 2 life.', "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Hamletback Goliath, where X is that creature's power.", 'Whenever another creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.', "Whenever you cast a red spell, target creature can't block this turn.", "Whenever you cast a spell that's white, blue, black, or red, put a +1/+1 counter on Quirion Dryad.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', "You can't cast this spell during your first, second, or third turns of the game.\\nFlying, vigilance", 'You gain 1 life for each land you control.', 'You gain 7 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may cast spells from your hand without paying their mana costs.', 'You may choose new targets for target spell.', 'You may have Clone enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield.', '[+1]: Chandra, the Firebrand deals 1 damage to any target.\\n[−2]: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\\n[−6]: Chandra, the Firebrand deals 6 damage to each of up to six targets.', '[+1]: Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\\n[−3]: Draw cards equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\\n[−6]: Create a 6/6 green Wurm creature token for each land you control.', '[+1]: Draw a card. Target player mills a card.\\n[0]: Target player mills ten cards.\\n[−7]: Any number of target players each draw twenty cards.', '[+1]: Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature.\\n[−3]: Target creature gains flying and double strike until end of turn.\\n[−8]: Create X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens, where X is your life total.', '[+1]: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n[−3]: Target creature gets +X/+X or -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Swamps you control.\\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "Swamps you control have \'{T}: Add {B}{B}{B}{B}.\'"', "[+3]: Destroy target noncreature permanent.\\n[−2]: Gain control of target creature.\\n[−9]: Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker deals 7 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards seven cards, then sacrifices seven permanents.", '{1}, {T}, Discard a card: You gain 4 life.\\n{1}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Create a 0/1 white Goat creature token.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', '{1}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Chronomaton.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Arms Dealer deals 4 damage to target creature.', "{2}, {T}: You gain 5 life. Shuffle Elixir of Immortality and your graveyard into their owner's library.", "{2}: Equipped creature gains hexproof until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's blue.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{2}: Regenerate equipped creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's black.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{2}{U}, {T}: Put Void Stalker and target creature on top of their owners' libraries, then those players shuffle their libraries.", '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Gem of Becoming: Search your library for an Island card, a Swamp card, and a Mountain card. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{R}, Sacrifice Torch Fiend: Destroy target artifact.', '{T}, Discard a card: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile target player's graveyard.", '{T}: Add three mana of any one color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Put a pressure counter on Hellion Crucible.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Remove two pressure counters from Hellion Crucible and sacrifice it: Create a 4/4 red Hellion creature token with haste. (It can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', '{T}: Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', '{T}: Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.\\n{T}: Target creature blocks this turn if able.', '{T}: Untap target Forest.', '{U}, {T}: Target player mills two cards.', '{U}: Watercourser gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{X}, {T}: Target player mills X cards.']
flavor: ['"\'Here lies our beloved Gartu, the gentlest of all men.\' Ooh, I love irony."\\n—Jadar, ghoulcaller of Nephalia', '"\'Utterly\' is my favorite way to destroy something."\\n—Chandra Nalaar', '"A long and difficult incision revealed that all vital organs are housed in the head, save for a long chain of stomachs, forty in all, leading from its throat to the end of the tail."\\n—Mulak Ffar, *Vastwood Biodiversity*', '"Ajani goes where he is needed most and in his name we keep his lands safe."', '"Always carry two spears."\\n—Mokgar, Kalonian hunter', '"Barnacles are the sea\'s final defense."\\n—Garild, merfolk mage', '"Beware an eddy where there should be none or a stretch that flows too fast or too slow."\\n—Old Fishbones, Martyne river guide', '"Bottled life. Not as tasty as I\'m used to, rather stale, but it has the same effect."\\n—Baron Sengir', '"Don\'t get any ideas."', '"Don\'t trust your eyes, for mages are skilled in deception. Trust only in your faith. It will wipe everything clean."\\n—Lila, Erunian priest', '"Don\'t worry. I\'m not going to deprive you of all your secrets. Just your most precious one."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Duty, honor, and valor are either in your heart or they are not. You will never know for certain until you are tested."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"Fear holds no place in faith\'s battle plan."', '"Feeding a normal army is a problem of logistics. With zombies, it is an asset. Feeding is why they fight. Feeding is why they are feared."\\n—Jadar, ghoulcaller of Nephalia', '"Fire set free is a fearsome force—destructive, merciless, always hungry. Given direction, it is much worse."\\n—Jeflin, Vastwood shaman', '"For my enemies, one death. For my allies, many."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"From a tiny sprout, the greatest trees grow and flourish. May the seeds of your mind be equally fruitful."', '"Guaranteed to leave your enemies sufficiently stabbed, bitten, cleaved, or exploded."\\n—Grezkrick\'s Emporium motto', '"Guilty."', '"He displays a perverse charisma fueled by avarice. Highly dangerous. Recommend civil sanctions."\\n—Agmand Sarv, Azorius hussar', '"He has learned much in his long years. And unlike selfish humans, he\'s willing to share."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"How truly vast this city must be, that I have traveled so far and seen so much, yet never once found the place where the buildings fail."', '"I asked if they wanted to do things the easy way. I meant easy for me."', '"I can call an army to my side in the blink of an eye. Best not blink."', '"I deal so often in rotting corpses that when I come across the freshly dead . . . why, it\'s like my birthday come early."\\n—Nevinyrral, necromancer', '"I fear no army or beast, but only the morning fog. Our assault can survive everything else."\\n—Lord Hilneth', '"I give them dreams so wondrous that they hesitate to return to the world of the conscious."\\n—Garild, merfolk mage', '"I have attuned the staff to your screams so that only I may benefit from your pain."\\n—Volux, disciple of Nin', '"I thought the wind was ushering me to my final destination, but it lifted me to my feet and I fought on."\\n—Idrus, war priest of Thune', '"I will uphold the law, and no manner of foe will stop me."', '"If it wasn\'t a blackened, stinking, melted abomination before, it certainly is now."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"If you live on a giant\'s back, there\'s only one individual you\'ll ever need to fear."\\n—Gaddock Teeg', '"In the wild, white fur like mine is an aberration. We lack natural camouflage, but the inability to hide encourages other strengths."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"It is the fate of the weak to fall."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"It preys on other birds. And drakelings. And drakes. Pretty much anything that crosses its flight path is fair game."\\n—Amira, skycaptain of Thune', '"It\'s actually quite simple, but since you\'ve only recently begun to walk upright, it may take some time to explain."\\n—Jace Beleren, to Garruk Wildspeaker', '"It\'s only torture if you\'re strong enough to survive. Otherwise, it\'s a simple, gruesome death. I\'m happy either way."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Let all we have buried be buried forever."\\n—Seton, centaur druid', '"Let nothing own the skies but the wind."\\n—Dejara, Giltwood druid', '"Let the land dwellers know the coast is no longer the border between our realms. A new age of empire has begun."', '"Life\'s essence is a nectar unlike any I tasted when I lived as a mortal."\\n—Zul Ashur, lich lord', '"Looks like that wasn\'t darksteel after all."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"Lord Bolas has shown me how each miserable little life holds untold resources."', '"May starving fleas birth a thousand generations on your stubborn hide, cow!"\\n—Bruse Tarl, Goma Fada nomad', '"My \'condition\' is a trial. The weak are consumed by it. The strong transcend it."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"My cause is power, and at the altar of power I will gladly forfeit my soul."', '"My one regret is that I have mastered an art that leaves its audience unable to applaud."', '"Nature can\'t be stopped. It rips and tears at Ravnica\'s tallest buildings to claim its place in the sun."', '"Never underestimate the ability of natural forces to adapt to unnatural influences."\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcerer', '"No life is without meaning. No living thing is too small to be strong."', '"No rest. No mercy. No matter what."\\n—Memorial inscription', '"Not bad, but I can think of a better use for that."', '"One bite from that dog will send you to the healer\'s tent for days."\\n—Watchmaster Finn of An Karras', '"One\'s blade is only as sharp as one\'s conviction."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"Only by the bravery of those who put loyalty above glory is our home kept safe."\\n—Elspeth Tirel', '"Only the bravest are worthy of our blessing."', '"Pathetic. You might as well have protected your treasures with a paper box and some string."', '"Planeswalking cannot be taught. Either you see the doors or you do not."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Rage is a dangerous weapon. Your enemies will try to use your anger against you. Use it against them first."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"Removing the encumbrance of useless brain tissue grants several advantages: a slight increase in mobility, a response of revulsion and horror from the enemy, and, in the case of large specimens, room for passengers."\\n—Zul Ashur, lich lord', '"Saprolings need only a host to feed upon. Numbers will take care of the rest."\\n—Ghave, Guru of Spores', '"Serra isn\'t dead. She lives on through me."', '"She rose above me, and in that moment Varrik the Bloody died and I was born."\\n—Varrik the Just', '"Still alive? No matter. I\'ll leave you as a warning to others who would oppose me."\\n—Vish Kal, Blood Arbiter', '"The best denials are simply that: a beginning and end unchanged, a dream with no memory."', '"The centaurs are truly free. Never will they be tamed by temptation or controlled by fear. They live in total harmony, a feat not yet achieved by our kind."\\n—Ramal, sage of Westgate', '"The forest will surround you with its life if you are still and calm."', '"The key to unlocking this puzzle is within you."\\n—Doriel, mentor of Mistral Isle', '"The merfolk of the Pearl Trident have risen from the waves since the earliest days, at times allies to humans, other times enemies. Now their power is cresting again, and who can say which way the new tide will flow."\\n—Kalis, Onean scholar', '"The more dangerous, the better."', '"The mountain\'s fire surges beneath your feet, demanding release. Can you not feel it?"', '"The need for the pack is bred in their bones. Their true strength will not show itself for any other purpose."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"The sacred might of Thune thunders in my soul."', '"The seas are vast, but the skies are even more so. Why be content with one kingdom when I can rule them both?"', '"The sky holds vast oceans. They are at your fingertips if you know how to call them."\\n—Talrand, sky summoner', '"The things I once imagined would be my greatest achievements were only the first steps toward a future I can only begin to fathom."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"The union of sea and sky makes a perfect cover."\\n—Talrand, sky summoner', '"There are some secrets so dark no human mind should ever contain them. Interested?"\\n—Nefarox, Overlord of Grixis', '"There is no greater folly than standing against me."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"They\'re easy enough to find. Question is, are you sure you want to find one?"\\n—Juruk, Kalonian tracker', '"Thirsty?"\\n—Drunvalus, hydromancer', '"Those dragons grow fast. For a while they feed on squirrels and goblins and then suddenly you\'re missing a mammoth."\\n—Hurdek, Mazar mammoth trainer', '"Time is a vigilant tyrant, but there are those who have broken free of its gaze."\\n—Laikas, Erunian monk', '"To the unskilled, it appears as blurred patches of distorted light. Few have seen its true form."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"We are Odric\'s sword. We strike without fear, for his mind has divined how our foe will be slain."', '"We won\'t sit like lazy gob-slugs waiting for death to come to us. We\'ll bring death, shiny sharp, to our enemies."\\n—Krenko, mob boss', '"We\'ll scale these cliffs, traverse Brittle Bridge, and then fight our way down the volcanic slopes on the other side."\\n"Isn\'t the shortest route through the canyon?"\\n"Yes."\\n"So shouldn\'t we—"\\n"No."', '"What I need is your blood. What I don\'t need is your permission."', '"What a pity. You should have written it down."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"What good is having all the right answers if you have them at all the wrong times?"', '"What you attempt to pull from the Æther, I can spread onto the wind."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"When a phoenix nests in a volcano, we rejoice, for it means a hundred years of war."\\n—Golmak, Keldon warlord', '"When we fail to see the beauty in every tree, we are no better than humans."\\n—Saelia, elvish scout', '"When your cities and trinkets crumble, only nature will remain."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"Where will you run when I punish you with the very ground you flee on?"\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Who among you has the courage to face certain death? Who will heed my call?"\\n—Rayel Vanger, Firstblade of Thune', '"Words of power never disappear. They sleep, awaiting those with the will to rouse them."', '"You don\'t find many old werewolf hunters."\\n—Paulin, trapper of Somberwald', '"You will fully understand fear when you discover it is the final thing you put your faith in."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"You\'re in luck. I brought enough to share."\\n—Chandra Nalaar', '"Your first reaction may be to stand very still and hope she didn\'t see you. Trust me, she did."\\n—Endril, Kalonian naturalist', '"Your laws, like your bones, were made to be broken."', '"Your life will set with the sun."', '"Your mind was a curious mix of madness and genius. I just took away the genius."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"Your patheitc ideas lie in shambles, Planeswalker. Where is your arrogant pride now?"\\n—Nicol Bolas', 'A beetle on your shoulder\\n—Elvish expression meaning "a blessing of luck"', 'A fool knows no fear. A hero shows no fear.', 'A smaller cousin to the dragon, drakes are often seen at the side of powerful wizards who use them as airborne eyes and ears.', 'A spike and a maul are needed to crack their shells, but the taste is worth the effort.', 'A true scribe devotes an entire lifetime to the creation of a single volume, a masterpiece as unique as its maker.', 'After Talrand conquered the depths of Shandalar, his ambitions drove him skyward, joined by servants whose drive and curiosity equaled his own.', 'An invasion weapon of ages past, the glistening oil contained the blueprints of countless atrocities.', 'Approach in peace or not at all.', "As she shepherds the faithful, the angel's radiance is a shield of salvation.", "Baby dragons can't figure out humans—if they didn't want to be killed, why were they made of meat and treasure?", 'By the time the spider comes to slurp up its dinner, its victims have been partially dissolved by acidic silk.', 'Devils redecorate every room with fire.', "Devouring books is only the beginning. The librarian's next.", "Dominaria's most extravagant crypt nevertheless holds an empty grave.", "Eagles make fine mounts, but they're too proud to carry anyone for long.", 'Even dragons fear its silken strands.', 'Even the smallest spark may set a world ablaze.', "Even what is lost beyond recall returns when coaxed by a dryad's hand.", 'Follow the light. In its absence, follow her.', 'For the first time in his life, Grakk felt a little warm and fuzzy inside.', 'Goblins are eager to follow orders, especially when those orders involve stealing, hurting, annoying, eating, destroying, or swearing.', 'He always drops a little trinket into the bay as thanks to the merfolk who taught him all his best tricks.', 'He knows the name of every elf born in the last four centuries. More importantly, they all know his.', 'His mind knows no fear, registering only the burning impulse to destroy.', "If a baloth isn't hungry, it's dead.", 'In the abstract memories of the Iquati, Jace found interesting ideas to improve upon.', 'It counts down your last few moments of sanity.', 'It returns eager to share the feast of blood and gore with its ghoulish master.', 'Its sting hurts, but death is strangely painless.', "Keldon warriors don't need signals to tell them when to attack. They need signals to tell them when to stop.", 'Kitesailing is a way of life—and without practice, the end of it.', 'Like most giant monsters villagers worship as gods, it proves a fickle master.', "Liliana's voice carries far, reaching beyond the cold pall of death.", 'Little agonies pave the way to greater power.', 'Masters of the arcane savor a delicious irony. Their study of deep and complex arcana leads to such a simple end: the ability to say merely yes or no.', 'Measure once, cut twice.', 'Mercy is for those who keep their distance.', 'Most clocks measure time, but a few measure everything.', 'Nicol Bolas gives power to those who will abuse it most.', 'No guts, no glory.', 'Not to be. That is the answer.', "Now you see it, now you're gone.", 'On the third night, the villagers destroyed their clocks. The sounds of whirring gears and chiming metal held only dread for them.', 'Once guarded by the Knights of the Reliquary, the tower stands now protected only by its own remoteness, its dusty treasures open to plunder by anyone.', 'One face, two minds.', 'Only a madman could create such a door. Only an imbecile would open it.', 'Over such beauty, wars are fought. With such power, wars are won.', 'Rhoxes who live long enough to retire from war lend support with their extensive knowledge of combat injuries.', 'Say hello to your new friend.', 'Small enough to penetrate the narrowest crack in a castle wall and numerous enough to hack apart a griffin.', 'Some say they are the weapons of heroes fallen in battle, eager for one last chance at glory.', 'Somehow goblins found a tactical advantage by sending a clown to war.', "Sometimes you die a glorious death with your sword held high. Sometimes you're just target practice.", 'The arcane academies along the coast were powerless to protect themselves from the brazen raiders of the Kapsho Seas.', 'The drums of war stir the hearts of all who fight for righteousness.', 'The falcon is the picture of nobility, maintaining a regal bearing even as it conducts the bloody business of war.', 'The flame of anger is hard to douse once lit.', 'The forest can seem like a dense maze. Those who travel the canopy know otherwise.', 'The mountains bend to no one.', 'The pup looked over the treetops, eyeing the man who just yesterday had kicked her. Suddenly, her hunger was infused with pure delight.', 'There is no loftier ambition than the pursuit of knowledge.', "They'll attack whatever's in front of them—as long as you tell them where that is.", 'Those who dare stand in its path are either brave or mindless. Or in the case of goblins, both.', 'Those who raged most bitterly at the world in life are cursed to roam the nether realms in death.', 'Though the executioner did not speak, the villagers got the message.', 'Through the smoke and flames it hunts, sniffing out the panicked and confused.', "To a goblin, value is based on the four S's: shiny, stabby, smelly, and super smelly.", "Venom is nature's way of redressing the imbalance between weak and mighty.", 'When he began to curse what he held holy, his strength grew unrivaled.', 'When the meek charge into battle, courage becomes infectious.', 'With an armory of light, even the squire may champion her people.', 'With great power comes great risk of getting yourself killed.', 'Without the interfering hands of civilization, nature will always shape itself to its own needs.']
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Allen Williams', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Austin Hsu', 'Brad Rigney', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Charles Urbach', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Dos Santos', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'David Rapoza', 'Dermot Power', 'Donato Giancola', 'E. M. Gist', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Erica Yang', 'Eytan Zana', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Iain McCaig', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Ioan Dumitrescu', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'Jon Foster', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Marco Nelor', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael C. Hayes', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Paolo Parente & Brian Snõddy', 'Paul Bonner', 'Pete Venters', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Ray Lago', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robert Bliss', 'Robh Ruppel', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Luke', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'Winona Nelson', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'jD', 'rk post']
