rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The card does not go to the graveyard first.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The power of the creature is checked on activation and on resolution. If the targeted creature’s power is not 4 or greater on resolution, the ability doesn’t resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'You can cast Serra Avenger during another player’s first, second, or third turns of the game if some other effect (such as Vedalken Orrery) enables that.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the game is restarted (by Karn Liberated), you can’t cast Serra Avenger in your first, second, or third turn in the new game.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Serra Avenger cares about how many turns you have taken, not necessarily how many turns the game has had, in case you take an extra turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Clone enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is a token, Clone copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Clone is not a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Clone), then your Clone enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Clone copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "If Clone somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Clone can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Clone enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Clone\'s ability doesn\'t target the chosen creature."}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the targeted nonland permanent forever.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If there are no nonland permanents on the battlefield other than an Oblivion Ring, and the card it exiled was another Oblivion Ring, casting a third Oblivion Ring will result in an involuntary infinite loop that will end the game in a draw (unless someone chooses to break it by putting another nonland permanent onto the battlefield or destroying one of the Oblivion Rings, for example).'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything, but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled forever.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted abilities will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted bonuses last until end of turn. If an effect creates an additional combat phase during your turn, a creature that attacked alone during the first combat phase will still have its exalted bonuses in that new phase. If a creature attacks alone during the second combat phase, all your exalted abilities will trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures, but then all but one are removed from combat, your exalted abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger. The bonuses are given to the attacking creature, not to the permanent with exalted. Ultimately, the attacking creature will wind up with +1/+1 for each of your exalted abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate’s exalted abilities won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they’re ignored by exalted abilities. They won’t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The creature you target with the last ability will become tapped before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted abilities will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Exalted bonuses last until end of turn. If an effect creates an additional combat phase during your turn, a creature that attacked alone during the first combat phase will still have its exalted bonuses in that new phase. If a creature attacks alone during the second combat phase, all your exalted abilities will trigger again.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you attack with multiple creatures, but then all but one are removed from combat, your exalted abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you declare exactly one creature as an attacker, each exalted ability on each permanent you control (including, perhaps, the attacking creature itself) will trigger. The bonuses are given to the attacking creature, not to the permanent with exalted. Ultimately, the attacking creature will wind up with +1/+1 for each of your exalted abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, a creature “attacks alone” if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker by your entire team. If you control that attacking creature, your exalted abilities will trigger but your teammate’s exalted abilities won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Some effects put creatures onto the battlefield attacking. Since those creatures were never declared as attackers, they’re ignored by exalted abilities. They won’t cause exalted abilities to trigger. If any exalted abilities have already triggered (because exactly one creature was declared as an attacker), those abilities will resolve as normal even though there may now be multiple attackers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'The control-change effect has no duration. It will last until the game ends or the affected creature leaves the battlefield. It may be superseded by a later control-change effect.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'For the third ability, if the player is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt, no cards will be discarded, and no permanents will be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the damage from Nicol Bolas’s third ability is prevented or redirected, the rest of the effect will still happen. Specifically, the number of cards discarded and permanents sacrificed isn’t tied to the amount of damage dealt.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Forest or Plains, not for lands named Forest or Plains. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Hallowed Fountain (a nonbasic land with the land types Plains and Island), Sunpetal Grove will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Island or Swamp, not for lands named Island or Swamp. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Blood Crypt (a nonbasic land with the land types Swamp and Mountain), Drowned Catacomb will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Mountain or Forest, not for lands named Mountain or Forest. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Temple Garden (a nonbasic land with the land types Forest and Plains), Rootbound Crag will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Plains or Island, not for lands named Plains or Island. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Watery Grave (a nonbasic land with the land types Island and Swamp), Glacial Fortress will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Swamp or Mountain, not for lands named Swamp or Mountain. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Stomping Ground (a nonbasic land with the land types Mountain and Forest), Dragonskull Summit will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s first ability affects only other Elves you control. However, Elvish Archdruid\'s second ability counts all Elves you control — including itself."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Elvish Archdruid\'s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature has intimidate, what colors it is matters only as the defending player declares blockers. Once it\'s blocked, changing its colors won\'t change that."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Intimidate looks at the current colors of a creature that has it. Normally, Bladetusk Boar can\'t be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or red creatures. If it\'s turned blue, then it can\'t be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or blue creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Destroying a blocking creature won\'t cause any of the creatures it was blocking to become unblocked. They won\'t deal combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker (unless they have trample)."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Even though Trumpet Blast affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking as Trumpet Blast resolves will receive the bonus. In other words, casting it before you\'ve declared attackers usually won\'t do anything."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Captain of the Watch grants +1/+1 and vigilance to all other Soldier creatures you control, not just the ones its ability puts onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Glorious Charge affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn. It won’t affect permanents that become creatures later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage doesn’t prevent damage that would be dealt to planeswalkers you control.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage has no effect on damage that’s already been dealt.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage prevents all damage, not just combat damage, that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Safe Passage will prevent damage dealt to creatures that weren’t on the battlefield at the time it resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'To work as an evasion ability, an attacking creature must already have flying when the declare blockers step begins. Once a creature has become blocked, giving it flying won’t change that.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish casting that spell or activating that ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus will give itself +2/+1 and flying even if it’s somehow not a Vampire.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you sacrifice an attacking or blocking creature during the declare blockers step, it won’t deal combat damage. If you wait until the combat damage step, but the creature you wish to sacrifice is dealt lethal damage, it’ll be destroyed before you get a chance to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Bloodthrone Vampire to activate its own ability, but it won’t be on the battlefield to get the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Harbor Serpent’s abilities care about lands with the land type Island, not necessarily lands named Island.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The second ability checks how many Islands are on the battlefield (regardless of who controls them) only as attackers are declared. Once Harbor Serpent is declared as an attacker, it will continue to attack even if the number of Islands on the battlefield falls below five.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If Garruk’s Packleader and another creature with power 3 or greater enter the battlefield under your control at the same time, the ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The ability checks the power of each creature as it enters the battlefield. It will take into account counters the permanent enters the battlefield with and static abilities that affect its power (such as Flinthoof Boar’s ability). After the creature is on the battlefield, raising its power with a spell (such as Titanic Growth), an activated ability, or a triggered ability won’t cause this ability to retroactively trigger.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The creature’s power is checked only to see if the ability triggers. It doesn’t matter what the creature’s power is when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the copy says that it affects "you," it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an "opponent," it affects an opponent of the copy\\\'s controller, not an opponent of the original spell\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the spell Reverberate copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the spell Reverberate copies is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "Reverberate can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn\'t matter who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'When Reverberate resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it with Reverberate, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If the targeted spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), you can’t choose a different mode.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you cast Redirect targeting a spell that targets a spell on the stack (like Cancel does, for example), you can’t change that spell’s target to itself. You can, however, change that spell’s target to Redirect. If you do, that spell won’t resolve when it tries to resolve because Redirect will have left the stack by then.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Redirect can target any spell, not just an instant or sorcery spell. For example, you could use it to change the target of an Aura spell. However, if the targeted spell has no targets (for example, if it’s an instant or sorcery spell that doesn’t specifically use the word “target,” or if it’s a creature spell), Redirect won’t have any effect on it.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'Paying the activation cost of Elixir of Immortality’s ability doesn’t cause it to leave the battlefield. If you have a way to untap it, you can activate the ability multiple times in response to itself.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'As the ability resolves, you’ll shuffle Elixir of Immortality into its owner’s library directly from the battlefield, if it’s still there.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Elixir of Immortality is in your graveyard at the time the ability resolves, you’ll still wind up shuffling it into your library because you shuffle your entire graveyard into your library. If it’s anywhere else by that time, including in another player’s graveyard, it remains where it is and you shuffle just your graveyard into your library.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you gain control of another player’s Elixir of Immortality and activate it, the Elixir of Immortality will be shuffled into its owner’s library and the cards in your graveyard will be shuffled into your library. You are considered to have shuffled each affected library (even if, as a shortcut, each player physically shuffles their own library).'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The ability is mandatory. You must draw a card when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once each time Scroll Thief deals combat damage to a player, regardless of how much damage it deals.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Chandra’s second ability creates a delayed triggered ability that will copy the next instant or sorcery spell you cast that turn, regardless of whether that spell has targets.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the spell Chandra copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Consume Spirit does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the spell Chandra copies is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'When the delayed trigger resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'When you activate Chandra’s last ability, you choose up to six target creatures and/or players. No damage is divided, and Chandra can’t deal more than 6 damage to any one target. Chandra deals 6 damage to each target that is still legal when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if you sacrifice a 3/3 creature to cast Fling after activating Chandra’s second ability, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Consider only the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra when determining if it has trample, not its power and toughness. For example, a Primordial Hydra with six +1/+1 counters on it that’s been the target of Titanic Growth (giving it +4/+4) would not have trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For Garruk’s second ability, the greatest power among creatures you control is determined when that ability begins resolving.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'For Garruk’s third ability, the number of Wurm tokens you put onto the battlefield is determined when that ability begins resolving.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the greatest power among creatures you control is 0 or less, you’ll draw no cards. You won’t discard any cards this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Jace’s third ability causes a player to draw more cards than are left in their library, that player loses the game as a state-based action. If this ability causes all players to do this, the game is a draw.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you activate Jace’s first ability, and the player is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you target yourself with Jace’s first ability, you’ll draw a card first, then put the top card of your library into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If the creature targeted by Dark Favor is an illegal target when Dark Favor tries to resolve, Dark Favor won’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield and its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Discarding a card is part of the cost to activate Rummaging Goblin\'s ability. If you don\'t have a card in your hand, you can\'t pay this part of the cost and you can\'t activate the ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Giving a creature first strike after creatures with first strike deal combat damage doesn\'t prevent that creature from dealing combat damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Magmaquake doesn\'t target any creature or planeswalker. For example, it will deal damage to a creature without flying that has hexproof."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "The effect is based on the number of Swamps you control when Mutilate resolves. Only creatures on the battlefield at that time will be affected. The effect won\'t change later in the turn, even if the number of Swamps you control changes."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Thragtusk\'s second ability will trigger no matter what zone Thragtusk goes to."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'A permanent card is a card that could be put onto the battlefield. Specifically, it means an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card (instant and sorcery cards aren’t permanent cards).'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Permanent cards that were put into your graveyard from anywhere else, such as a card that was discarded, stay in the graveyard. Permanent cards that you gained control of and went to another player’s graveyard from the battlefield will likewise stay in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Permanent spells that were countered earlier in the turn never entered the battlefield, so they won’t return to the battlefield because of Faith’s Reward.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You choose what an Aura card put onto the battlefield this way will enchant. You can’t choose any permanent cards entering the battlefield at the same time as that Aura. If there’s nothing legal for the Aura to enchant, it stays in the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Activating Harbor Bandit’s ability after it’s been blocked won’t cause it to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'After the first ability resolves, the creature attacks only if it’s able to do so as the declare attackers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'After the second ability resolves, the creature blocks only if it’s able to do so as the declare blockers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, or no creatures are attacking that player or a planeswalker controlled by that player, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block in that case either.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The controller of the creature targeted by the first ability chooses which player or planeswalker that creature attacks.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The controller of the creature targeted by the second ability chooses which attacking creature that creature blocks.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'All blocking declarations must still be legal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature block and you choose for that creature to block, its controller can choose to pay that cost or not. If that player decides to not pay that cost, you must propose a new set of blocking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "You can decide that a creature won\'t block."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Any player can respond to Mindclaw Shaman’s triggered ability. However, once that ability starts resolving and the target opponent reveals their hand, players can’t respond until after the ability finishes resolving. For example, the opponent can’t cast the instant or sorcery card you choose to cast in order to stop you from casting it.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the card has X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If you can’t cast any instant or sorcery card (perhaps because there are no legal targets available) or if you choose not to cast one, then Mindclaw Shaman’s ability finishes resolving and the game moves on.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The card goes to its owner’s graveyard after it resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), not yours.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You cast the card from the opponent’s hand immediately. Ignore timing restrictions based on the card’s type. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this card] only during combat,” must be followed.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Battle of Wits has an “intervening ‘if’ clause.” This means that if you don’t have 200 or more cards in your library at the beginning of your upkeep, the ability won’t trigger. If the ability does trigger, but you have fewer than 200 cards in your library when the ability resolves, the ability will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'In tournaments, you must be able to shuffle your entire deck within a reasonable amount of time.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Battleflight Eagle’s ability is mandatory, although you can choose Battleflight Eagle as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Because discarding a card is an additional cost, you can’t cast Wild Guess if you have no other cards in hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Blood Reckoning will trigger once for each creature that attacks you or a planeswalker you control.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Creatures that are put onto the battlefield attacking were never declared as attackers and won’t cause Blood Reckoning to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Chandra’s Fury targets only the player, not any creature. Chandra’s Fury will deal 1 damage to a creature with hexproof, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Cleaver Riot affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Each creature controlled by an opponent blocks only if it’s able to do so as the declare blockers step begins. If, at that time, the creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, or no creatures are attacking that player or a planeswalker controlled by that player, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block in that case either.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Each creature your opponents control blocks if able, even if that creature wasn’t on the battlefield or wasn’t controlled by an opponent when Predatory Rampage resolved.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only creatures you control when Predatory Rampage resolves will get +3/+3. Creatures that enter the battlefield or that you gain control of later in the turn are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Predatory Rampage doesn’t force any creature to attack.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Your opponent still chooses which attacking creature each creature they control blocks.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Elderscale Wurm’s last ability doesn’t affect the loss or payment of life.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Elderscale Wurm’s last ability doesn’t prevent damage. It only changes the result of damage dealt to you. For example, a creature will lifelink that deals damage to you will still cause its controller to gain life, even if that damage would reduce your life total to less than 7.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If damage is dealt to you and Elderscale Wurm at the same time, and that damage is enough to destroy Elderscale Wurm and reduce your life total to 7 or less, Elderscale Wurm’s ability will still apply. For example, if you have 10 life and a spell deals 10 damage to you and 10 damage to Elderscale Wurm, you’ll end up at 7 life and Elderscale Wurm will be destroyed.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If you have less than 7 life, damage dealt to you reduces your life total as normal.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'In a Commander game, combat damage you’re dealt by a commander is still tracked, even if it doesn’t change your life total.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Fungal Sprouting doesn’t target any creature. The greatest power among creatures you control is determined when Fungal Sprouting resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If Downpour targets more than one creature, and some but not all of the creatures are illegal targets by the time Downpour resolves, the remaining legal targets will be tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'If Griffin Protector enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other creatures, its ability will trigger once for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-09-09\', \'text\': "If more than one creature enters the battlefield at the same time, or if one or more other creatures enter the battlefield at the same time that Griffin Protector enters the battlefield, Griffin Protector\'s triggered ability triggers for each of them."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If Healer of the Pride enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other creatures, its ability will trigger once for each of those creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If Void Stalker leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the target creature will be shuffled into its owner’s library but Void Stalker will remain wherever it is.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creature will leave the battlefield and no library will be shuffled.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can activate Void Stalker’s ability targeting a creature you control, including Void Stalker itself. In that case, only you will shuffle your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If an attacking creature loses haste, perhaps because Fervor leaves the battlefield after attackers have been declared, it won’t be removed from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If an effect makes War Falcon a Knight or a Soldier, it will be able to attack even if it’s the only creature you control.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'To attack with War Falcon, you must control a Knight or a Soldier when you declare attackers. Once War Falcon is attacking, it won’t be removed from combat if at any point you no longer control a Knight or Soldier.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If an effect sets your life total to a specific number, and that number is higher than your current life total, the effect will cause you to gain life equal to the difference. Rhox Faithmender will then double that number. For example, if you have 3 life and an effect says that your life total “becomes 10,” your life total will actually become 17.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If you control two Rhox Faithmenders, life you gain will be multiplied by four. Three Rhox Faithmenders will multiply any life gain by eight, and so on.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, only Rhox Faithmender’s controller is affected by it. If that player’s teammate gains life, Rhox Faithmender will have no effect, even when that life gain is applied to the shared team life total.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If one of Spelltwine’s targets is illegal when Spelltwine tries to resolve, you’ll still exile and copy the remaining legal target.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the card has X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Spelltwine has two targets: the instant or sorcery card in your graveyard and the one in an opponent’s graveyard. You can’t cast Spelltwine unless you can choose both legal targets.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The copies are created in exile and cast from exile. The cards remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The copy you cast first will already be on the stack when you cast the other copy. If that spell targets a spell, you may choose the first copy as a legal target.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can cast the copies in either order.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the creature card is an illegal target when Vile Rebirth tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t put a Zombie token onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the player has fewer than X cards in their library, they put all of them into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the player has no nonland cards in their hand, you can still search that player’s library and have them shuffle it.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The cards you’re searching for must be found and exiled if they’re in the graveyard because it’s a public zone. Finding those cards in the hand and library is optional, because those zones are hidden (even if the hand is temporarily revealed).'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the target permanent or player is an illegal target when Essence Drain tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than three cards in your library when Augur of Bolas’s ability resolves, you’ll look at the remaining cards. This won’t cause you to lose the game as you haven’t drawn from an empty library.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You don’t reveal the other two cards, nor do you reveal their order on the bottom of the library.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If your life total is greater than 1 when Worldfire resolves, the change in life total will count as life loss. Other effects that interact with life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'These actions are performed in order, but no triggered abilities resolve in between them and no player may cast spells or activate abilities in between them. This means that if a permanent’s ability triggers on a player losing life, that permanent will be exiled first and won’t be on the battlefield when your life total becomes 1. Leaves-the-battlefield triggers won’t resolve until you’re done resolving Worldfire entirely.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Worldfire won’t be exiled. It will go to your graveyard as the final part of its resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Liliana’s emblem doesn’t remove any other abilities of Swamps you control.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'When you activate Liliana’s second ability, you choose only the target creature. You choose whether that creature gets +X/+X or -X/-X when the ability resolves. The value of X is determined by the number of Swamps you control when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can activate Liliana’s first ability even if your library contains no Swamp cards (or you don’t want to find one). You’ll still search your library and shuffle it.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Each of Liliana’s abilities refers to lands (or land cards) with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink aren’t cumulative. Activating Arctic Aven’s ability more than once during a single turn won’t cause you to gain more life.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Nefarox’s last ability will trigger and resolve before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only creatures controlled by the player when Public Execution resolves will get -2/-0. Creatures that enter the battlefield under that player’s control or that the player gains control of later in the turn are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Public Execution targets only the creature it destroys. If that creature is an illegal target when Public Execution tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creature will get -2/-0.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the target creature regenerates or has indestructible, each other creature controlled by that creature’s controller will still get -2/-0.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Only spells and abilities that target cards in graveyards will be affected. Abilities that don’t target cards in graveyards (like the one Tormod’s Crypt has) can still affect those cards.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The last ability only works when Ground Seal is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Reckless Brute attacks only if it’s able to do so as the declare attackers step begins. If, at that time, it’s tapped, it’s affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you’re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You choose which player or planeswalker Reckless Brute attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Roaring Primadox’s ability is mandatory. When it resolves, if Roaring Primadox is the only creature you control, you must return it to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t target any creature. You choose which one to return when the ability resolves. No player can respond to this choice once the ability starts resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Slumbering Dragon’s second ability counts all +1/+1 counters on it, not just the ones added by its third ability.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Slumbering Dragon’s third ability will trigger once for each creature that attacks you or a planeswalker you control.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter is put on Slumbering Dragon before blockers are declared. This may allow Slumbering Dragon to “wake up” and block the creature that attacked and caused its ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The ability counts each Goblin you control, including Krenko itself, not just the tokens it creates.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The creature card must have one of the listed abilities, not an ability that grants one of the listed abilities to the creature. For example, you couldn’t put Prized Elephant, which has “{G}: Prized Elephant gains trample until end of turn,” on top of your library this way.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The effects of Xathrid Gorgon’s ability don’t depend on the petrification counter. If that counter is removed, the creature remains a colorless artifact with defender, and so on.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The number of Cat tokens you put onto the battlefield is equal to your life total when the third ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can activate the first ability without a target. You’ll still put one loyalty counter on Ajani when you activate the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The number of basic land cards you put onto the battlefield is equal to the number of lands you control when Boundless Realms begins resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as the ability begins resolving. If the other creature is no longer on the battlefield, its last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'This change of life total counts as life gain or life loss, as appropriate. Other effects that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Veilborn Ghoul’s ability triggers only if it’s in your graveyard at the moment the Swamp enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, count the number of instances of exalted among permanents you control. After those abilities resolve, that’s how many times the creature will get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Yeva’s Forcemage’s ability is mandatory, although you can choose Yeva’s Forcemage as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Yeva’s ability applies to green creature cards in any zone, provided something is allowing you to cast them. For example, if the top card of your library is a green creature card and you control Garruk’s Horde, you can cast that card as though it had flash.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You still pay the costs for green creature cards you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can cast Mind Sculpt no matter how many cards are in the opponent’s library. If there are fewer than seven, the opponent will put all of them into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can choose Bond Beetle as the target of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Arms Dealer to activate its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you cast Flames of the Firebrand, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. (In other words, as you put the spell on the stack, you choose whether to have it deal 3 damage to a single target, 2 damage to one target and 1 damage to another target, or 1 damage to each of three targets.)'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You don’t have to find all three cards, even if they’re present in your library. For example, you can activate the ability just to find an Island card and a Swamp card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "If Stormtide Leviathan loses its abilities, all lands on the battlefield (including those that enter the battlefield later on) will still be Islands in addition to their other types and will still be able to tap to produce {U}. The way continuous effects work, Stormtide Leviathan\'s type-changing ability is applied before the effect that removes that ability is applied."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Islandwalk cares about lands with the land type Island, not necessarily lands named Island.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Stormtide Leviathan\\\'s second ability causes each land on the battlefield to have the land type Island. Each land thus has the ability "{T}: Add {U}." Nothing else changes about those lands, including their names, other subtypes, other abilities, and whether they\\\'re legendary or basic.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Stormtide Leviathan\'s third ability affects all creatures with neither flying nor islandwalk, regardless of who controls them. They can\'t attack any player or planeswalker."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If the creature targeted by Divine Favor is an illegal target when Divine Favor tries to resolve, Divine Favor won’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield and its enters-the-battlefield ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Static and triggered abilities are unaffected by Encrust.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The permanent can be untapped by other spells and abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Cower in Fear affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under their control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "A pile can have no cards in it. In this case, you\'ll choose whether to put all the revealed cards into your hand or into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "In multiplayer games, you choose an opponent to separate the cards when the ability resolves. This doesn\'t target that opponent. Because the cards are revealed, all players may see the cards and offer opinions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You (not your opponent) choose which pile to put into your hand and which to put into your graveyard.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Fog Bank’s prevention effect isn’t considered while assigning combat damage from a creature with trample. For example, if it blocks a 5/5 creature with trample, that creature’s controller must assign 2 of that creature’s combat damage to Fog Bank and the remainder can be assigned to the defending player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Jace’s Phantasm is dealt lethal damage at the same time as an opponent’s creature, and that creature will become that opponent’s tenth card in their graveyard, Jace’s Phantasm will be destroyed before it gets +4/+4. This is because all creatures that have been dealt lethal damage are destroyed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, a single opponent must have ten or more cards in their graveyard for the bonus to apply, although this opponent may change over the course of the game. You don’t have to pick a single opponent; the ability will monitor each opponent’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The last ability of Jace’s Phantasm constantly monitors each opponent’s graveyard to see if the bonus applies. If the stated condition becomes no longer true, the bonus immediately stops applying.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the damage that would be dealt to a creature with flying is prevented, that creature will still be tapped. If that damage is redirected to another creature, the creature with flying will be tapped, not necessarily the creature that ultimately was dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Thundermaw Hellkite will deal 1 damage to each creature with flying your opponents control whether those creatures are tapped or untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Mark of Mutiny can target any creature, even one that you already control or that is already untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter remains on the creature after the control-changing effect ends.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Although Mogg Flunkies can\'t attack alone, other attacking creatures don\'t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. For example, Mogg Flunkies could attack an opponent and another creature could attack a planeswalker that opponent controls. Similarly, other blocking creatures don\'t have to block the same creature that Mogg Flunkies blocks."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If an effect says that Mogg Flunkies attacks or blocks if able and you control another creature able to attack or block, you must attack or block with Mogg Flunkies and that creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If you control more than one Mogg Flunkies, they can attack or block together, even if no other creatures attack or block.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Mogg Flunkies can attack or block with a creature controlled by your teammate, even if no other creatures you control are attacking or blocking.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Once Mogg Flunkies has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if you no longer control another attacking or blocking creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Timberpack Wolf may become lethal if other Timberpack Wolves leave the battlefield during that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Rancor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so it won\'t be put into a graveyard from the battlefield and its ability won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A later effect that changes the affected creature’s colors will overwrite that part of Rise from the Grave’s effect; the creature will be only the new color. The same is true about an effect that changes the affected creature’s types or subtypes.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can’t be both black and colorless.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Rise from the Grave doesn’t overwrite any previous colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another subtype.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If one of the target creatures is an illegal target when Switcheroo resolves, the exchange won’t happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the same player controls both creatures when Switcheroo resolves, nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t have to control either target.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Phylactery Lich and an artifact are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you can’t put a phylactery counter on that artifact. You must choose an artifact you control that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you control no artifacts as Phylactery Lich enters the battlefield, its first ability won’t do anything. As soon as it enters the battlefield, its last ability will trigger (unless you control some other permanent with a phylactery counter on it) and you’ll have to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Phylactery Lich’s first ability doesn’t target the artifact. No player may take actions between the time you choose an artifact and the time you put a phylactery counter on it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Phylactery Lich’s last ability checks your permanents for any phylactery counters, not just the specific one that it caused you to put on an artifact. For example, if you control two Phylactery Liches and two different artifacts with phylactery counters, neither Phylactery Lich will be sacrificed if one of those artifacts leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Phylactery Lich’s last ability is a “state trigger.” Once a state trigger triggers, it won’t trigger again as long as the ability is on the stack. If the ability is countered and the trigger condition is still true, it will immediately trigger again.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once you cast Omniscience, if it’s your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast another spell before any player can attempt to remove Omniscience with spells or abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of each spell you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The second part of Sleep’s ability affects all creatures the targeted player controls as Sleep resolves, not only the ones that Sleep actually caused to become tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Firewing Phoenix’s ability can be activated only if Firewing Phoenix is in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell puts Archaeomancer onto the battlefield, its ability can target that card in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Prey Upon resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the spell is an illegal target when Rewind tries to resolve, perhaps because it was countered by another spell or ability, Rewind won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t untap any lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Rewind targets only a spell. It doesn\'t target any lands. The lands are chosen as Rewind resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can choose up to four lands, no matter who controls any of them. Those lands untap once. You can\'t choose one land and have it untap four times, for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Turn to Slag tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t destroy any Equipment."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Turn to Slag can target a creature that has no Equipment attached to it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell that\'s more than one color, Quirion Dryad\'s ability triggers just once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you control at least one other creature when the ability resolves, you must sacrifice one. If you don\'t control any other creatures at that time, the ability won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield is the amount of life you gain and the number of cards you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'As long as Crusader of Odric is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Crusader of Odric may become lethal if other creatures you control leave the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Crusader of Odric\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an object enters the battlefield as a copy of Primal Clay, it copies the values determined by its enters-the-battlefield replacement effect, but its power and toughness are determined by the copy\'s own enters-the-battlefield replacement effect. This can cause you to have a 3/3 creature with flying, or a 1/6 creature with flying and defender, for example."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an object on the battlefield becomes a copy of Primal Clay, it copies the values determined by its enters-the-battlefield replacement effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "While not on the battlefield, Primal Clay is a 0/0 creature card. It doesn\'t have flying or defender."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A creature can be dealt an amount of damage greater than its toughness. For example, if Stuffy Doll is dealt 3 damage, its triggered ability deals 3 damage, not 1, to the chosen player.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Stuffy Doll is dealt damage, you lose the game before its triggered ability goes on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Merfolk you control may become lethal if Master of the Pearl Trident leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Farseek can find any land with any of the listed land types, including nonbasic ones, even if that land is a Forest in addition to one or more of those types.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Serra Avatar is no longer in your graveyard when its triggered ability resolves, you still shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The ability that defines Serra Avatar’s power and toughness works in all zones, not only the battlefield.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Bolas\' Augur", \'text\': "Wenn Bolas\' Augur ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte darunter offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0cb7276-a6b1-484d-8952-6d50b6d61627\', \'multiverseId\': 331967}, \'multiverseid\': 331967}, {\'name\': \'Presagio de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Presagio de Nicol Bolas entre al campo de batalla, mira las primeras tres cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en la parte inferior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e69756-980e-426c-89a6-27e3b2584ecf\', \'multiverseId\': 332216}, \'multiverseid\': 332216}, {\'name\': \'Augure de Bolas\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Augure de Bolas arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans n\'importe quel ordre.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8f7298-f2aa-435f-93b7-279c9e2f3ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 331469}, \'multiverseid\': 331469}, {\'name\': \'Augure di Bolas\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Augure di Bolas entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5546416e-4b4f-43c5-8984-f48eaca704ef\', \'multiverseId\': 332465}, \'multiverseid\': 332465}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの占い師\', \'text\': \'ボーラスの占い師が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを見る。あなたはその中のソーサリー・カード１枚かインスタント・カード１枚を公開して自分の手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c21b41-5999-4a9d-a51a-d4146c3b1314\', \'multiverseId\': 332714}, \'multiverseid\': 332714}, {\'name\': \'니콜 볼라스의 징조\', \'text\': \'니콜 볼라스의 징조가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 본다. 그 중에서 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드 한 장을 공개해 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'449ec8f6-1f3d-45d8-91d5-162a6b09ebe2\', \'multiverseId\': 330473}, \'multiverseid\': 330473}, {\'name\': \'Áugure de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quando Áugure de Nicol Bolas entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o resto no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7efc3445-88cb-405a-869a-31982f66f062\', \'multiverseId\': 331220}, \'multiverseid\': 331220}, {\'name\': \'Гадатель Боласа\', \'text\': \'Когда Гадатель Боласа выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из этих карт и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4f693d-4808-4bdd-8a9e-0576af158ca5\', \'multiverseId\': 331718}, \'multiverseid\': 331718}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯卜算师\', \'text\': \'当波拉斯卜算师进战场时，检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中的一张瞬间或法术牌，并将其置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e19d683b-0f70-4836-a09c-f7c36f7a0ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 330224}, \'multiverseid\': 330224}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯卜算師\', \'text\': \'當波拉斯卜算師進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。你可以展示其中的一張瞬間或巫術牌，並將其置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35baf492-b4a0-4527-87fb-41aa15248eca\', \'multiverseId\': 330722}, \'multiverseid\': 330722}]', '[{\'name\': "Bolas\' Schülerin", \'text\': "Wenn Bolas\' Schülerin ins Spiel kommt, opfere eine andere Kreatur. Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X Karten, wobei X gleich der Stärke dieser Kreatur ist.", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürst Bolas hat mir gezeigt, welch wertvolle Rohstoffe noch im kleinsten Lebewesen stecken."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1aca9f5-402f-4083-9aff-0f6bbb530c44\', \'multiverseId\': 332028}, \'multiverseid\': 332028}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Discípulo de Nicol Bolas entre al campo de batalla, sacrifica otra criatura. Ganas X vidas y robas X cartas, donde X es la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi Señor Nicol Bolas me ha mostrado que cada pequeña y miserable vida tiene sus recursos ocultos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f6a4b8e-0386-415e-9b4c-42664accc1ee\', \'multiverseId\': 332277}, \'multiverseid\': 332277}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quand la Disciple de Bolas arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez une créature. Vous gagnez X points de vie et vous piochez X cartes, X étant la force de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Le Seigneur Bolas m\'a montré comment chaque petite vie misérable renferme des ressources considérables. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50bdec24-529c-4b08-b8d5-0ccbf83eb1a1\', \'multiverseId\': 331530}, \'multiverseid\': 331530}, {\'name\': \'Discepola di Bolas\', \'text\': "Quando la Discepola di Bolas entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrifica un\'altra creatura. Guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte, dove X è la forza di quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lord Bolas mi ha mostrato come ogni piccola vita miserabile contiene risorse inaudite."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'354aa65e-f592-4679-904b-09d8185a4cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 332526}, \'multiverseid\': 332526}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの信奉者\', \'text\': \'ボーラスの信奉者が戦場に出たとき、他のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。あなたはX点のライフを得て、カードをX枚引く。Ｘはそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ボーラス卿は私に、哀れな小さき生命がどれほどの価値を秘めているかを教えてくれました。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0683232-ad6e-42a5-a439-26cd8b79fe8d\', \'multiverseId\': 332775}, \'multiverseid\': 332775}, {\'name\': \'니콜 볼라스의 사도\', \'text\': \'니콜 볼라스의 사도가 전장에 들어올 때, 다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다. 당신은 생명 X점을 얻고 카드 X장을 뽑는다. X는 희생된 생물의 공격력이다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"볼라스님께서는 하찮은 생명 하나가 얼마나 무궁무진한 잠재적 자원을 갖고 있는지를 나에게 가르쳐주셨다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1905942-50f4-4548-9bbc-56c59ad339ba\', \'multiverseId\': 330534}, \'multiverseid\': 330534}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quando Discípulo de Nicol Bolas entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique outra criatura. Você ganha X pontos de vida e compra X cards, sendo X igual ao poder daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O Senhor Nicol Bolas me mostrou como cada vida miserável encerra incríveis recursos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa938241-6e01-40f2-ba4e-0939db53f60b\', \'multiverseId\': 331281}, \'multiverseid\': 331281}, {\'name\': \'Приверженец Боласа\', \'text\': \'Когда Приверженец Боласа выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте другое существо. Вы получаете X жизней и берете X карт, где X — сила того существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Повелитель Болас показал мне, что в каждой никчемной и жалкой жизни есть скрытые возможности».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ff68ec-f3b2-480c-842a-6a847a7c3b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 331779}, \'multiverseid\': 331779}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯信徒\', \'text\': \'当波拉斯信徒进战场时，牺牲另一个生物。你获得X点生命且抓X张牌，X为该生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「波拉斯大人向我展示过低贱的生命如何掩饰秘密。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e106e021-bd73-415e-ac56-6601e6dd0429\', \'multiverseId\': 330285}, \'multiverseid\': 330285}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯信徒\', \'text\': \'當波拉斯信徒進戰場時，犧牲另一個生物。你獲得X點生命且抽X張牌，X為該生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「波拉斯大人向我展示過低賤生命如何掩飾秘密。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8becffb-4251-49f3-989e-432d3f6ddc86\', \'multiverseId\': 330783}, \'multiverseid\': 330783}]', '[{\'name\': "Ketos\' Zauberbuch", \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein wahrer Autor widmet sein ganzes Leben der Schöpfung eines einzigen Buches, eines Meisterwerks, das so einzigartig ist wie sein Erschaffer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9222cd6d-ba7e-47f5-af6c-529c99c97c5f\', \'multiverseId\': 332137}, \'multiverseid\': 332137}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un auténtico escriba dedica toda su vida a la creación de un único volumen, una obra maestra tan singular como su creador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7afe8e52-93d9-4763-a9a4-0dbdf2ea3f41\', \'multiverseId\': 332386}, \'multiverseid\': 332386}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Un véritable scribe dédie sa vie entière à la création d\'un seul volume, un chef d\'œuvre aussi unique que son artiste.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331639&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24607fc4-de9e-438f-9cb7-cc13aa62d040\', \'multiverseId\': 331639}, \'multiverseid\': 331639}, {\'name\': \'Tomo di Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Un vero scrivano dedica l\'intera esistenza alla creazione di un unico volume, un capolavoro unico come il suo creatore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168bda29-8fca-474c-b308-ea82416c31af\', \'multiverseId\': 332635}, \'multiverseid\': 332635}, {\'name\': \'ジェイムデー秘本\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'真の写字官は生涯を一冊の書の完成に捧げる。それは生みの親に等しい独自性を持つ傑作である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f863ac-b243-42f3-b933-f46c5a219d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 332884}, \'multiverseid\': 332884}, {\'name\': \'야임디 고서\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'진정한 문인은 자신처럼 유일무이한 단 한 권의 걸작을 만들기 위해 일생을 투자한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfa8bd9-2888-4e1c-9f9c-88b25b7d970d\', \'multiverseId\': 330643}, \'multiverseid\': 330643}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Um verdadeiro escriba devota a vida inteira à criação de um único volume, uma obra-prima tão única quanto seu criador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab71a30b-1992-44c0-8644-9de7aa28b8d0\', \'multiverseId\': 331390}, \'multiverseid\': 331390}, {\'name\': \'Том Джейэмди\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Истинный писец посвящает всю жизнь созданию одного фолианта — шедевра, такого же уникального, как и его создатель.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3fdf224-9ddc-4a65-a9eb-08effc521b37\', \'multiverseId\': 331888}, \'multiverseid\': 331888}, {\'name\': \'神秘巨著\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'真正的誊写人将终生都奉献给了仅仅一部作品，与其创作者同样独一无二的巨著。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28f85f5c-07db-450b-a820-d5bb09e1b51b\', \'multiverseId\': 330394}, \'multiverseid\': 330394}, {\'name\': \'神秘巨著\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'真正的謄寫人將終生都奉獻給了僅僅一部作品，與其創作者同樣獨一無二的巨著。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb7188ee-8865-4d9b-aa55-0bd4a67ccddc\', \'multiverseId\': 330892}, \'multiverseid\': 330892}]', '[{\'name\': "Nefarox\' Dienerin", \'text\': \'Edelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Mein Ziel ist Macht, und auf dem Altar der Macht opfere ich gerne meine Seele."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661bc27f-5bd3-4613-8b90-2d82dd9d8218\', \'multiverseId\': 332106}, \'multiverseid\': 332106}, {\'name\': \'Siervo de Néfarox\', \'text\': \'Exaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi causa es el poder, y en el altar del poder entregaré con gusto mi alma."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7a8227-9ccb-4f2a-b7a5-7bfa57c9110f\', \'multiverseId\': 332355}, \'multiverseid\': 332355}, {\'name\': \'Servante de Nefarox\', \'text\': "Exaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Le pouvoir est ma cause, et je sacrifierai volontiers mon âme sur son autel. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb114a7d-b3e0-4c5c-9874-4e463e9aba4b\', \'multiverseId\': 331608}, \'multiverseid\': 331608}, {\'name\': \'Servitrice di Nefarox\', \'text\': \'Esaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia causa è il potere e all\\\'altare del potere sacrificherò con gioia la mia anima."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e2b874e-fe8a-4c19-b97f-997cf3237960\', \'multiverseId\': 332604}, \'multiverseid\': 332604}, {\'name\': \'ネファロックスの召使い\', \'text\': \'賛美（あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「求めるものは力だ。力の祭壇の前になら、喜んでこの魂を投げ出そう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d8b0e5-2937-4842-9b67-ac8b05705309\', \'multiverseId\': 332853}, \'multiverseid\': 332853}, {\'name\': \'네파록스의 수하\', \'text\': \'고귀 (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"나의 명분은 힘이다. 따라서 나는 기꺼이 힘의 제단에 내 영혼을 바친다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55cd3eca-3b8e-411f-824b-b013bec7f7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 330612}, \'multiverseid\': 330612}, {\'name\': \'Servo de Nefarox\', \'text\': \'Exaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"A minha causa é o poder, e no altar do poder abdicarei de minha alma."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f579ea6c-4c21-45a9-a5c0-68b9fbeec596\', \'multiverseId\': 331359}, \'multiverseid\': 331359}, {\'name\': \'Слуга Нефарокса\', \'text\': \'Повышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, то существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Я борюсь за власть, и на алтаре власти я с радостью поплачусь моей душой».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab0a7ea-67c5-4436-ac23-5b4a4f1b42fd\', \'multiverseId\': 331857}, \'multiverseid\': 331857}, {\'name\': \'涅法洛仆从\', \'text\': \'颂威（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「我的使命就是力量；我乐意在力量祭坛上献出自己的灵魂。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8235e6a5-99b3-4de4-a86f-6831548cac0e\', \'multiverseId\': 330363}, \'multiverseid\': 330363}, {\'name\': \'涅法洛僕從\', \'text\': \'頌威每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，該生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「我的使命就是力量；我樂意在力量祭壇上獻出自己的靈魂。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fac7fa0-b72d-44ba-994f-ad5fb3c85458\', \'multiverseId\': 330861}, \'multiverseid\': 330861}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Wind soll die Luft beherrschen." —Dejara, Druide aus dem Güldenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28e7d275-0ca4-42ea-ad0b-a4795b4c2c55\', \'multiverseId\': 332022}, \'multiverseid\': 332022}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que tenga la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no haya nada en los cielos, salvo el viento." —Dejara, druida de Madera Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a199fc7-43fe-4c3d-9a3c-96851010ce83\', \'multiverseId\': 332271}, \'multiverseid\': 332271}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Seul le vent doit contrôler les cieux. » —Dejara, druide de Boisdoré\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c61edba1-0641-4a9e-ab42-941824dffae1\', \'multiverseId\': 331524}, \'multiverseid\': 331524}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare che nulla possieda i cieli se non il vento." —Dejara, druida di Boscodorato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5645ed2-62ca-4b5e-a316-b534c9d872ff\', \'multiverseId\': 332520}, \'multiverseid\': 332520}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「空にあるべきは風のみとしよう。」 ――黄金森のドルイド、デジャーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1adbef37-763d-4dfa-b665-bf9d6eaf74c5\', \'multiverseId\': 332769}, \'multiverseid\': 332769}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행 능력을 가진 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"바람을 제외한 어느 것도 하늘을 차지하게 둘 수 없다." —금빛숲 드루이드 데자라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df92e87-865f-43fc-ac11-8d1af0158b63\', \'multiverseId\': 330528}, \'multiverseid\': 330528}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que nada além do vento domine os céus." — Dejara, druida de Tronco Dourado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f4e2a9c-57f4-4603-abef-d5b337cabb5f\', \'multiverseId\': 331275}, \'multiverseid\': 331275}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть ничто не владеет небесами, кроме ветра». — Дежара, друид Золоченого Леса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326eb610-efcf-462b-a1f1-3926a86a2313\', \'multiverseId\': 331773}, \'multiverseid\': 331773}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「风该是天空唯一的主人。」～金林德鲁伊笛贾拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6451dcdf-5242-4939-a5d6-f8dcb942177c\', \'multiverseId\': 330279}, \'multiverseid\': 330279}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「風該是天空唯一的主人。」 ～金林德魯伊笛賈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5361cc-27a1-4765-9a17-eb187cd57046\', \'multiverseId\': 330777}, \'multiverseid\': 330777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani der Rudelrufer\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n-3: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Flugfähigkeit und Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n-8: Bringe X 2/2 weiße Katze-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel, wobei X gleich deiner Lebenspunktezahl ist.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9147196e-8a4c-46ff-9052-ebdca287e030\', \'multiverseId\': 331978}, \'multiverseid\': 331978}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, llamador de la manada\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo.\\n-3: La criatura objetivo gana las habilidades de volar y dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\\n-8: Pon en el campo de batalla X fichas de criatura Felino blancas 2/2, donde X es tu total de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c48eab3-1d6b-4afa-bfe8-4a53afaba656\', \'multiverseId\': 332227}, \'multiverseid\': 332227}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, meneur de la bande\', \'text\': "+1 : Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\n-3 : La créature ciblée acquiert le vol et la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-8 : Mettez sur le champ de bataille X jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Chat, X étant votre total de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e64f3c-24c5-4b87-8cfe-b025c48295f5\', \'multiverseId\': 331480}, \'multiverseid\': 331480}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Evocatore del Branco\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\n-3: Una creatura bersaglio ha volare e doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\\n-8: Metti sul campo di battaglia X pedine creatura Felino 2/2 bianche, dove X sono i tuoi punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19abb569-b967-4993-aed9-818c13632596\', \'multiverseId\': 332476}, \'multiverseid\': 332476}, {\'name\': \'群れの統率者アジャニ\', \'text\': \'＋１：クリーチャーを最大１体まで対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n－３：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで飛行と二段攻撃を得る。\\n－８：白の２/２の猫・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体戦場に出す。Ｘはあなたのライフの総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e21bf81b-9f87-4995-a8b3-0a3843a765dc\', \'multiverseId\': 332725}, \'multiverseid\': 332725}, {\'name\': \'사자무리 집결자 아자니\', \'text\': \'+1: 최대 한 개까지의 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n-3: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 비행과 이단공격 능력을 얻는다.\\n-8: 2/2 백색 고양이 생물 토큰 X개를 전장에 놓는다. X는 당신의 생명 총점이다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — - 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d2670e2-2cea-41d0-80bb-209e29f32d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 330484}, \'multiverseid\': 330484}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Convocador do Bando\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre até uma criatura alvo.\\n-3: A criatura alvo ganha voar e golpe duplo até o final do turno.\\n-8: Coloque X fichas de criatura brancas 2/2 do tipo Felino no campo de batalha, sendo X igual ao seu total de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d470ff4-c811-4870-baee-8a5e52318cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 331231}, \'multiverseid\': 331231}, {\'name\': \'Аджани, Взывающий к Прайду\', \'text\': \'+1: положите один жетон +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо.\\n-3: целевое существо получает Полет и Двойной удар до конца хода.\\n-8: положите на поле битвы Х фишек существа 2/2 белая Кошка, где X — количество ваших жизней.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a73d45b0-3dad-4618-8aca-65cc83fcfdcd\', \'multiverseId\': 331729}, \'multiverseid\': 331729}, {\'name\': \'狮群唤师阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。-3：目标生物获得飞行与连击异能直到回合结束。-8：将X个2/2白色的猫衍生生物放进战场，X为你的总生命。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9feb7024-4e43-4e92-8357-96fea897498a\', \'multiverseId\': 330235}, \'multiverseid\': 330235}, {\'name\': \'獅群喚師阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多一個目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。-3：目標生物獲得飛行與連擊異能直到回合結束。\\n-8：將X個2/2白色的貓衍生生物放進戰場，X為你的總生命。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9f04bd-e73d-4b36-9ece-319dbf1f8373\', \'multiverseId\': 330733}, \'multiverseid\': 330733}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Sonnenkämpferin\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazu erhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ajani reist dorthin, wo er am meisten gebraucht wird, und wir kümmern uns in seinem Namen um seine Heimat."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332087&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ce96cad-b6f3-47d6-96cf-349f33826ff5\', \'multiverseId\': 332087}, \'multiverseid\': 332087}, {\'name\': \'Golpeasol de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Ajani viaja adonde más se lo necesita, y en su nombre mantenemos a salvo sus tierras."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7cd5495-07c9-404b-bb85-b6cd4728a0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 332336}, \'multiverseid\': 332336}, {\'name\': "Frappesoleil d\'Ajani", \'text\': \'Lien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Ajani part là où sa présence est la plus nécessaire et c\'est en son nom que nous protégeons ses terres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9771e27f-1e0c-4655-b17e-b9a3814255b9\', \'multiverseId\': 331589}, \'multiverseid\': 331589}, {\'name\': \'Protettrice Solare di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Ajani va dove hanno più bisogno di lui e in suo nome proteggiamo le sue terre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'207542c4-c6ad-498b-a120-57005f50bb83\', \'multiverseId\': 332585}, \'multiverseid\': 332585}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの陽光弾手\', \'text\': \'絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与える場合、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「アジャニは行かねばならないところに行き、我々は彼の名の下に彼の土地を守る。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732b2df8-923d-4e93-b2e2-40345571fb51\', \'multiverseId\': 332834}, \'multiverseid\': 332834}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 태양타격수\', \'text\': \'생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 이 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"아자니는 그를 제일 필요로 하는 곳으로 가며, 우리는 그를 위해 그의 영역을 돌보지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'420cf7ac-1c50-4ad1-a501-fec28651fdf5\', \'multiverseId\': 330593}, \'multiverseid\': 330593}, {\'name\': \'Golpeador Solar de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida(O dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ajani vai para onde mais precisam dele, e em seu nome mantemos suas terras em segurança."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6ae30b7-bc5c-4f82-9fa2-2d491d828b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 331340}, \'multiverseid\': 331340}, {\'name\': \'Солнечный Защитник Аджани\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Аджани там, где он нужен больше всего, и от его имени мы защищаем его земли».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c311c419-fdc6-44ab-9149-83b6f497b78f\', \'multiverseId\': 331838}, \'multiverseid\': 331838}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼旭击僧\', \'text\': \'系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「阿耶尼会在最需要他的地方现身，而我们以其名立誓维护其领地安全。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7e75542-e669-4395-9fea-8b60d35938ec\', \'multiverseId\': 330344}, \'multiverseid\': 330344}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼暉擊僧\', \'text\': \'繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「阿耶尼會在最需要他的地方現身，而我們以其名立誓維護其領地安全。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddaf1f5d-c188-4492-8a4a-84ba5b1015eb\', \'multiverseId\': 330842}, \'multiverseid\': 330842}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akromas Denkmal\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Flugfähigkeit, Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit, Trampelschaden, Eile, Schutz vor Schwarz und Schutz vor Rot.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Keine Pause. Keine Gnade. Keine Ausreden." —Denkmalinschrift\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332175&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b71abd-efe7-4c59-9603-75be5d4b1a20\', \'multiverseId\': 332175}, \'multiverseid\': 332175}, {\'name\': \'Monumento a Akroma\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen las habilidades de volar, dañar primero, vigilancia, arrollar, prisa, protección contra negro y protección contra rojo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Sin descanso. Sin misericordia. Sin importar lo que pase." —Inscripción del monumento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543ae1fa-3219-402e-9847-51e4abede16b\', \'multiverseId\': 332424}, \'multiverseid\': 332424}, {\'name\': "Mémorial d\'Akroma", \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont le vol, l\'initiative, la vigilance, le piétinement, la célérité, la protection contre le noir et la protection contre le rouge.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'« Pas de repos. Pas de pitié. Pas de questions. » —Inscription du mémorial\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331677&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b1db761-fd16-4ea5-9b8d-d276552ee617\', \'multiverseId\': 331677}, \'multiverseid\': 331677}, {\'name\': \'Ricordo di Akroma\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno volare, attacco improvviso, cautela, travolgere, rapidità e protezione dal nero e dal rosso.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Nessun riposo. Nessuna pietà. Nessuna eccezione." —Iscrizione celebrativa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a223e8a8-edba-47d6-be51-b6699b29ed43\', \'multiverseId\': 332673}, \'multiverseid\': 332673}, {\'name\': \'アクローマの記念碑\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、飛行と先制攻撃と警戒とトランプルと速攻とプロテクション（黒）とプロテクション（赤）を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「休息も慈悲も与えぬ。何があってもだ。」――碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5783c4cd-d0d2-42eb-9d39-d19e25ace414\', \'multiverseId\': 332922}, \'multiverseid\': 332922}, {\'name\': \'아크로마의 기념비\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 비행, 선제공격, 경계, 돌진, 신속 및 흑색과 적색으로부터 보호 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"휴식도 없고 자비도 없다. 어떤 경우에도." —기념비 비문\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca716225-2a10-42ea-827e-a336a111c898\', \'multiverseId\': 330681}, \'multiverseid\': 330681}, {\'name\': \'Memorial de Akroma\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm voar, iniciativa, vigilância, atropelar, ímpeto, proteção contra o preto e proteção contra o vermelho.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Sem descanso. Sem piedade. Não importa o que aconteça." — Inscrição do memorial\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac88154a-03b7-4cf2-8c3f-012e67a55b20\', \'multiverseId\': 331428}, \'multiverseid\': 331428}, {\'name\': \'Мемориал Акромы\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем имеют Полет, Первый удар, Бдительность, Пробивной удар, Ускорение и Защиту от черного и от красного.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Без устали. Без пощады. Без тени сомнения». — Мемориальная надпись\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5209a92-f71a-4da0-a521-b5a3c1019dd9\', \'multiverseId\': 331926}, \'multiverseid\': 331926}, {\'name\': \'爱若玛纪念碑\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有飞行，先攻，警戒，践踏，敏捷，反黑保护，与反红保护异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「无休，无情，无忌。」～纪念碑铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef3b9e94-6a0a-401e-8933-96971b234a29\', \'multiverseId\': 330432}, \'multiverseid\': 330432}, {\'name\': \'愛若瑪紀念碑\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有飛行，先攻，警戒，踐踏，敏捷，反黑保護，與反紅保護異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「無休，無情，無忌。」 ～紀念碑銘文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f6bdcd-c2b3-47d0-bc0e-ca73ccc5399a\', \'multiverseId\': 330930}, \'multiverseid\': 330930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allwissenheit\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Karten, die kein Land sind, aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Errungenschaften, von denen ich einst begeistert war, waren nur erste Schritte auf dem Weg in eine Zukunft, die ich nur erahnen kann." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332205&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24ecc9b-7617-467f-90ca-bc63eac0b11e\', \'multiverseId\': 332205}, \'multiverseid\': 332205}, {\'name\': \'Omnisciencia\', \'text\': \'Puedes lanzar cartas que no sean de tierra de tu mano sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Las cosas que en otro tiempo imaginé que serían mis mayores logros no eran más que los primeros pasos hacia un futuro que sólo puedo empezar a vislumbrar." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75426326-6660-4664-b39e-6445c5715bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 332454}, \'multiverseid\': 332454}, {\'name\': \'Omniscience\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez lancer des cartes non-terrain depuis votre main sans payer leur coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Mes rêves les plus fous d\'hier ne sont aujourd\'hui qu\'un premier pas vers un avenir que je commence à peine à entrevoir. » —Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c4cd536-2025-44c2-a59c-62a3df734e37\', \'multiverseId\': 331707}, \'multiverseid\': 331707}, {\'name\': \'Onniscienza\', \'text\': \'Puoi lanciare carte non terra dalla tua mano senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le cose che sognavo un tempo sarebbero le mie conquiste più grandi, se non fossero solo i primi passi verso un futuro che riesco appena a intravedere." —Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ee8867-1692-4f16-a7e9-d0ee3e3d98a5\', \'multiverseId\': 332703}, \'multiverseid\': 332703}, {\'name\': \'全知\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたの手札にある土地でないカードを、それらのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「かつては最大の目標として想い描いていた事も、まだその片鱗しか窺い知ることのできない未来への第一歩に過ぎなかった。」 ――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6fde55e-776f-4e78-8803-b6f3286330dd\', \'multiverseId\': 332952}, \'multiverseid\': 332952}, {\'name\': \'전지전능함\', \'text\': \'당신은 손에 있는 대지가 아닌 카드를 마나비용의 지불 없이 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"한때 내 일생일대의 업적이 되리라 상상했던 것들은 실은 헤아릴 수 없을 만큼 엄청난 미래의 첫걸음에 불과했다." —제이스 벨레렌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12157178-74d2-470e-924e-28e41b4b3d58\', \'multiverseId\': 330711}, \'multiverseid\': 330711}, {\'name\': \'Onisciência\', \'text\': \'Você pode conjurar cards que não sejam terrenos da sua mão sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"As coisas que um dia eu imaginei como minhas maiores conquistas foram apenas o primeiro passo rumo a um futuro que apenas comecei a visualizar." — Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15cea73f-cbb1-468d-9a6a-9f0ac3d5a567\', \'multiverseId\': 331458}, \'multiverseid\': 331458}, {\'name\': \'Всеведение\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыгрывать не являющиеся землями карты из вашей руки без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что я некогда мнил своим величайшим достижением, было лишь первыми шагами в будущее, которое я лишь начинаю постигать». — Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e303007c-0c75-4170-9da3-96970ad20d50\', \'multiverseId\': 331956}, \'multiverseid\': 331956}, {\'name\': \'全知全能\', \'text\': \'你可从你手上施放非地牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾以为某些事情是能力所及的最高成就，殊不知那只是向无尽未来探出的最初几步。」～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400d23c7-ecf0-4b0f-b9f6-6fca90b0a412\', \'multiverseId\': 330462}, \'multiverseid\': 330462}, {\'name\': \'全知全能\', \'text\': \'你可從你手上施放非地牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾以為某些事情是能力所及的最高成就，殊不知那只是向無盡未來探出的最初幾步。」～傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2b623c-6e48-43cd-855e-05a71f5fea4f\', \'multiverseId\': 330960}, \'multiverseid\': 330960}]', "[{'name': 'Altschuppiger Wurm', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Altschuppige Wurm ins Spiel kommt und du weniger als 7 Lebenspunkte hast, wird dein Lebenspunktestand zu genau 7.\\nSolange du 7 oder mehr Lebenspunkte hast, reduziert Schaden, der deine Lebenspunkte unter 7 reduzieren würde, sie stattdessen auf 7.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Wurm', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331982&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16e2b4c9-f6e8-45a4-956a-7af434335400', 'multiverseId': 331982}, 'multiverseid': 331982}, {'name': 'Sierpe escamas ancianas', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nCuando la Sierpe escamas ancianas entre al campo de batalla, si tu total de vidas es menos que 7, se convierte en 7.\\nMientras tengas 7 o menos vidas, el daño que fuera a reducir tu total de vidas a menos de 7, en vez de eso, lo reduce a 7.', 'type': 'Criatura — Sierpe', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332231&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac6904dc-1885-4ded-947c-29525061ec5e', 'multiverseId': 332231}, 'multiverseid': 332231}, {'name': 'Guivre séculaire', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nQuand la Guivre séculaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, si votre total de points de vie est inférieur à 7, il devient 7.\\nTant que votre total de points de vie est supérieur ou égal à 7, les blessures qui devraient réduire celui-ci à moins de 7 le réduisent à 7 à la place.', 'type': 'Créature : guivre', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331484&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b9bcea2-d8ba-4dbc-bc8c-bf5f66077a1e', 'multiverseId': 331484}, 'multiverseid': 331484}, {'name': 'Wurm Scagliantica', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nQuando il Wurm Scagliantica entra nel campo di battaglia, se i tuoi punti vita sono meno di 7, diventano 7.\\nFintanto che hai 7 o più punti vita, qualsiasi danno che ridurrebbe i tuoi punti vita a meno di 7 li riduce invece a 7.', 'type': 'Creatura — Wurm', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332480&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c90e741-cd27-4bd6-8dd9-edf33201af9a', 'multiverseId': 332480}, 'multiverseid': 332480}, {'name': '古鱗のワーム', 'text': 'トランプル\\n古鱗のワームが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライフが７点未満である場合、あなたのライフの総量は７点になる。\\nあなたのライフが７点以上であるかぎり、あなたのライフの合計を７点未満に減少させるダメージは、代わりにあなたのライフの総量が７点になるまで減少させる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332729&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c5ade76-0fdf-415c-b86e-3ff9a45e9d40', 'multiverseId': 332729}, 'multiverseid': 332729}, {'name': '늙은비늘 웜', 'text': '돌진\\n늙은비늘 웜이 전장에 들어올 때, 만약 당신의 생명 총점이 7점보다 낮다면, 당신의 생명 총점은 7점이 된다.\\n당신의 생명 총점이 7점 이상인 한, 당신의 생명 총점을 7점보다 낮게 만들 피해는 대신에 당신의 생명 총점을 7점으로 낮춘다.', 'type': '생물 — 웜', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330488&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b17881d9-2249-4d1b-940c-60e5ec4ce86b', 'multiverseId': 330488}, 'multiverseid': 330488}, {'name': 'Vorme Vetusto', 'text': 'Atropelar\\nQuando Vorme Vetusto entrar no campo de batalha, se seu total de pontos de vida for inferior a 7, seu total de pontos de vida se tornará 7.\\nEnquanto você tiver 7 ou mais pontos de vida, o dano que reduziria seu total de pontos de vida para menos de 7, em vez disso, o reduzirá a 7.', 'type': 'Criatura — Vorme', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331235&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6663e27b-daa3-4461-879d-88562360b6da', 'multiverseId': 331235}, 'multiverseid': 331235}, {'name': 'Могучий Вурм-Старейшина', 'text': 'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Могучий Вурм-Старейшина выходит на поле битвы, если ваше количество жизней меньше 7, ваше количество жизней становится равным 7.\\nПока у вас не менее 7 жизней, повреждения, которые должны снизить количество ваших жизней до значения менее 7, снижают его до 7 вместо этого.', 'type': 'Существо — Вурм', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331733&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11c46aeb-307b-4cc3-9b02-2e07f59fbb87', 'multiverseId': 331733}, 'multiverseid': 331733}, {'name': '祖鳞亚龙', 'text': '践踏\\n当祖鳞亚龙进战场时，若你的总生命小于7，则你的总生命成为7。\\n只要你的生命为7或更多，则将使你的总生命减少至7以下的伤害，改为减少你的生命至7。', 'type': '生物～亚龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330239&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cf0f261-2ea1-4ece-903b-3deb1c5b08ae', 'multiverseId': 330239}, 'multiverseid': 330239}, {'name': '祖鱗亞龍', 'text': '踐踏\\n當祖鱗亞龍進戰場時，若你的總生命小於7，則你的總生命成為7。\\n只要你的生命為7或更多，則將使你的總生命減少至7以下的傷害，改為減少你的生命至7。', 'type': '生物～亞龍', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330737&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78c3c3ef-5632-48e2-be6e-04e17b456eec', 'multiverseId': 330737}, 'multiverseid': 330737}]", '[{\'name\': \'Archäomagierin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Archäomagierin ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Worte der Macht verschwinden nie. Sie warten ruhend auf diejenigen, die wissen, wie man sie spricht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e68ba2-790a-45db-91e7-3912cbc18e56\', \'multiverseId\': 332112}, \'multiverseid\': 332112}, {\'name\': \'Arqueomante\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Arqueomante entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las palabras de poder nunca desaparecen. Duermen, esperando a aquellos que tengan el valor de despertarlas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d85157a1-df09-486e-8614-be917d972bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 332361}, \'multiverseid\': 332361}, {\'name\': \'Archéomancienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Archéomancienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Les mots de pouvoir ne meurent jamais. Ils sommeillent, attendant quiconque aura la volonté de les réveiller. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331614&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df16f04a-4c56-4057-99dd-afbc7966af8e\', \'multiverseId\': 331614}, \'multiverseid\': 331614}, {\'name\': \'Archeomante\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Archeomante entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le parole del potere non scompaiono mai. Rimangono dormienti, in attesa di quanti hanno la volontà di risvegliarle."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'631d6fd9-f6d6-461d-bb90-29220eac709d\', \'multiverseId\': 332610}, \'multiverseid\': 332610}, {\'name\': \'古術師\', \'text\': \'古術師が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「力の言葉は消えない。意志ある者が必要とするときまで眠りにつくのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd59d351-db45-4f91-ab96-edb115eac43f\', \'multiverseId\': 332859}, \'multiverseid\': 332859}, {\'name\': \'고고학술사\', \'text\': \'고고학술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"힘이 깃들은 주문은 사라지지 않는다. 다시 깨워줄 누군가를 기다리며 잠들어 있을 뿐이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac1340b-cb65-4576-baf9-f15ca051e891\', \'multiverseId\': 330618}, \'multiverseid\': 330618}, {\'name\': \'Arqueomante\', \'text\': \'Quando Arqueomante entrar no campo de batalha, devolva o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"As palavras de poder jamais desaparecem. Elas se adormentam, enquanto aguardam aqueles com a determinação de despertá-las."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b456123b-77c9-4ab8-bc8a-de2da9cf2506\', \'multiverseId\': 331365}, \'multiverseid\': 331365}, {\'name\': \'Археомант\', \'text\': \'Когда Археомант выходит на поле битвы, верните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Слова, исполненные магической силы, не исчезают. Они дремлют в ожидании тех, кто заставит их пробудиться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6833e9e-1a25-437f-9447-56525bf4cef2\', \'multiverseId\': 331863}, \'multiverseid\': 331863}, {\'name\': \'古语术士\', \'text\': \'当古语术士进战场时，将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「拥有力量的文字从不消失。它们只是沉睡着，等待决心唤醒它们的人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95047796-8db2-4219-a0b4-44059a476f94\', \'multiverseId\': 330369}, \'multiverseid\': 330369}, {\'name\': \'古語術士\', \'text\': \'當古語術士進戰場時，將目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「擁有力量的文字從不消失。它們只是沉睡著，等待決心喚醒它們的人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30017f3e-03bb-4e3d-85ab-bfc563ad5cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 330867}, \'multiverseid\': 330867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arktischer Avior\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Arktische Avior erhält +1/+1, solange du eine Ebene kontrollierst.\\n{W}: Der Arktische Avior erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazu erhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4133086-4e1e-4be4-9a9b-454298d6dbc8\', \'multiverseId\': 331985}, \'multiverseid\': 331985}, {\'name\': \'Aven ártico\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Aven ártico obtiene +1/+1 mientras controles una llanura.\\n{W}: El Aven ártico gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d67154c7-1c5c-45ec-ba45-5bdbf605304c\', \'multiverseId\': 332234}, \'multiverseid\': 332234}, {\'name\': \'Avemain arctique\', \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Avemain arctique gagne +1/+1 tant que vous contrôlez une plaine.\\n{W} : L\'Avemain arctique acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbf345a-f71e-47ad-9592-d24b4d1360bc\', \'multiverseId\': 331487}, \'multiverseid\': 331487}, {\'name\': \'Aviano Polare\', \'text\': "Volare\\nL\'Aviano Polare prende +1/+1 fintanto che controlli una Pianura.\\n{W}: L\'Aviano Polare ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28bd668a-c13d-4dce-b77e-feef1666824d\', \'multiverseId\': 332483}, \'multiverseid\': 332483}, {\'name\': \'極北のエイヴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n極北のエイヴンは、あなたが平地をコントロールしているかぎり＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{W}：極北のエイヴンはターン終了時まで絆魂を得る。（このクリーチャーがダメージを与える場合、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668040da-b9b9-43af-8fb8-cd3801a0e379\', \'multiverseId\': 332732}, \'multiverseid\': 332732}, {\'name\': \'극지 에이븐\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 평원을 조종하는 한, 극지 에이븐은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n{W}: 극지 에이븐은 턴종료까지 생명연결 능력을 얻는다. (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 이 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de785ff-4653-48c1-8fd1-d161b2863d4e\', \'multiverseId\': 330491}, \'multiverseid\': 330491}, {\'name\': \'Aviano Ártico\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAviano Ártico recebe +1/+1 enquanto você controlar uma Planície.\\n{W}: Aviano Ártico ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno. (O dano causado por esta criatura também faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd253bc5-232a-40e9-a53b-98fcfa5eb47d\', \'multiverseId\': 331238}, \'multiverseid\': 331238}, {\'name\': \'Арктический Авен\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nАрктический Авен получает +1/+1, пока вы контролируете Равнину.\\n{W}: Арктический Авен получает Цепь жизни до конца хода. (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bef48ea-00ca-478f-bbde-a16379b7767c\', \'multiverseId\': 331736}, \'multiverseid\': 331736}, {\'name\': \'极地艾文\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要你操控平原，极地艾文便得+1/+1。\\n{W}：极地艾文获得系命异能直到回合结束。（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a28ca3-0f0c-46e7-966a-d78a19513ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 330242}, \'multiverseid\': 330242}, {\'name\': \'極地艾文\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n只要你操控平原，極地艾文便得+1/+1。\\n{W}：極地艾文獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4cf57a-8e04-4419-96a6-2a52c60b05a6\', \'multiverseId\': 330740}, \'multiverseid\': 330740}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufgewartete Ritterin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu.)\\nWenn die Aufgewartete Ritterin ins Spiel kommt, bringe einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e43181-4a07-4e74-963d-0df9b6d08bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 332113}, \'multiverseid\': 332113}, {\'name\': \'Caballero asistente\', \'text\': \'Daña primero. (Esta criatura hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero.)\\nCuando la Caballero asistido entre al campo de batalla, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59bfd08d-b821-4bd0-ac23-84b3121bc070\', \'multiverseId\': 332362}, \'multiverseid\': 332362}, {\'name\': \'Chevalière accompagnée\', \'text\': "Initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative.)\\nQuand la Chevalière accompagnée arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331615&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba6a154-97cc-4549-8bd9-00720d7fea76\', \'multiverseId\': 331615}, \'multiverseid\': 331615}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliera Scortata\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso (Questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso.)\\nQuando la Cavaliera Scortata entra nel campo di battaglia, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'214961ed-0726-4bec-9b78-4877e42765aa\', \'multiverseId\': 332611}, \'multiverseid\': 332611}, {\'name\': \'従者つきの騎士\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与える。）\\n従者つきの騎士が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441b8258-763e-453f-9b3d-eeb85f97d0ee\', \'multiverseId\': 332860}, \'multiverseid\': 332860}, {\'name\': \'수행원을 거느린 기사\', \'text\': \'선제공격 (이 생물은 선제공격 능력이 없는 생물보다 먼저 전투피해를 입힌다.)\\n수행원을 거느린 기사가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5787cd4c-cd1c-4b4f-8e7b-38f74e271d39\', \'multiverseId\': 330619}, \'multiverseid\': 330619}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro Acompanhado\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa (Esta criatura causa dano de combate antes das criaturas sem iniciativa.)\\nQuando Cavaleiro Acompanhado entrar no campo de batalha, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d8d1c4-1b36-4b8c-be21-bdaac5f32310\', \'multiverseId\': 331366}, \'multiverseid\': 331366}, {\'name\': \'Сопровождаемый Рыцарь\', \'text\': \'Первый удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без Первого удара.)\\nКогда Сопровождаемый Рыцарь выходит на поле битвы, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5cc7e55-904d-40c4-bf23-d6b4100ce959\', \'multiverseId\': 331864}, \'multiverseid\': 331864}, {\'name\': \'扈伴骑士\', \'text\': \'先攻（此生物会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害。）\\n当扈伴骑士进战场时，将一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7169a03-362a-4bd2-a218-2943e4b45857\', \'multiverseId\': 330370}, \'multiverseid\': 330370}, {\'name\': \'扈伴騎士\', \'text\': \'先攻（此生物會比不具先攻異能的生物提前造成戰鬥傷害。）\\n當扈伴騎士進戰場時，將一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502845fb-5a41-40c6-86e0-52e854f90940\', \'multiverseId\': 330868}, \'multiverseid\': 330868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstand mit Hackmessern\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges Doppelschlag. (Sie fügen sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Einmal messen, zweimal hacken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332141&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aee5a400-631c-410b-aa4b-68770947245e\', \'multiverseId\': 332141}, \'multiverseid\': 332141}, {\'name\': \'Motín de machetes\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno. (Esas criaturas dañan primero y también hacen daño de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mide una vez y corta dos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b69e8d62-920b-4606-9e25-1b413968e155\', \'multiverseId\': 332390}, \'multiverseid\': 332390}, {\'name\': \'Émeute au hachoir\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elles infligent des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Le gobelin tranche toujours deux fois.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331643&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abbd947d-1d46-4843-91df-b006a842efa1\', \'multiverseId\': 331643}, \'multiverseid\': 331643}, {\'name\': \'Sommossa delle Mannaie\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno. (Infliggono sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Misura una volta, taglia due volte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edbbc2a8-4617-43dd-9b65-ee44078c7408\', \'multiverseId\': 332639}, \'multiverseid\': 332639}, {\'name\': \'大鉈暴動\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで二段攻撃を得る。（それらは先制攻撃と通常の２回の戦闘ダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一度測って二度切断。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c1c075-937c-45eb-bd83-8aea47607dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 332888}, \'multiverseid\': 332888}, {\'name\': \'식칼의 폭동\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 이단공격 능력을 얻는다. (그 생물들은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 모두 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'일단 두 번씩 자르고 보자.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ef60787-4ff0-4978-94a6-f154fc40278a\', \'multiverseId\': 330647}, \'multiverseid\': 330647}, {\'name\': \'Revolta do Cutelo\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla ganham golpe duplo até o final do turno. (Elas causam tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o dano de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Meça uma vez, corte duas vezes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc264569-9f4d-46f3-87db-2b2b0568ea46\', \'multiverseId\': 331394}, \'multiverseid\': 331394}, {\'name\': \'Мятеж Секачей\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают Двойной удар до конца хода. (Они наносят боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Один раз отмерь, два раза отрежь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dcff19a-b8c8-4054-8e3d-40c365ebed27\', \'multiverseId\': 331892}, \'multiverseid\': 331892}, {\'name\': \'持刀暴乱\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。（它们能造成先攻与普通战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'打量一次，下刀两次。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'242c51a2-84d9-4556-90e2-4aba05c3a125\', \'multiverseId\': 330398}, \'multiverseid\': 330398}, {\'name\': \'持刀暴亂\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。（它們能造成先攻與普通戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'打量一次，下刀兩次。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'381f7624-ef1b-4065-9d9d-3dbaf3a3309c\', \'multiverseId\': 330896}, \'multiverseid\': 330896}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Grab holen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe meistens mit verrotteten Leichen zu tun. Wenn ich über einen kürzlich Verstorbenen stolpere, dann ist das für mich fast wie Weihnachten." —Nevinyrral, Nekromagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332080&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473717c4-0a4f-4a26-8691-760280cd68ee\', \'multiverseId\': 332080}, \'multiverseid\': 332080}, {\'name\': \'Sacar de la tumba\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Trabajo tan a menudo con cadáveres putrefactos que cuando me encuentro con muertos frescos ... vaya, parece que mi cumpleaños se ha adelantado." —Nevinyrral, nigromante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b0c24ac-d058-446d-b6bf-e1fab6a9ec11\', \'multiverseId\': 332329}, \'multiverseid\': 332329}, {\'name\': \'Défouissage\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai si souvent affaire aux cadavres en putréfaction que lorsque je tombe sur un corps frais . . . ma foi, c\'est comme un anniversaire avant l\'heure. » —Nevinyrral, nécromancien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd9eddbd-43d1-48ab-908d-f0b2bb8cde7b\', \'multiverseId\': 331582}, \'multiverseid\': 331582}, {\'name\': \'Dissotterrare\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi occupo così spesso di cadaveri in putrefazione che quando vedo un cadavere fresco. . . è come festeggiare due volte il compleanno." —Nevinyrral, necromante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d695f67-6537-4634-adb6-fe5d6c16485e\', \'multiverseId\': 332578}, \'multiverseid\': 332578}, {\'name\': \'墓暴き\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「いつも腐れ落ちた亡骸ばかり扱うものだから、新鮮な死体に出くわすと……何だか、誕生日が早く来たみたいだ。」 ――屍術師ネビニラル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4af9af-efa6-45f2-a52d-17a043432d18\', \'multiverseId\': 332827}, \'multiverseid\': 332827}, {\'name\': \'무덤 파헤치기\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"늘 지독하게 썩어가는 시체만 다루다 보니까, 가끔 죽은 지 얼마 안 된 시체를 만날 때면... 뭐랄까, 꼭 생일 선물을 받은 기분이야." —사령술사 네비니랄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf7d7904-890e-4d39-8fdf-86bb117d0f88\', \'multiverseId\': 330586}, \'multiverseid\': 330586}, {\'name\': \'Desencovar\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu lido tanto com corpos apodrecidos que quando encontro um cadáver fresco... é como se o meu aniversário tivesse chegado mais cedo." — Nevinyrral, necromante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b45d0771-273b-41cc-a484-2277ddd0237a\', \'multiverseId\': 331333}, \'multiverseid\': 331333}, {\'name\': \'Извлечение из Могилы\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Я столько вожусь с гниющими трупами, что когда мне попадается свежий покойник... это как наступивший негаданно день рождения». — Невиниррал, некромант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df839073-fdb6-4d9b-9ae1-deabc7e4bb93\', \'multiverseId\': 331831}, \'multiverseid\': 331831}, {\'name\': \'扰坟\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我平常面对的总是那些腐臭之躯，所以每当遇到新鲜的尸体时…你猜怎么着，就好像在提前庆祝生日一样。」～死灵术士妮维亚洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac40cd40-c95b-4a3f-b5bf-02ef53a53e60\', \'multiverseId\': 330337}, \'multiverseid\': 330337}, {\'name\': \'擾墳\', \'text\': \'將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我平常面對的總是那些腐臭之軀，所以每當遇到新鮮的屍體時…你猜怎麼著，就好像在提前慶祝生日一樣。」 ～死靈術士妮維亞洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c01c6be7-f902-47a6-84f6-789528f4a4ea\', \'multiverseId\': 330835}, \'multiverseid\': 330835}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgestopfte Puppe\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Ausgestopfte Puppe ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Spieler.\\nDie Ausgestopfte Puppe ist unzerstörbar.\\nImmer wenn der Ausgestopften Puppe Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie dem bestimmten Spieler ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{T}: Die Ausgestopfte Puppe fügt sich selber 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332174&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36d30ec-635e-4985-9891-b0f9cc13551d\', \'multiverseId\': 332174}, \'multiverseid\': 332174}, {\'name\': \'Muñeca de trapo\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Muñeca de trapo entre al campo de batalla, elige un jugador.\\nLa Muñeca de trapo es indestructible.\\nSiempre que la Muñeca de trapo reciba daño, esta le hace esa misma cantidad de daño al jugador elegido.\\n{T}: La Muñeca de trapo se hace 1 punto de daño a sí misma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c8a88b-e0b7-497a-bbdc-d4a43a5922aa\', \'multiverseId\': 332423}, \'multiverseid\': 332423}, {\'name\': \'Poupée de son\', \'text\': "Quand la Poupée de son arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un joueur.\\nLa Poupée de son est indestructible.\\nÀ chaque fois que des blessures sont infligées à la Poupée de son, elle inflige autant de blessures au joueur choisi.\\n{T} : La Poupée de son s\'inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331676&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27ebefc-a3d2-4853-82d6-37f8edb482b5\', \'multiverseId\': 331676}, \'multiverseid\': 331676}, {\'name\': \'Bambola di Pezza\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Bambola di Pezza entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un giocatore.\\nLa Bambola di Pezza è indistruttibile.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno alla Bambola di Pezza, essa infligge altrettanti danni al giocatore scelto.\\n{T}: La Bambola di Pezza infligge 1 danno a se stessa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09e42298-cffa-40b1-9c5f-89d76f503456\', \'multiverseId\': 332672}, \'multiverseid\': 332672}, {\'name\': \'ぬいぐるみ人形\', \'text\': \'ぬいぐるみ人形が戦場に出るに際し、プレイヤーを１人選ぶ。\\nぬいぐるみ人形は破壊されない。\\nぬいぐるみ人形にダメージが与えられるたび、それはその点数に等しい点数のダメージを選ばれたプレイヤーに与える。\\n{T}：ぬいぐるみ人形は自身に１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5052bf-dba5-446a-b4b1-74641e7d8f9f\', \'multiverseId\': 332921}, \'multiverseid\': 332921}, {\'name\': \'푹신한 인형\', \'text\': \'푹신한 인형이 전장에 들어올 시에, 플레이어 한 명을 선택한다.\\n푹신한 인형은 파괴될 수 없다. 푹신한 인형이 피해를 입을 때마다, 푹신한 인형은 선택한 플레이어에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\\n{T}: 푹신한 인형은 스스로에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d2b2c9-77ce-4ba5-b462-74c9a0485857\', \'multiverseId\': 330680}, \'multiverseid\': 330680}, {\'name\': \'Boneco Empalhado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Boneco Empalhado entra no campo de batalha, escolha um jogador.\\nBoneco Empalhado é indestrutível.\\nToda vez que Boneco Empalhado sofre dano, ele causa uma quantidade equivalente de dano ao jogador escolhido.\\n{T}: Boneco Empalhado causa 1 ponto de dano a si mesmo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecfac349-199a-4b6e-a97c-f6f8b9bb8b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 331427}, \'multiverseid\': 331427}, {\'name\': \'Мягкая Кукла\', \'text\': \'При выходе Мягкой Куклы на поле битвы выберите игрока.\\nМягкая Кукла не может быть уничтожена.\\nКаждый раз, когда Мягкой Кукле наносятся повреждения, она наносит столько же повреждений выбранному игроку.\\n{T}: Мягкая Кукла наносит 1 повреждение сама себе.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10962c1e-d539-4c1d-9e4b-10276ac36b67\', \'multiverseId\': 331925}, \'multiverseid\': 331925}, {\'name\': \'填充娃娃\', \'text\': \'当填充娃娃进战场时，选择一位牌手。填充娃娃不会毁坏。每当填充娃娃受到伤害时，它对该牌手造成等量的伤害。{T}：填充娃娃对本身造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a13bd790-310b-4a5c-8a21-810fbf76fa00\', \'multiverseId\': 330431}, \'multiverseid\': 330431}, {\'name\': \'填充娃娃\', \'text\': \'當填充娃娃進戰場時，選擇一位玩家。\\n填充娃娃不會毀壞。\\n每當填充娃娃受到傷害時，它對該玩家造成等量的傷害。\\n{T}：填充娃娃對本身造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee97e4a-1815-48cb-895c-a3ff99aec860\', \'multiverseId\': 330929}, \'multiverseid\': 330929}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auslöschung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Traue deinen Augen nicht, denn Magier sind Meister der Täuschung. Traue nur deinem Glauben. Er wird dir die Augen öffnen." —Lila, erunische Priesterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332090&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ea1d161-eddd-4fbf-b0c9-ac1b664b259b\', \'multiverseId\': 332090}, \'multiverseid\': 332090}, {\'name\': \'Borrar\', \'text\': \'Exilia el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No confíes en tus ojos, pues los magos son maestros del engaño. Confía sólo en tu fe. Tu fe lo limpiará todo." —Lila, sacerdotisa eruniana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce225f1-ef6d-482e-a32c-f5e76bae54e2\', \'multiverseId\': 332339}, \'multiverseid\': 332339}, {\'name\': \'Effacement\', \'text\': "Exilez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ne vous fiez pas à vos yeux ; les mages excellent dans l\'art de la dissimulation. Seule la foi doit vous guider. Elle saura tout purifier. » —Lila, prêtresse érunienne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5440a728-48c2-4691-bddd-f1357464b69a\', \'multiverseId\': 331592}, \'multiverseid\': 331592}, {\'name\': \'Cancellare\', \'text\': \'Esilia un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non fidarti di quello che vedi, poiché i maghi sono maestri dell\\\'inganno. Credi soltanto nella tua fede e lascia che purifichi tutto." —Lila, sacerdotessa di Erunia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543ac63f-dfde-412d-9d04-d1069456f244\', \'multiverseId\': 332588}, \'multiverseid\': 332588}, {\'name\': \'消去\', \'text\': \'エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「目を信じてはなりません。魔道士は目を欺く達人です。頼るべきは信仰のみ。信仰はすべてを清らかにしてくれるでしょう。」 ――エルニアの司祭、リーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6aaba78-01cc-428a-90d1-a694c941e67c\', \'multiverseId\': 332837}, \'multiverseid\': 332837}, {\'name\': \'삭제\', \'text\': \'부여마법 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자신의 눈을 믿지 마라. 마도사는 속임수에 능한 자들이다. 대신 자신의 신념을 따르면 모든 것이 선명하게 보일 것이다." —에루니아 사제 릴라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec046257-30de-4cb4-9906-2b8a60f384af\', \'multiverseId\': 330596}, \'multiverseid\': 330596}, {\'name\': \'Apagar\', \'text\': \'Exile o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não confie nos seus olhos, pois magos são mestres da enganação. Confie apenas na fé. Ela deixará tudo claro." — Lila, sacerdotisa eruniana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b7a71f-74d4-4539-b348-f17384aaee85\', \'multiverseId\': 331343}, \'multiverseid\': 331343}, {\'name\': \'Стереть\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Не доверяй глазам, ведь маги — мастера обмана. Доверяй лишь своей вере. Она развеет морок». — Лайла, эрунийская священница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35af23f6-b7e3-403b-b28e-1822d6194646\', \'multiverseId\': 331841}, \'multiverseid\': 331841}, {\'name\': \'抹消\', \'text\': \'放逐目标结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「不要相信你的双眼，因为法师们个个精于欺敌。你能相信的只有自己的信念。它将替你扫除一切障碍。」～艾鲁尼亚僧侣梨拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a848d368-ec3a-430b-93bd-d45246369085\', \'multiverseId\': 330347}, \'multiverseid\': 330347}, {\'name\': \'抹消\', \'text\': \'放逐目標結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「不要相信你的雙眼，因為法師們個個精於欺敵。你能相信的只有自己的信念。它將替你掃除一切障礙。」～艾魯尼亞僧侶梨拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3da3d73-27b8-48bc-98b8-92c2b2f31648\', \'multiverseId\': 330845}, \'multiverseid\': 330845}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Junker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Schwachen sich in den Kampf stürzen, wirkt ihr Mut ansteckend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332105&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1879a6c6-7cd7-402a-9a5a-a6d8f9f69d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 332105}, \'multiverseid\': 332105}, {\'name\': \'Escudero aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los mansos cargan en la batalla, el coraje es contagioso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244ac7b4-6599-420f-a6b7-0d338f29c111\', \'multiverseId\': 332354}, \'multiverseid\': 332354}, {\'name\': \'Écuyer avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Quand les humbles chargent au combat, le courage devient contagieux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331607&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b649050-1a3d-4f3a-b64e-73d54903ced1\', \'multiverseId\': 331607}, \'multiverseid\': 331607}, {\'name\': \'Scudiero Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Quando anche il più mansueto si lancia nella mischia, il coraggio diventa contagioso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4954a7-7842-4a9c-8cb7-aaf06be76d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 332603}, \'multiverseid\': 332603}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの従者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n賛美（あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'弱者が戦場へ突撃すると、勇気は伝染しやすくなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75da25ba-99d4-4d13-bf3b-a84c5cc19e1c\', \'multiverseId\': 332852}, \'multiverseid\': 332852}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 견습기사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n고귀 (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 병사\', \'flavor\': \'약자들이 전장으로 돌격하면 모두에게 용기가 생긴다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c01a5c40-c5f3-435a-88a6-dda9cd6445a5\', \'multiverseId\': 330611}, \'multiverseid\': 330611}, {\'name\': \'Escudeiro Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Quando até os seres mais pacíficos atacam em batalha, a coragem torna-se contagiante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce50abc7-5895-4f5f-8117-930d8265a1f0\', \'multiverseId\': 331358}, \'multiverseid\': 331358}, {\'name\': \'Крылатый Оруженосец\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, то существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Когда кроткие рвутся в бой, храбрость становится заразительной.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ad2e8f-1b4c-4d2a-94a2-03761c60c89f\', \'multiverseId\': 331856}, \'multiverseid\': 331856}, {\'name\': \'艾文扈从\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n颂威（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'当弱者冲向战阵，那股勇气会传染开来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf0eab7-8372-4212-ad36-5f9ab96aea8d\', \'multiverseId\': 330362}, \'multiverseid\': 330362}, {\'name\': \'艾文扈從\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n頌威（每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，該生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'當弱者衝向戰陣，那股勇氣會傳染開來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf02c7c0-3784-4bd1-abe8-2b3aae246f9f\', \'multiverseId\': 330860}, \'multiverseid\': 330860}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belohnung des Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle bleibenden Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich dachte, der Wind brächte mich ins Jenseits, doch er hob mich auf die Füße und ich kämpfte weiter." —Idrus, Kriegspriester von Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37f7ec4-d573-4092-9115-791321dd80a2\', \'multiverseId\': 332067}, \'multiverseid\': 332067}, {\'name\': \'Recompensa de la fe\', \'text\': \'Regresa al campo de batalla todas las cartas de permanente de tu cementerio que hayan ido allí desde el campo de batalla este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Creí que el viento me estaba acompañando a mi destino final, pero me puso de nuevo en pie y seguí luchando." —Idrus, sacerdote guerrero de Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1a63f5-753a-4614-9bc0-f2e3b3263f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 332316}, \'multiverseid\': 332316}, {\'name\': \'Récompense de la foi\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de permanent de votre cimetière qui ont été mises, ce tour-ci, dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai bien cru que le vent me poussait vers ma destination finale alors qu\'en fait, il m\'a remis sur pieds, et j\'ai continué le combat. » —Idrus, prêtre de guerre de Thiune", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360c99e2-f377-4044-8983-a17479b95c44\', \'multiverseId\': 331569}, \'multiverseid\': 331569}, {\'name\': \'Premio della Fede\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte permanenti nel tuo cimitero che vi erano state messe dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Credevo che il vento mi stesse accompagnando verso la mia destinazione finale, invece mi rimise in piedi e io continuai a combattere." —Idrus, sacerdote guerriero di Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48276f59-a67d-4c46-85e5-3f41852bbceb\', \'multiverseId\': 332565}, \'multiverseid\': 332565}, {\'name\': \'信仰の見返り\', \'text\': \'このターンに戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれたすべてのパーマネント・カードを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「風が終焉の地へといざなうものと思っていたが、風は私を立たせ、そして私は戦い続けた。」 ――テューンの戦僧、イドラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364d0e6c-2172-4ebd-a135-aafa053e68c5\', \'multiverseId\': 332814}, \'multiverseid\': 332814}, {\'name\': \'신념의 보상\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 지속물 카드 중, 이 턴에 전장으로부터 무덤에 들어간 모든 지속물 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"바람이 나를 저승으로 데려가는 것이라 생각했지만, 오히려 그 바람은 나를 다시 일으켜 세웠고 나는 전투를 계속했다." —쑨의 전쟁 사제 이드러스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ced4e7-bed1-4724-8466-51b1acdbaf4c\', \'multiverseId\': 330573}, \'multiverseid\': 330573}, {\'name\': \'Recompensa da Fé\', \'text\': \'Devolva ao campo de batalha todos os cards de permanentes no seu cemitério que foram colocados lá vindos do campo de batalha neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu pensei que o vento estivesse me empurrando para a minha jornada final, mas ele me colocou de pé e eu continuei lutando." — Idrus, sacerdote de guerra de Thune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd2d6d6-fa0a-4f8d-b1a6-055c678a5ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 331320}, \'multiverseid\': 331320}, {\'name\': \'Награда за Веру\', \'text\': \'Верните на поле битвы все находящиеся на вашем кладбище карты перманентов, которые попали туда с поля битвы в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я подумал, что ветер поведет меня в последний путь, но он поднял меня на ноги, и я продолжил сражаться». — Идрус, военный священник из Туна\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663e26d0-c67f-4c9f-98e3-a53108f37d60\', \'multiverseId\': 331818}, \'multiverseid\': 331818}, {\'name\': \'信念报偿\', \'text\': \'将所有于本回合中从战场置入你坟墓场的永久物牌返回战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我原以为这风要将我引向死亡，然而它却令我重获力量，继续战斗。」～图恩战僧壹卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923d2972-80f1-48fc-b003-87a2ddb7a361\', \'multiverseId\': 330324}, \'multiverseid\': 330324}, {\'name\': \'信念報償\', \'text\': \'將所有於本回合中從戰場置入你墳墓場的永久物牌返回戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我原以為這風要將我引向死亡，然而它卻令我重獲力量，繼續戰鬥。」～圖恩戰僧壹卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfb1815-49aa-463c-abf7-42ec9f0869e2\', \'multiverseId\': 330822}, \'multiverseid\': 330822}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergschlucht-Minotaurus\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir schleichen uns über diese Klippen, überqueren die wackelige Brücke, und suchen uns dann einen Weg durch die Vulkanhänge auf der anderen Seite." „Ich dachte, der kürzeste Weg wäre durch die Schlucht?" „Das stimmt." „Sollten wir dann nicht...?" „Nein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332062&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e4c91d-cdea-4e0d-9ed8-734695195b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 332062}, \'multiverseid\': 332062}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro del desfiladero\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Escalaremos estas cornisas, atravesaremos el Puente Frágil y luego bajaremos por las pendientes volcánicas del otro lado." "¿Pero la ruta más corta no es por el desfiladero?" "Sí." "¿Entonces no deberíamos...?" "No."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a90423b1-495a-4587-bbdb-204155929d1b\', \'multiverseId\': 332311}, \'multiverseid\': 332311}, {\'name\': \'Minotaure des canyons\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous escaladerons ces falaises, nous traverserons Frêlepont et nous nous fraierons un chemin sur les pentes volcaniques avec nos armes. » « Ce n\'est pas plus court en passant par le canyon ? » « Si, en effet. » « Ne devrait-on alors pas — » « Non. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331564&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad6aa8c4-ecb8-42cd-a618-ff29f4a9d33a\', \'multiverseId\': 331564}, \'multiverseid\': 331564}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro del Canyon\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Scaliamo questi dirupi, attraversiamo Ponte Friabile e poi ci facciamo strada scendendo lungo le scarpate vulcaniche sull\\\'altro lato." "Non è più corto attraversare il canyon?" "Sì." "Quindi non dovremmo..." "No."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'043e01fd-7290-4bd0-8101-e00aa2686ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 332560}, \'multiverseid\': 332560}, {\'name\': \'峡谷のミノタウルス\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここの崖を登り、崩れ橋を渡って、逆側の火口坂を戦いながら下がっていくことになります。」 「これは峡谷の一番の近道じゃなかったのか？」 「間違いないです。」 「それならそんな――」 「駄目です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'187b157a-040a-40b3-905a-56e3ca9ded01\', \'multiverseId\': 332809}, \'multiverseid\': 332809}, {\'name\': \'협곡 미노타우로스\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스\', \'flavor\': \'"이제 우리는 이 절벽을 타고 올라가서 아슬아슬한 다리를 건넌 다음 그 너머에 있는 화산 언덕을 내려가야 해." "협곡을 가로지르는 게 훨씬 빠르지 않아?" "맞아." "그럼 그쪽으로 가는 게..." "아니."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f89c8ac-be9e-4894-b4dc-362587d6e53c\', \'multiverseId\': 330568}, \'multiverseid\': 330568}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro do Desfiladeiro\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós vamos escalar essas colinas, atravessar a Ponte Quebradiça, e batalhar para descer do outro lado, nas encostas vulcânicas." "Não há uma rota mais rápida atravessando o desfiladeiro?" "Sim." "Então não deveríamos..." "Não."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49aee495-01df-41bd-a856-c212fa26477c\', \'multiverseId\': 331315}, \'multiverseid\': 331315}, {\'name\': \'Каньонный Минотавр\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы взберемся на вот эти утесы, перейдем Шаткий Мост, а потом проложим себе путь вниз, по склонам вулкана на другой стороне». «Но ведь самый короткий путь лежит через каньон?» «Да». «Так, может, нам надо...» «Не надо».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90613e9b-fcb9-4b35-8b18-749b3fee8392\', \'multiverseId\': 331813}, \'multiverseid\': 331813}, {\'name\': \'峡谷牛头怪\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们要爬上这些悬崖，横越危桥，然后从另一侧的火山坡一路打下去。」「这不正是横越峡谷的最短路径？」「对。」「那么我们难道～」 「不能。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d17e77-02cd-4ffa-9fe2-a2da7678165c\', \'multiverseId\': 330319}, \'multiverseid\': 330319}, {\'name\': \'峽谷牛頭怪\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我們要爬上這些懸崖，橫越危橋，然後從另一側的火山坡一路打下去。」 「這不正是橫越峽谷的最短路徑？」 「對。」 「那麼我們難道～」 「不能。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'713cfdfb-7939-4d68-a27b-6dd485f7c061\', \'multiverseId\': 330817}, \'multiverseid\': 330817}]', '[{\'name\': \'Berührung der Ewigkeit\', \'text\': \'Zähle zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments die bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst. Dein Lebenspunktestand wird zu dieser Zahl.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zeit ist ein wachsamer Tyrann, doch einige konnten ihrem Blick entrinnen." —Laikas, erunischer Mönch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332164&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32571efd-55fa-4185-aec7-0d88049e9376\', \'multiverseId\': 332164}, \'multiverseid\': 332164}, {\'name\': \'Toque de lo eterno\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cuenta el número de permanentes que controlas. Tu total de vidas se convierte en ese número.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El tiempo es un tirano que todo vigila, pero hay quienes se han liberado de su mirada." —Laikas, monje eruniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b3c95f6-e699-44c2-91f1-3501a48e03bc\', \'multiverseId\': 332413}, \'multiverseid\': 332413}, {\'name\': "Toucher de l\'Éternel", \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, comptez le nombre de permanents que vous contrôlez. Votre total de points de vie devient égal à ce nombre.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Le temps est un tyran vigilant, mais certains sont parvenus à se soustraire à son regard. » —Laikas, moine érunien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8543458-8168-4fb8-9be6-eed185ff1555\', \'multiverseId\': 331666}, \'multiverseid\': 331666}, {\'name\': "Tocco dell\'Eterno", \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, conta il numero di permanenti che controlli. I tuoi punti vita diventano quel numero.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tempo è un tiranno vigile, ma ci sono coloro che sono riusciti a liberarsi dal suo sguardo." —Laikas, monaco di Erunia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a3cd19b-0896-45cc-8d9f-b1daa9f93a52\', \'multiverseId\': 332662}, \'multiverseid\': 332662}, {\'name\': \'永遠との接触\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールするパーマネントの数を数える。あなたのライフの総量はその数になる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「『時』は疲れを知らぬ暴君だが、その眼光から自由になった者もいる。」 ――エルニアの僧侶リーカス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e756907-5151-40e1-be05-58a4773bc117\', \'multiverseId\': 332911}, \'multiverseid\': 332911}, {\'name\': \'영원함의 손길\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 지속물의 개수를 센다. 그 숫자가 당신의 생명 총점이 된다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"시간은 빈틈을 보이지 않는 폭군이지만, 간혹 시간의 그 철저한 감시에서 탈출한 자들도 있다." —에루니아 승려 라이카스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47239340-bb3b-40ea-859c-d1c4ebf0933e\', \'multiverseId\': 330670}, \'multiverseid\': 330670}, {\'name\': \'Toque do Eterno\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, conte o número de permanentes que você controla. Aquele número se torna seu total de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O tempo é um tirano vigilante, mas existem aqueles que conseguem escapar de sua vigília." — Laikas, monge eruniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc431a77-21f1-4ac8-abbe-a4a8cec257b0\', \'multiverseId\': 331417}, \'multiverseid\': 331417}, {\'name\': \'Прикосновение Вечности\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки сосчитайте перманенты под вашим контролем. Ваше количество жизней становится равным этому количеству.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Время — бдительный хозяин, но некоторым удалось ускользнуть от его взора». — Лайкас, эрунийский монах\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aab9a71-f297-408a-ac5a-c741a3394913\', \'multiverseId\': 331915}, \'multiverseid\': 331915}, {\'name\': \'永恒眷临\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，计算由你操控的永久物数量。你的总生命成为该数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「时间是警觉的暴君，但是仍有人成功脱离他的监视。」～艾鲁尼亚僧侣徕卡斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ca4c916-bc46-431f-9f2e-c0790e4bc64b\', \'multiverseId\': 330421}, \'multiverseid\': 330421}, {\'name\': \'永恆眷臨\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，計算你控制的永久物數量。你的總生命成為該數量。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「時間是警覺的暴君，但是仍有人成功脫離他的監視。」 ～艾魯尼亞僧侶徠卡斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9328646-f72a-4856-b7d3-6d5d91de0051\', \'multiverseId\': 330919}, \'multiverseid\': 330919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschützender Greif\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Beschützende Greif +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kriegstrommeln feuern die Herzen all jener an, die für die Gerechtigkeit kämpfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332069&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4177950-473f-4922-96ef-25f78858c26f\', \'multiverseId\': 332069}, \'multiverseid\': 332069}, {\'name\': \'Grifo protector\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Grifo protector obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Los tambores de guerra agitan los corazones de todos aquellos que luchan por la rectitud.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a34dd5-c464-470b-b0bd-f141708b3b65\', \'multiverseId\': 332318}, \'multiverseid\': 332318}, {\'name\': \'Protecteur griffon\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Protecteur griffon gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : griffon\', \'flavor\': "L\'écho des tambours de guerre donne du cœur à tous ceux qui se battent au nom de la justice.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7a2a8d-8839-4d60-a7aa-a32f689f88ef\', \'multiverseId\': 331571}, \'multiverseid\': 331571}, {\'name\': \'Grifone Protettore\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Grifone Protettore prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Grifone\', \'flavor\': \'I tamburi di guerra infiammano i cuori di tutti coloro che combattono per la giustizia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da0914b-9e25-405e-adea-539d15a1d59e\', \'multiverseId\': 332567}, \'multiverseid\': 332567}, {\'name\': \'庇護するグリフィン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n他のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、庇護のグリフィンはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'戦太鼓は大義のために戦う者の胸を高鳴らせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa0b4438-800d-4e63-a623-cb713956352a\', \'multiverseId\': 332816}, \'multiverseid\': 332816}, {\'name\': \'보호자 그리핀\', \'text\': \'비행\\n다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 보호자 그리핀은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그리핀\', \'flavor\': \'전쟁의 북소리는 정의를 위해 싸우는 자들의 가슴 속에 불을 지핀다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2571c6-235e-4cc1-9ae9-ba6f28c9d366\', \'multiverseId\': 330575}, \'multiverseid\': 330575}, {\'name\': \'Grifo Protetor\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que outra criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Grifo Protetor recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'Os tambores da guerra ressoam nos corações daqueles que lutam pela retidão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2bcb8e-edc9-4c95-b414-8118c6bca508\', \'multiverseId\': 331322}, \'multiverseid\': 331322}, {\'name\': \'Грифон-Защитник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Грифон-Защитник получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Грифон\', \'flavor\': \'Боевые барабаны волнуют сердца всех, кто борется за праведное дело.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25a4cf0-2e37-4fea-9de6-e313e448d42f\', \'multiverseId\': 331820}, \'multiverseid\': 331820}, {\'name\': \'卫护狮鹫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，卫护狮鹫得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'战鼓令所有为正义而战者都为之振奋。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb3fb8e-bb7e-4a09-85bb-0a2e90e959e2\', \'multiverseId\': 330326}, \'multiverseid\': 330326}, {\'name\': \'衛護獅鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，衛護獅鷲得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～獅鷲\', \'flavor\': \'戰鼓令所有為正義而戰者都為之振奮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f39b23-258f-4405-816a-acc6f1b6faa5\', \'multiverseId\': 330824}, \'multiverseid\': 330824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutige Abrechnung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, verliert ihr Beherrscher 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt keine größere Torheit, als sich gegen mich zu stellen." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332187&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd597a49-6ba1-4e26-824f-dceb26f28705\', \'multiverseId\': 332187}, \'multiverseid\': 332187}, {\'name\': \'Venganza de sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura te ataque a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas, el controlador de esa criatura pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay mayor locura que plantarme cara." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca96cb7-4b8d-4eb7-b5a5-599f90509399\', \'multiverseId\': 332436}, \'multiverseid\': 332436}, {\'name\': \'Jugement du sang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, le contrôleur de cette créature perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Vous opposer à moi serait faire preuve d\'une grande stupidité. » —Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331689&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b48f21-b3a2-4adf-b377-d2e3995bccd8\', \'multiverseId\': 331689}, \'multiverseid\': 331689}, {\'name\': \'Scotto di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, il controllore di quella creatura perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste atto più sciocco del mettersi contro di me." —Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3068ecdd-dcb4-4013-b6cb-99e051b1611b\', \'multiverseId\': 332685}, \'multiverseid\': 332685}, {\'name\': \'血の報い\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体あなたかあなたがコントロールするいずれかのプレインズウォーカーに攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私に敵対すること以上の愚行もあるまい。」――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5431637c-8017-493c-9982-79cf6e7abfdd\', \'multiverseId\': 332934}, \'multiverseid\': 332934}, {\'name\': \'피의 숙청\', \'text\': \'생물이 당신 또는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격할 때마다, 그 생물의 조종자는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"감히 나에게 맞서다니 어리석기 짝이 없구나." —니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7032729-904c-47f5-93a9-b6d10f731819\', \'multiverseId\': 330693}, \'multiverseid\': 330693}, {\'name\': \'Vingança Sangrenta\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura atacar você ou um planeswalker que você controle, o controlador daquela criatura perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há tolice maior do que ficar contra mim." — Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8785448a-fb25-4bdc-8493-6cedab72cfff\', \'multiverseId\': 331440}, \'multiverseid\': 331440}, {\'name\': \'Кровавая Расплата\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо атакует вас или planeswalker-а под вашим контролем, контролирующий то существо игрок теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Нет большей глупости, чем выступить против меня». — Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee9c197d-90f3-4cc3-8c31-093d439f7b74\', \'multiverseId\': 331938}, \'multiverseid\': 331938}, {\'name\': \'讨还血债\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物攻击你或由你操控的一个鹏洛客时，该生物的操控者失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「反抗我是最蠢的事。」～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a68b6df-cb71-4f78-bc72-4caa3d4a60fd\', \'multiverseId\': 330444}, \'multiverseid\': 330444}, {\'name\': \'討還血債\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物攻擊你或由你操控的一個鵬洛客時，該生物的操控者失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「反抗我是最蠢的事。」～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae06788-fae0-4875-8ff4-6965d9706679\', \'multiverseId\': 330942}, \'multiverseid\': 330942}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutjäger-Fledermaus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Blutjäger-Fledermaus ins Spiel kommt, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Lebenspunkte, und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fledermaus\', \'flavor\': \'Sie kehrt bereitwillig zurück, um das gesaugte Blut mit ihrem schaurigen Meister zu teilen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b1343f1-e623-48e8-a50d-7d81541c0558\', \'multiverseId\': 332081}, \'multiverseid\': 332081}, {\'name\': \'Murciélago cazasangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Murciélago cazasangre entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Murciélago\', \'flavor\': \'Regresa ansioso por compartir su festín de sangre con su amo necrófago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7eac35-e302-4578-b746-9729939dba98\', \'multiverseId\': 332330}, \'multiverseid\': 332330}, {\'name\': \'Chauve-souris chassesang\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand la Chauve-souris chassesang arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chauve-souris\', \'flavor\': "Elle revient, désireuse de partager un festin de sang et d\'entrailles avec son maître répugnant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7652ff3e-97fa-457c-8238-cca66882280e\', \'multiverseId\': 331583}, \'multiverseid\': 331583}, {\'name\': \'Pipistrello Cacciasangue\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Pipistrello Cacciasangue entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pipistrello\', \'flavor\': \'Ritorna ansioso di condividere il banchetto di sangue e violenza con il suo macabro padrone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d873e5d7-e157-48e0-8043-62ac21826a21\', \'multiverseId\': 332579}, \'multiverseid\': 332579}, {\'name\': \'血狩りコウモリ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n血狩りコウモリが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コウモリ\', \'flavor\': \'血と殺戮の宴を求め、残忍な主人とともにそれは舞い戻った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdaba2ec-766d-41ec-a307-998156bcbd1a\', \'multiverseId\': 332828}, \'multiverseid\': 332828}, {\'name\': \'피를 사냥하는 박쥐\', \'text\': \'비행\\n피를 사냥하는 박쥐가 전장에 들어올 때, 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 박쥐\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 자신이 즐긴 피의 향연을 사악한 주인에게 보고한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2d57710-10e8-429e-82f6-06f1a33ed8aa\', \'multiverseId\': 330587}, \'multiverseid\': 330587}, {\'name\': \'Morcego Caçador de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Morcego Caçador de Sangue entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Morcego\', \'flavor\': \'Ele volta desejoso de compartilhar o festival de sangue com seu mestre carniçal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2db9e858-c975-4ddc-b671-bfedf77fbcde\', \'multiverseId\': 331334}, \'multiverseid\': 331334}, {\'name\': \'Нетопырь, Кровавый Охотник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Нетопырь, Кровавый Охотник выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок теряет 2 жизни, а вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Летучая-мышь\', \'flavor\': \'Он возвращается, готовый разделить кровавую трапезу со своим страшным хозяином.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a248ae8c-2d7b-4248-9613-439700a510ce\', \'multiverseId\': 331832}, \'multiverseid\': 331832}, {\'name\': \'血猎蝙蝠\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当血猎蝙蝠进战场时，目标牌手失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'他急着回来与其阴森主子共享鲜血与血块的大餐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e888c4-0185-4c86-976b-5007dfbbbc48\', \'multiverseId\': 330338}, \'multiverseid\': 330338}, {\'name\': \'血獵蝙蝠\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當血獵蝙蝠進戰場時，目標玩家失去2點生命且你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～蝙蝠\', \'flavor\': \'牠急著回來與其陰森主子共享鮮血與血塊的大餐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9548fc60-7652-4750-a126-e430da4261b2\', \'multiverseId\': 330836}, \'multiverseid\': 330836}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutthron-Vampir\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Der Blutthron-Vampir erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ich brauche, ist Blut. Was ich nicht brauche, ist deine Erlaubnis."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332195&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db487b9-c3f2-4d1e-9d2d-208031d0f98e\', \'multiverseId\': 332195}, \'multiverseid\': 332195}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro del trono sangriento\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: La Vampiro del trono sangriento obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que necesito es tu sangre. Lo que no necesito es tu permiso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c392692d-ed67-4f00-a082-c191279d63d5\', \'multiverseId\': 332444}, \'multiverseid\': 332444}, {\'name\': \'Vampire du trône de sang\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une créature : La Vampire du trône de sang gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai besoin de votre sang. Pas de votre permission. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331697&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb63308-eea5-4eb6-8fc1-ba5bea08b1c8\', \'multiverseId\': 331697}, \'multiverseid\': 331697}, {\'name\': \'Vampira del Trono Insanguinato\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: La Vampira del Trono Insanguinato prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Quello di cui ho bisogno è il tuo sangue, non il tuo permesso di prendermelo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bcd83c-2687-4654-a61b-f0d244785f6b\', \'multiverseId\': 332693}, \'multiverseid\': 332693}, {\'name\': \'血の座の吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：血の座の吸血鬼は、ターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「私に必要なのはお前の血だ。お前の許可など求めておらぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3203917e-7138-4750-a66e-e01864e58776\', \'multiverseId\': 332942}, \'multiverseid\': 332942}, {\'name\': \'피묻은 왕좌의 흡혈귀\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 희생한다: 피묻은 왕좌의 흡혈귀는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"난 너의 피가 필요할 뿐, 너의 허락 따위는 필요 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a736eae-ec60-4fce-bd3c-f515aee85228\', \'multiverseId\': 330701}, \'multiverseid\': 330701}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro do Sangue Real\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Vampiro do Sangue Real recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"O que eu preciso é do seu sangue. O que eu não preciso é da sua permissão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5be93d28-1b78-48ea-a771-7cf1e34075d0\', \'multiverseId\': 331448}, \'multiverseid\': 331448}, {\'name\': \'Вампир Кровавого Престола\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте существо: Вампир Кровавого Престола получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Что мне нужно, так это твоя кровь. Что мне совсем не нужно, так это твое разрешение».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1328d12d-c2fd-489e-b90c-8387d22894e0\', \'multiverseId\': 331946}, \'multiverseid\': 331946}, {\'name\': \'血座吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：血座吸血鬼得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我要的是你的鲜血，不是你的许可。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cd00085-4a38-4635-a55e-628f30b4186a\', \'multiverseId\': 330452}, \'multiverseid\': 330452}, {\'name\': \'血座吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物：血座吸血鬼得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我要的是你的鮮血，不是你的許可。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f02151-eb1d-4b1f-a81a-efbaad5d1e61\', \'multiverseId\': 330950}, \'multiverseid\': 330950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bodensiegel\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bodensiegel ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nKarten in Friedhöfen können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Mögen alle, die wir begraben haben, auf ewig begraben bleiben." —Seton, Zentauren-Druide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332208&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55364fe6-0261-43e5-978b-5e2a0e7e3b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 332208}, \'multiverseid\': 332208}, {\'name\': \'Sello terrestre\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sello terrestre entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLas cartas de los cementerios no pueden ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que todo lo que hemos enterrado esté enterrado eternamente." —Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc7ab664-c5d0-4101-9624-3463cc6f4e80\', \'multiverseId\': 332457}, \'multiverseid\': 332457}, {\'name\': \'Sceau cthonien\', \'text\': \'Quand le Sceau cthonien arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLes cartes des cimetières ne peuvent pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Que ceux qui sont enterrés le restent à jamais. » —Selton, druide centaure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331710&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af2505da-6b82-4c32-984b-840eecd8d0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 331710}, \'multiverseid\': 331710}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Terreno\', \'text\': \'Quando il Sigillo Terreno entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLe carte nei cimiteri non possono essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciamo che tutto ciò che abbiamo sepolto resti sepolto per sempre." —Seton, druido centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de6ec55-7315-4553-8ad5-c866dd54e87d\', \'multiverseId\': 332706}, \'multiverseid\': 332706}, {\'name\': \'地の封印\', \'text\': \'地の封印が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\n墓地にあるカードは呪文や能力の対象にならない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの所有物はすべて地に埋め、永遠に放置するのだ。」 ――ケンタウルスのドルイド、シートン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99541089-8fe5-4865-9a59-5985a07562c9\', \'multiverseId\': 332955}, \'multiverseid\': 332955}, {\'name\': \'대지의 봉인\', \'text\': \'대지의 봉인이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n무덤에 있는 카드는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"묻힌 것들은 영원히 묻혀 있기를." —켄타우로스 드루이드 시튼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7beb5cdb-2f04-469f-927c-c556bdb1c6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 330714}, \'multiverseid\': 330714}, {\'name\': \'Selo da Terra\', \'text\': \'Quando Selo da Terra entrar em jogo, compre um card.\\nOs cards nos cemitérios não podem ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Que todos os que nós enterramos fiquem enterrados para sempre." — Seton, druida centauro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b641df-004f-406e-99e6-a3e8ec885d05\', \'multiverseId\': 331461}, \'multiverseid\': 331461}, {\'name\': \'Печать Земли\', \'text\': \'Когда Печать Земли выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nКарты на кладбищах не могут быть целями заклинаний или способностей.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть все, кого мы похороним, будут похоронены навеки». — Сетон, кентавр-друид\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b57d4ac-e1e9-4522-8e1f-2dadab16cc38\', \'multiverseId\': 331959}, \'multiverseid\': 331959}, {\'name\': \'大地封印\', \'text\': \'当大地封印进战场时，抓一张牌。坟墓场中的牌不能成为咒语或异能的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「让我们所埋葬的一切都长埋地下。」～半人马德鲁伊熙藤\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faa40d19-8e81-40ce-8222-8ad198eced6d\', \'multiverseId\': 330465}, \'multiverseid\': 330465}, {\'name\': \'大地封印\', \'text\': \'當大地封印進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n墳墓場中的牌不能成為咒語或異能的目標。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「讓我們所埋葬的一切都長埋地下。」 ～半人馬德魯伊熙藤\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd05d0a4-5d51-495c-a65a-8d7f1379c418\', \'multiverseId\': 330963}, \'multiverseid\': 330963}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brüllendes Primadox\', \'text\': \'Bringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie sind einfach zu entdecken. Aber willst du überhaupt eines finden?" —Juruk, kalonischer Spurensucher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2982bf0-1f2b-43e8-835e-827c35093bf1\', \'multiverseId\': 331974}, \'multiverseid\': 331974}, {\'name\': \'Primadox rugiente\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa una criatura que controles a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Son fáciles de encontrar. La pregunta es: ¿seguro que quieres encontrar uno?" —Juruk, rastreador kaloniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f2dc62b-5b94-4def-8e22-9ba1dc394eff\', \'multiverseId\': 332223}, \'multiverseid\': 332223}, {\'name\': \'Primadox rugissant\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, renvoyez une créature que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils sont faciles à trouver. Mais tenez-vous vraiment à en trouver un ? » —Juruk, traqueur kalonien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d49369-05c2-4dfb-8c89-fa966d4824e1\', \'multiverseId\': 331476}, \'multiverseid\': 331476}, {\'name\': \'Primadox Ruggente\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, fai tornare una creatura che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono abbastanza facili da trovare. La domanda è: sei sicuro che vuoi trovarne uno?" —Juruk, battipista di Kalonia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be64387d-38b1-4ade-b2fb-4d3c0399c096\', \'multiverseId\': 332472}, \'multiverseid\': 332472}, {\'name\': \'咆哮するプリマドックス\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「見つけるのは簡単だ。問題は、あんたが本当に見つけたいかどうかだ。」 ――カロニアの追跡者、ジュラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f352eb4-9ade-4ba4-ad6d-a7897dc52ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 332721}, \'multiverseid\': 332721}, {\'name\': \'울부짖는 프리마독스\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'"그걸 찾는 거야 어렵진 않지. 그런데 그걸 진짜 찾고 싶은 거야? 확실해?" —칼로니아의 사냥꾼 주루크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'418fb950-71be-4ad8-bca3-417e25e5fb30\', \'multiverseId\': 330480}, \'multiverseid\': 330480}, {\'name\': \'Primadox Rugidor\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, devolva uma criatura que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles são muito fáceis de se encontrar. A questão é: você quer realmente encontrar um?" — Juruk, rastreador kaloniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bee4e6c0-20ef-4d74-ac90-447aa8c275e3\', \'multiverseId\': 331227}, \'multiverseid\': 331227}, {\'name\': \'Ревущий Перводокс\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки верните существо под вашим контролем в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Найти их довольно просто. Вопрос в том, а хотите ли вы?» — Джурук, калонский охотник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4311c8de-9133-49a1-afd3-705d33dfa3eb\', \'multiverseId\': 331725}, \'multiverseid\': 331725}, {\'name\': \'咆哮原跺兽\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，将一个由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「要找出他们很简单。问题是，你确定想找一个出来吗？」～卡隆尼亚追猎人裘鲁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40905d79-370d-4a4d-ba71-c98c2532e100\', \'multiverseId\': 330231}, \'multiverseid\': 330231}, {\'name\': \'咆哮原跺獸\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，將一個由你操控的生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'「要找出牠們很簡單。問題是，你確定想找一個出來嗎？」 ～卡隆尼亞追獵人裘魯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068e6f20-4da0-410d-9caf-c93d9e3eadb6\', \'multiverseId\': 330729}, \'multiverseid\': 330729}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra Hitzkopf\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra Hitzkopf fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n-2: Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauber. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\n-6: Chandra Hitzkopf fügt bis zu sechs Kreaturen und/oder Spielern deiner Wahl je 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'515c4691-38ae-4fbb-8c7a-8720306d24a0\', \'multiverseId\': 332061}, \'multiverseid\': 332061}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, la instigadora\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, la instigadora hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\n-2: Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro este turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\n-6: Chandra, la instigadora hace 6 puntos de daño a cada una de hasta seis criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f34f92-1cbf-409a-bd13-212666315639\', \'multiverseId\': 332310}, \'multiverseid\': 332310}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, le brandon\', \'text\': "+1 : Chandra, le brandon inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\n-2 : Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\n-6 : Ciblez jusqu\'à six créatures et/ou joueurs. Chandra, le brandon leur inflige 6 blessures à chacune.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331563&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15753249-45f5-4305-bd84-d6af5ff0cc39\', \'multiverseId\': 331563}, \'multiverseid\': 331563}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, il Tizzone Ardente\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, il Tizzone Ardente infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n-2: Quando lanci la tua prossima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in questo turno, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\n-6: Scegli fino a sei creature e/o giocatori bersaglio. Chandra, il Tizzone Ardente infligge 6 danni a ciascuno di essi.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1621623a-c6fe-4288-a42f-ef9d18ff597d\', \'multiverseId\': 332559}, \'multiverseid\': 332559}, {\'name\': \'炬火のチャンドラ\', \'text\': \'＋１：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炬火のチャンドラはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n－２：このターン、あなたが次にインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文を唱えたとき、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n－６：クリーチャーやプレイヤーを最大６つまで対象とする。炬火のチャンドラはそれらにそれぞれ６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba26b8f-c0b9-452c-b6e5-6a369d0980d4\', \'multiverseId\': 332808}, \'multiverseid\': 332808}, {\'name\': \'선동가 찬드라\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 선동가 찬드라는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n-2: 이 턴에 다음으로 당신이 순간마법이나 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때, 그 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\\n-6: 생물 및 플레이어를 대상으로 최대 여섯 개까지의 목표를 정한다. 선동가 찬드라는 각 목표에게 피해 6점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — - 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b7256d-8d39-4219-9b50-43633381af8c\', \'multiverseId\': 330567}, \'multiverseid\': 330567}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, a Instigadora\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, a Instigadora, causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\n-2: Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica instantânea ou feitiço neste turno, copie aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\n-6: Chandra, a Instigadora, causa 6 pontos de dano a cada um de até seis criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4657ec-63cd-43cb-a6d1-604a322ed65d\', \'multiverseId\': 331314}, \'multiverseid\': 331314}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Разжигательница\', \'text\': \'+1: Чандра, Разжигательница наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.\\n-2: когда вы будете разыгрывать ваше следующее мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства в этом ходу, скопируйте то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для этой копии.\\n-6: Чандра, Разжигательница наносит 6 повреждений каждому из не более шести целевых существ и (или) игроков.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da1c2dd-b582-47e0-b889-0f2b73013e01\', \'multiverseId\': 331812}, \'multiverseid\': 331812}, {\'name\': \'惹事人茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：惹事人茜卓对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。-2：当你于本回合施放下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。-6：惹事人茜卓对至多六个目标生物和／或牌手各造成6点伤害。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb2e12e4-26fd-4da0-b6a1-33ddf8a1262a\', \'multiverseId\': 330318}, \'multiverseid\': 330318}, {\'name\': \'惹事人茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：惹事人茜卓對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。\\n-2：當你於本回合施放下一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，複製該咒語。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\\n-6：惹事人茜卓對至多六個目標生物和／或玩家各造成6點傷害。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1f739e-389a-4834-a139-0a639bc5b0a7\', \'multiverseId\': 330816}, \'multiverseid\': 330816}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Wut\', \'text\': \'Chandras Wut fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte und allen Kreaturen, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hatte sie gefragt, ob sie die einfache Lösung haben wollen. Einfach für mich, meinte ich damit."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'645eba19-eeba-40cb-ac20-e6e90236d7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 331971}, \'multiverseid\': 331971}, {\'name\': \'Furia de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Furia de Chandra hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y 1 punto de daño a cada criatura que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Les pregunté si querían hacer las cosas fáciles. Fáciles para mí."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'443c5dae-858a-4bb6-942b-1e7de389511d\', \'multiverseId\': 332220}, \'multiverseid\': 332220}, {\'name\': \'Furie de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Furie de Chandra inflige 4 blessures au joueur ciblé et 1 blessure à chaque créature que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque je leur ai demandé s\'ils voulaient faire au plus simple, je voulais dire, au plus simple pour moi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d6f9b4-973b-4499-8c7b-40962c312ddb\', \'multiverseId\': 331473}, \'multiverseid\': 331473}, {\'name\': \'Furia di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Furia di Chandra infligge 4 danni a un giocatore bersaglio e 1 danno a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho chiesto se volevano fare le cose nel modo più semplice. Intendevo più semplice per me."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2212dc2-afa0-40ef-94cc-f18c1b0857f6\', \'multiverseId\': 332469}, \'multiverseid\': 332469}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの憤怒\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。チャンドラの憤怒はそのプレイヤーに４点、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私は、彼らが簡単な方法を望んでいるかどうかを聞いているの。ああ、私にとって簡単かどうかよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec53c8d-12b3-49b4-bed5-e76b53e1d5c6\', \'multiverseId\': 332718}, \'multiverseid\': 332718}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 분노\', \'text\': \'플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 분노는 그 플레이어에게 피해 4점을 입히고 그 플레이어가 조종하는 각 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"일을 쉽게 처리하고 싶은가라고 물어봤을 때, 난 내 입장에서 쉽게 처리한다는 말이었어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a8c930-96e7-4346-8c26-fa64b4d3e1fa\', \'multiverseId\': 330477}, \'multiverseid\': 330477}, {\'name\': \'Fúria de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Fúria de Chandra causa 4 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e 1 ponto de dano à cada criatura que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu perguntei se eles queriam resolver tudo de um modo fácil. Fácil para mim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2406218f-fc02-48ef-9d10-14ddbe294cbd\', \'multiverseId\': 331224}, \'multiverseid\': 331224}, {\'name\': \'Ярость Чандры\', \'text\': \'Ярость Чандры наносит 4 повреждения целевому игроку и 1 повреждение каждому существу под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я спросила, не хотят ли они выбрать легкий путь. Я имела в виду легкий для меня».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'381d0a55-f97b-4911-bbf7-795ff718a145\', \'multiverseId\': 331722}, \'multiverseid\': 331722}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的怒火\', \'text\': \'茜卓的怒火对目标牌手造成4点伤害，且对该牌手操控的生物各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我问过他们是否要用轻松方法处理。我是说对我而言的轻松。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b0d0e5-5707-4bf9-a81f-018ac74f5197\', \'multiverseId\': 330228}, \'multiverseid\': 330228}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的怒火\', \'text\': \'茜卓的怒火對目標玩家造成4點傷害，並對該玩家操控的每個生物各造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我問過他們是否要用輕鬆方法處理。我是說對我而言的輕鬆。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e923918d-d929-4eff-bcef-02ea68b7bb81\', \'multiverseId\': 330726}, \'multiverseid\': 330726}]', "[{'name': 'Chronomat', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Chronomat.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': 'In der dritten Nacht zerstörten die Dorfbewohner ihre Uhren. Das Geräusch von summenden Zahnrädern und schwingendem Metall bedeutete für sie nur Angst und Schrecken.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332078&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd20938db-6052-4b61-b0f6-363c46aa391f', 'multiverseId': 332078}, 'multiverseid': 332078}, {'name': 'Cronómata', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cronómata.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': 'En la tercera noche, los aldeanos destruyeron sus relojes. El zumbido de los engranajes y el tintineo del metal sólo les producían pavor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332327&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f66423f-fc70-4283-8304-0a1e25807b5e', 'multiverseId': 332327}, 'multiverseid': 332327}, {'name': 'Chronomate', 'text': '{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Chronomate.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': 'La troisième nuit, les villageois détruisirent leurs horloges. Le son métallique du mécanisme leur était devenu insupportable.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331580&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99774fac-c6ec-49f8-85e0-990a60dd932b', 'multiverseId': 331580}, 'multiverseid': 331580}, {'name': 'Cronautoma', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Cronautoma.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': 'Alla terza notte, gli abitanti del villaggio distrussero i loro orologi. Il ronzio degli ingranaggi e i rintocchi metallici erano solo fonte di terrore per loro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332576&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ce6d7c5-4a0e-4b73-b28d-f0d69efe9e37', 'multiverseId': 332576}, 'multiverseid': 332576}, {'name': '時間人形', 'text': '{1}, {T}：時間人形の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': '三日目の夜、村人達は自分の時計を破壊した。音を立てる歯車やカチカチいう金属は彼らにとって恐怖でしかなかったのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332825&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36d3dd15-a946-4e56-ab02-cdb0aae61015', 'multiverseId': 332825}, 'multiverseid': 332825}, {'name': '시간기계', 'text': '{1}, {T}: 시간기계에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '마법물체 생물 — 골렘', 'flavor': '세 번째 밤에 마을 주민들은 그들이 지닌 모든 시계를 파괴했다. 부서진 시계 부속이 돌아가는 소리와 금속 종소리에 그들은 두려움밖에 느낄 수 없었다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330584&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1210fb00-bde0-4233-a096-f67106ff3d11', 'multiverseId': 330584}, 'multiverseid': 330584}, {'name': 'Cronautômato', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Cronautômato.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': 'Na terceira noite, os aldeões destruíram seus relógios. O som metálico das engrenagens era aterrorizante.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331331&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '645ffd0d-5872-4a49-a436-208eea45c822', 'multiverseId': 331331}, 'multiverseid': 331331}, {'name': 'Хрономат', 'text': '{1}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Хрономата.', 'type': 'Артефактное Существо — Голем', 'flavor': 'На третью ночь жители деревни разломали все свои часы. Звук крутящихся шестерней и металлический бой вселял в них ужас.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331829&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a664186-fd87-4e4e-877f-6beeab9fabfe', 'multiverseId': 331829}, 'multiverseid': 331829}, {'name': '时计机械兽', 'text': '{1}，{T}：在时计机械兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '神器生物～魔像', 'flavor': '第三夜，村民销毁了他们的时钟。那些呜呜作响的齿轮与金属碰撞声只会让他们感到害怕。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330335&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0f4fb6e-db2b-43d4-99f7-250be105de49', 'multiverseId': 330335}, 'multiverseid': 330335}, {'name': '時計機械獸', 'text': '{1}，{T}：在時計機械獸上放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '神器生物～魔像', 'flavor': '第三夜，村民銷毀了他們的時鐘。那些嗚嗚作響的齒輪與金屬碰撞聲只會令他們害怕。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330833&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0b56f4f-aea6-4377-8586-7755fd33f47e', 'multiverseId': 330833}, 'multiverseid': 330833}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dogge mit Kriegsgeschirr\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Biss von diesem Hund bringt dir zehn Tage im Heilerzelt ein." —Wachtmeister Finn aus An Karras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bebb46a-b49c-4a63-9f03-4ed181fe20e1\', \'multiverseId\': 332193}, \'multiverseid\': 332193}, {\'name\': \'Mastín cepo de guerra\', \'text\': \'Daña primero. (Esta criatura hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro\', \'flavor\': \'"Un mordisco de ese perro te envía a la tienda del sanador durante varios días." —Guardia jefe Finn de An Karras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e855085-e173-45a5-950f-2b2618ab2160\', \'multiverseId\': 332442}, \'multiverseid\': 332442}, {\'name\': \'Dogue morsguerre\', \'text\': "Initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': "« Une morsure de ce molosse vous enverra dans la tente des guérisseurs pour plusieurs jours. » —Finn d\'An Karras, officier de quart", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331695&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d3b9c2-1c31-4cec-9506-d48e4c3f9157\', \'multiverseId\': 331695}, \'multiverseid\': 331695}, {\'name\': \'Mastino Tenaglia\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso (Questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Segugio\', \'flavor\': \'"Un solo morso di quel cane ti spedirà nella tenda del guaritore per giorni." —Capo sentinella Finn di An Karras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2da6f873-93be-469d-8292-42ab25a1abf4\', \'multiverseId\': 332691}, \'multiverseid\': 332691}, {\'name\': \'戦噛みの猛犬\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猟犬\', \'flavor\': \'「あの犬に噛まれたが最後、癒し手の天幕で何日も過ごすことになるぞ。」――アン・カラスの警備長フィン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf75c28d-8c91-4672-a05b-6253a2084b57\', \'multiverseId\': 332940}, \'multiverseid\': 332940}, {\'name\': \'강한 턱의 마스티프\', \'text\': \'선제공격 (이 생물은 선제공격 능력이 없는 생물보다 먼저 전투피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사냥개\', \'flavor\': \'"그 개에게 한 번 물리면 며칠 동안 치유사의 거처에서 신세를 지게 될 것이다." —안 카라스의 명파수꾼 핀\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd89d1e-1df2-4148-aabd-316999438413\', \'multiverseId\': 330699}, \'multiverseid\': 330699}, {\'name\': \'Mastim Torno-de-Guerra\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa (Esta criatura causa dano de combate antes das criaturas sem iniciativa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sabujo\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma mordida desse cão pode deixar você na enfermaria por dias." — Mestre Vigilante Finn de An Karras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc828b58-651c-4c1f-86fb-d36fbef5ad81\', \'multiverseId\': 331446}, \'multiverseid\': 331446}, {\'name\': \'Натасканный Мастиф\', \'text\': \'Первый удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без Первого удара.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пес\', \'flavor\': \'«Такой пес одним укусом на неделю отправит тебя в палатку целителя». — Финн из Ан-Карраса, начальник караула\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6ed701-6f85-4f90-ab6a-8a919176245f\', \'multiverseId\': 331944}, \'multiverseid\': 331944}, {\'name\': \'战钳獒犬\', \'text\': \'先攻（此生物会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猎犬\', \'flavor\': \'「只要被那狗咬上一口，你就得在治疗师那儿躺上好几天。」～安喀拉城看守长芬恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902914e2-708a-4438-9d49-c94960c619f5\', \'multiverseId\': 330450}, \'multiverseid\': 330450}, {\'name\': \'戰鉗獒犬\', \'text\': \'先攻（此生物會比不具先攻異能的生物提前造成戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～獵犬\', \'flavor\': \'「只要被那狗咬上一口，你就得在治療師那兒躺上好幾天。」 ～安喀拉城看守長芬恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99853a13-8328-4193-af38-3515eb1f92a8\', \'multiverseId\': 330948}, \'multiverseid\': 330948}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnermaul-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nEile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\\nWenn der Donnermaul-Höllendrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er jeder fliegenden Kreatur, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Tappe diese Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc16ee9-8d07-4c90-921a-a5b1dd94a4ab\', \'multiverseId\': 332032}, \'multiverseid\': 332032}, {\'name\': \'Engendro fauces de trueno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nPrisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)\\nCuando el Engendro fauces de trueno entre al campo de batalla, hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura con la habilidad de volar que controlen tus oponentes. Gira esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2c7b5e-5b54-4821-a540-500953cc349d\', \'multiverseId\': 332281}, \'multiverseid\': 332281}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer foudregueule\', \'text\': "Vol\\nCélérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer foudregueule arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature avec le vol que vos adversaires contrôlent. Engagez ces créatures.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce45bdf8-7a50-4c09-bf2e-1aa3fb51f4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 331534}, \'multiverseid\': 331534}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale dalla Mascella Tonante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nRapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale dalla Mascella Tonante entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura con volare controllata dai tuoi avversari. TAPpa quelle creature.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4493a4-7782-4eff-94c0-18c3e2108472\', \'multiverseId\': 332530}, \'multiverseid\': 332530}, {\'name\': \'雷口のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}能力を使ったりできる。）\\n雷口のヘルカイトが戦場に出たとき、それはあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする飛行を持つ各クリーチャーに、それぞれ１点のダメージを与える。それらのクリーチャーをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851c9bf3-c289-4732-b63f-92dfc200d71e\', \'multiverseId\': 332779}, \'multiverseid\': 332779}, {\'name\': \'천둥아가리 지옥룡\', \'text\': \'비행\\n신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\\n천둥아가리 지옥룡이 전장에 들어올 때, 그것은 상대가 조종하는 생물 중 비행 능력을 가진 각 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 그 생물들을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'699eb09a-0b25-4452-a006-7d4182c37961\', \'multiverseId\': 330538}, \'multiverseid\': 330538}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nÍmpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que entra sob seu controle.)\\nQuando Dragão Avérneo Trovejante entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura com voar controlada por seus oponentes. Vire aquelas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b7a0d07-60fa-428f-891c-ee3b8b5069c9\', \'multiverseId\': 331285}, \'multiverseid\': 331285}, {\'name\': \'Змей-Громовержец\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nУскорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\\nКогда Змей-Громовержец выходит на поле битвы, он наносит 1 повреждение каждому существу без Полета под контролем ваших оппонентов. Поверните те существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a5050d4-ca10-4d80-9b3c-5792d324fa95\', \'multiverseId\': 331783}, \'multiverseid\': 331783}, {\'name\': \'雷喉残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\\n当雷喉残虐者进战场时，它对每个由对手操控、且具有飞行异能的生物各造成1点伤害。横置这些生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c74cd8-0700-4e88-a44f-ac8d035dd004\', \'multiverseId\': 330289}, \'multiverseid\': 330289}, {\'name\': \'雷喉殘虐者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\\n當雷喉殘虐者進戰場時，它對每個由對手操控、且具有飛行異能的生物各造成共1點傷害。橫置這些生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7464237-91fd-4dfd-87ab-a18a5096653f\', \'multiverseId\': 330787}, \'multiverseid\': 330787}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachen-Küken\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{R}: Das Drachen-Küken erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Drachen wachsen wirklich schnell. Erst fütterst du sie mit Eichhörnchen und Goblins, und plötzlich fehlt eines deiner Mammuts." —Hurdek, Mammutabrichter aus Mazar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332058&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c203a525-8266-4514-a0ee-edb3074732a8\', \'multiverseId\': 332058}, \'multiverseid\': 332058}, {\'name\': \'Vástago de dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{R}: El Vástago de dragón obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Estos dragones crecen rápido. Por un tiempo se alimentan de ardillas y trasgos, y de pronto te falta un mamut." —Hurdek, entrenador de mamuts de Mazar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f4dee1-679a-4c0a-bb94-0ca8287cb4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 332307}, \'multiverseid\': 332307}, {\'name\': \'Progéniture dragon\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{R} : La Progéniture dragon gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "« Ces dragons grandissent vite. Ils se nourrissent d\'écureuils et de gobelins et soudain, il vous manque un mammouth. » —Hurdek, entraîneur de mammouths mazarien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce04d698-92bc-4254-8dc8-992496972d62\', \'multiverseId\': 331560}, \'multiverseid\': 331560}, {\'name\': \'Drago Appena Nato\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{R}: Il Drago Appena Nato prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Quei draghi crescono velocemente. Per un po\\\' si nutrono di scoiattoli e goblin e poi all\\\'improvviso ti manca un mammut." —Hurdek, addestratore di mammut di Mazar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba4f63e6-1606-4df4-8042-6a1d0867b322\', \'multiverseId\': 332556}, \'multiverseid\': 332556}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの雛\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：ドラゴンの雛はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「これらのドラゴンはすぐに成長します。最初の餌はリスやゴブリンですが、そのうち、突然マンモスがいなくなると思いますよ」 ――マザールのマンモス調教師、ハーデック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f6b67f-4208-4d3c-a474-e15519980fc3\', \'multiverseId\': 332805}, \'multiverseid\': 332805}, {\'name\': \'부화한 새끼용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n{R}: 부화한 새끼용은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'"용은 아주 빠른 속도로 자라지. 다람쥐랑 고블린 정도만 잡아먹어서 안심하고 있으면 눈 깜짝할 사이 맘모스 하나가 사라져있어." —마자르의 맘모스 조련사 후르덱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cba85b3-4051-4686-a91d-2ef8f474fd85\', \'multiverseId\': 330564}, \'multiverseid\': 330564}, {\'name\': \'Cria de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{R}: Cria de Dragão recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'"Aqueles dragões crescem rápido. Por algum tempo, eles se alimentam de esquilos e goblins e, logo depois, você percebe que um mamute desapareceu." — Hurdek, treinador de mamute de Mazar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b82e87-7ad0-419b-9f4c-4f8b85cab736\', \'multiverseId\': 331311}, \'multiverseid\': 331311}, {\'name\': \'Вылупившийся Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{R}: Вылупившийся Дракон получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'«Драконы растут так быстро. Едят себе белок да гоблинов, и вдруг раз — мамонт пропал!» — Хурдек, мазарский дрессировщик мамонтов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5feb34f-76bc-4c5f-83b6-4c519f9cbb83\', \'multiverseId\': 331809}, \'multiverseid\': 331809}, {\'name\': \'龙幼雏\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{R}：龙幼雏得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': \'「那些龙长得很快。前阵子还在吃松鼠与鬼怪，转眼间你就少了头长毛象。」 ～麻栅长毛象驯师忽岱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f9d62c-49c9-49d4-80d8-820bcfc08ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 330315}, \'multiverseid\': 330315}, {\'name\': \'龍幼雛\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：龍幼雛得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': \'「那些龍長得很快。前陣子還在吃松鼠與鬼怪，轉眼間你就少了頭長毛象。」 ～麻柵長毛象馴師忽岱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a839706-9233-4845-a56f-b8c5793336b7\', \'multiverseId\': 330813}, \'multiverseid\': 330813}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenschädel-Pass', 'text': 'Der Drachenschädel-Pass kommt getappt ins Spiel, falls du nicht einen Sumpf oder ein Gebirge kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331991&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4f5d3fa-705d-405b-a0ea-323328004789', 'multiverseId': 331991}, 'multiverseid': 331991}, {'name': 'Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón', 'text': 'La Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un pantano o una montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332240&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d948704-480a-4fc8-beff-2ade26ca900d', 'multiverseId': 332240}, 'multiverseid': 332240}, {'name': 'Sommet du Crânedragon', 'text': 'Le Sommet du Crânedragon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331493&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e427dd2d-40a7-46ba-a0ae-ed56e6999a90', 'multiverseId': 331493}, 'multiverseid': 331493}, {'name': 'Vetta del Teschio di Drago', 'text': 'La Vetta del Teschio di Drago entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Palude o una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332489&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae714b5f-8842-4995-9028-c9bceb518db6', 'multiverseId': 332489}, 'multiverseid': 332489}, {'name': '竜髑髏の山頂', 'text': '竜髑髏の山頂は、あなたが沼か山をコントロールしていないかぎり、タップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332738&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e161097-a9cb-4fb7-99c7-e80c44cf54ab', 'multiverseId': 332738}, 'multiverseid': 332738}, {'name': '용두개골 봉우리', 'text': '용두개골 봉우리는 당신이 늪이나 산을 조종하지 않으면 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {B}나 {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330497&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1370143-37dd-4567-9cfc-33915312ce11', 'multiverseId': 330497}, 'multiverseid': 330497}, {'name': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão', 'text': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle um Pântano ou uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331244&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ccc01a6-8dec-4d27-ab26-b8820fdfca90', 'multiverseId': 331244}, 'multiverseid': 331244}, {'name': 'Пик Драконьего Черепа', 'text': 'Пик Драконьего Черепа выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет Болота или Горы.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331742&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c80e10d6-5677-43b5-9c5d-fabf0a8222bd', 'multiverseId': 331742}, 'multiverseid': 331742}, {'name': '龙颅山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼泽或山脉，否则龙颅山峰须横置进战场。{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330248&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff743c7d-c0b3-4cca-af2c-e8e5adb43867', 'multiverseId': 330248}, 'multiverseid': 330248}, {'name': '龍顱山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼澤或山脈，否則龍顱山峰須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330746&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '240cecc7-dae3-4f95-81e3-8298c501aa25', 'multiverseId': 330746}, 'multiverseid': 330746}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Gunst\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nWenn die Dunkle Gunst ins Spiel kommt, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Als er begann, das zu verfluchen, was ihm zuvor heilig war, wuchs seine Stärke unermesslich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa914b9-9b50-4661-8e72-acc75c4a5707\', \'multiverseId\': 332092}, \'multiverseid\': 332092}, {\'name\': \'Favor oscuro\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Favor oscuro entre al campo de batalla, pierdes 1 vida.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando comenzó a maldecir lo que consideraba sagrado, su fuerza creció de forma incomparable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7832be-86a4-44b8-ab7b-bba4ab5a57c9\', \'multiverseId\': 332341}, \'multiverseid\': 332341}, {\'name\': \'Obscure faveur\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand l\'Obscure faveur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+1.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Quand il commença à maudire ce qu\'il considérait comme sacré, sa force devint sans pareille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd59470-aa78-4c50-b60c-426bfc0f5ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 331594}, \'multiverseid\': 331594}, {\'name\': \'Benevolenza Oscura\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Benevolenza Oscura entra nel campo di battaglia, perdi 1 punto vita.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quando iniziò a maledire ciò che considerava santo, la sua forza divenne senza pari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a9ee65-2904-42d6-a1b5-1c1bb81cb5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 332590}, \'multiverseid\': 332590}, {\'name\': \'闇の好意\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n闇の好意が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを失う。エンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'神聖だと思っていたものを冒涜し始めたとき、その力は類無きものになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c970df-047f-448b-9a26-b88dd4a4246d\', \'multiverseId\': 332839}, \'multiverseid\': 332839}, {\'name\': \'악의 은혜\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n악의 은혜가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 잃는다.\\n부여된 생물은 +3/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'그가 신성하게 여기던 것을 저주하기 시작한 후로 그의 힘은 끝없이 늘어났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d4beca4-268a-4bd3-808d-a8ecc55d91f7\', \'multiverseId\': 330598}, \'multiverseid\': 330598}, {\'name\': \'Proteção Sombria\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Proteção Sombria entra no campo de batalha, você perde 1 ponto de vida.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ele começou a profanar o que considerava sagrado, sua força cresceu de forma incomparável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd915365-a197-40d1-a1e2-07b96f2c8e30\', \'multiverseId\': 331345}, \'multiverseid\': 331345}, {\'name\': \'Темное Покровительство\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Темное Покровительство выходит на поле битвы, вы теряете 1 жизнь.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+1.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Когда он начал проклинать то, что почитал как святыню, его сила стала неимоверно расти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e2e79e-c9ea-46d7-9a5f-b6092800a752\', \'multiverseId\': 331843}, \'multiverseid\': 331843}, {\'name\': \'黑暗眷顾\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当黑暗眷顾进战场时，你失去1点生命。\\n所结附的生物得+3/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'当他开始诅咒自己曾珍视的东西，其力量就变得无人匹敌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbaac8f-a4dc-4488-9048-c49716c149d0\', \'multiverseId\': 330349}, \'multiverseid\': 330349}, {\'name\': \'黑暗眷顧\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n當黑暗眷顧進戰場時，你失去1點生命。所結附的生物得+3/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'當他開始詛咒自己曾珍視的東西，其力量就變得無人匹敵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07ab77d-6f6e-4a42-a3c5-1eab48bbeb2f\', \'multiverseId\': 330847}, \'multiverseid\': 330847}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerhüllenstrolch\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332115&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cd402ff-1c39-42fc-aa10-e9c86ba3ca19\', \'multiverseId\': 332115}, \'multiverseid\': 332115}, {\'name\': \'Rondador de Mantoscuro\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entre bajo tu control.)\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123a1a40-bb06-4c54-a8c6-01136fe356fc\', \'multiverseId\': 332364}, \'multiverseid\': 332364}, {\'name\': \'Rôdeur de Manteaubrune\', \'text\': "Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e98cad3f-3b9b-4808-999d-65071c3d7cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 331617}, \'multiverseid\': 331617}, {\'name\': \'Predatore di Mantoscuro\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac8f0d1-d027-4fba-b944-302db27ea4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 332613}, \'multiverseid\': 332613}, {\'name\': \'ダスクマントルをうろつくもの\', \'text\': \'速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}能力を使ったりできる。）\\n賛美（あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80070f68-acfc-47c5-be0f-ac53b3214687\', \'multiverseId\': 332862}, \'multiverseid\': 332862}, {\'name\': \'더스크맨틀 도둑\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\\n고귀 (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395fc6da-c1cf-4460-b9c7-65c8a6032c7f\', \'multiverseId\': 330621}, \'multiverseid\': 330621}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador do Manto do Crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que entra sob seu controle.)\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a9fa2a-c14c-45f6-8fa5-cc252d99d47d\', \'multiverseId\': 331368}, \'multiverseid\': 331368}, {\'name\': \'Мародер Мантии Сумрака\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, то существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9db6226e-8ef0-4493-93c5-387c24fd0256\', \'multiverseId\': 331866}, \'multiverseid\': 331866}, {\'name\': \'暮篷游掠者\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\\n颂威（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得 +1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b6d5ffa-e650-417c-be5c-c6482a16aef8\', \'multiverseId\': 330372}, \'multiverseid\': 330372}, {\'name\': \'暮篷遊掠者\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\\n頌威（每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，該生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692e2b11-6a91-465d-9885-73cd55fbc2a0\', \'multiverseId\': 330870}, \'multiverseid\': 330870}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dösender Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Dösende Drache kann weder angreifen noch blocken, falls nicht fünf oder mehr +1/+1-Marken auf ihm liegen.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Dösenden Drachen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4a093aa-a3f0-4fb5-bb23-c5ead13fa4e1\', \'multiverseId\': 332027}, \'multiverseid\': 332027}, {\'name\': \'Dragón adormecido\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Dragón adormecido no puede atacar ni bloquear a menos que tenga cinco o más contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nSiempre que una criatura te ataque a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Dragón adormecido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68bda08d-5e33-49d9-b9da-b8c350126816\', \'multiverseId\': 332276}, \'multiverseid\': 332276}, {\'name\': \'Dragon endormi\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLe Dragon endormi ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer à moins qu\'il n\'ait au moins cinq marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Dragon endormi.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4620cc-bc15-444e-a598-68d17799d5cb\', \'multiverseId\': 331529}, \'multiverseid\': 331529}, {\'name\': \'Drago Assopito\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nIl Drago Assopito non può attaccare o bloccare a meno che non abbia cinque o più segnalini +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Drago Assopito.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04948b6f-73de-4418-8c24-b57cc4bfb708\', \'multiverseId\': 332525}, \'multiverseid\': 332525}, {\'name\': \'まどろむドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nまどろむドラゴンは、それの上に５個以上の+１/＋１カウンターが置かれていないかぎり攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。\\nいずれかのクリーチャーがあなたかあなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、まどろむドラゴンの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e78f85-470a-41b7-b798-6d3461c46630\', \'multiverseId\': 332774}, \'multiverseid\': 332774}, {\'name\': \'잠자는 용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n잠자는 용은 +1/+1 카운터를 다섯 개 이상 가지고 있어야만 공격하거나 방어할 수 있다.\\n생물이 당신 또는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격할 때마다, 잠자는 용에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1bceb6-9bef-4175-a49a-650685244f91\', \'multiverseId\': 330533}, \'multiverseid\': 330533}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Adormecido\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDragão Adormecido não pode atacar ou bloquear a menos que tenha cinco ou mais marcadores +1/+1 sobre ele.\\nToda vez que uma criatura atacar você ou um planeswalker que você controla, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Dragão Adormecido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c1e015d-71ea-4386-b1c9-e7498fc5ba5f\', \'multiverseId\': 331280}, \'multiverseid\': 331280}, {\'name\': \'Дремлющий Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nДремлющий Дракон не может атаковать или блокировать, если только на нем нет пяти или больше жетонов +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо атакует вас или planeswalker-а под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Дремлющего Дракона.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1760ec5-ebbd-4f5c-83b0-27495b7c3802\', \'multiverseId\': 331778}, \'multiverseid\': 331778}, {\'name\': \'静眠巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n除非静眠巨龙上有五个或更多+1/+1指示物，否则它不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n每当一个生物攻击你或由你操控的某个鹏洛客时，在静眠巨龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68dd708-4c9f-45d1-a7c5-22075ca95866\', \'multiverseId\': 330284}, \'multiverseid\': 330284}, {\'name\': \'靜眠巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n除非靜眠巨龍上有五個或更多+1/+1指示物，否則它不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\\n每當一個生物攻擊你或由你操控的某個鵬洛客時，在靜眠巨龍上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f141ac9-fe01-4ca1-8f9e-6c6ed7015775\', \'multiverseId\': 330782}, \'multiverseid\': 330782}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düstertal-Wurm\', \'text\': \'Trampelschaden (Falls diese Kreatur ihren Blockern genug Schaden zuweisen würde, um sie zu zerstören, kannst du sie den Rest des Schadens dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zuweisen lassen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332151&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4489b538-1ad1-41b3-b9f8-edcf71513a0f\', \'multiverseId\': 332151}, \'multiverseid\': 332151}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe del valle crepuscular\', \'text\': \'Arrolla. (Si esta criatura fuera a asignar suficiente daño a sus bloqueadores como para destruirlos, puedes hacer que le asigne el resto del daño al jugador o planeswalker defensor.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b00f8d4-81d2-42dc-9788-f5b6fc2a283a\', \'multiverseId\': 332400}, \'multiverseid\': 332400}, {\'name\': \'Guivre de Valsoir\', \'text\': "Piétinement (Si cette créature attribue suffisamment de blessures de combat à ses bloqueurs pour les détruire, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle attribue le reste de ses blessures au joueur ou au planeswalker défenseur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331653&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e3c109-d5b1-4f32-8d9a-7f6801c3f1b4\', \'multiverseId\': 331653}, \'multiverseid\': 331653}, {\'name\': \'Wurm di Valle Oscura\', \'text\': \'Travolgere (Se questa creatura sta per assegnare alle sue creature bloccanti danno sufficiente a distruggerle, puoi farle assegnare il resto del suo danno al giocatore in difesa o a un planeswalker.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195defcb-5703-4fa7-ac0d-d6e3f8de7cab\', \'multiverseId\': 332649}, \'multiverseid\': 332649}, {\'name\': \'夕暮れ谷のワーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル（このクリーチャーが、自身をブロックしているすべてのクリーチャーを破壊するのに十分なダメージを割り振る場合、あなたはこれの残りのダメージを防御プレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに割り振ってもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a06b87ee-d544-4eba-9732-48d76d714fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 332898}, \'multiverseid\': 332898}, {\'name\': \'더스크데일 웜\', \'text\': \'돌진 (이 생물이 자신을 방어하는 생물을 파괴하기 충분한 피해를 배정했다면, 나머지 피해는 수비플레이어나 플레인즈워커에게 배정할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce3a40d2-72e7-4217-87b6-1c92eaa69177\', \'multiverseId\': 330657}, \'multiverseid\': 330657}, {\'name\': \'Vorme do Vale do Crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Atropelar (Se esta criatura fosse atribuir dano suficiente para destruir seus bloqueadores, você pode fazer com que ela atribua o resto de seu dano ao planeswalker ou jogador defensor.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf952e38-b81e-457f-bcbf-acbd3a4baf9f\', \'multiverseId\': 331404}, \'multiverseid\': 331404}, {\'name\': \'Чащобный Вурм\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар (Если это существо распределяет достаточно повреждений, чтобы уничтожить блокирующие его существа, вы можете заставить его распределить оставшиеся повреждения защищающемуся игроку или planeswalker-у.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53d84e4-6d3d-4ce1-97dc-742a1028edb1\', \'multiverseId\': 331902}, \'multiverseid\': 331902}, {\'name\': \'暮谷亚龙\', \'text\': \'践踏（如果此生物将分配的伤害足以消灭所有阻挡它的生物，你可以将它所剩余数量的伤害分配给防御牌手或鹏洛客。）\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bfad23-14f9-482e-a804-353f15fc5583\', \'multiverseId\': 330408}, \'multiverseid\': 330408}, {\'name\': \'暮谷亞龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏（如果此生物將分配的傷害足以消滅所有阻擋它的生物，你可以將它所剩餘數量的傷害分配給防禦玩家或鵬洛客。）\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\