x?multiverseid=332244&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15ae82df-34f9-4413-a1ba-64fcc5b854ef', 'multiverseId': 332244}, 'multiverseid': 332244}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331497&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '281e1763-9113-465b-9754-835d78144f3d', 'multiverseId': 331497}, 'multiverseid': 331497}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332493&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '131d8210-3ac9-4a29-8d69-6bbaf57e4248', 'multiverseId': 332493}, 'multiverseid': 332493}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332742&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd89be8ff-222e-48f5-a0c8-408a97db2d2f', 'multiverseId': 332742}, 'multiverseid': 332742}, {'name': '숲', 'type': '기본 대지 — 숲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330501&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0626639e-76c7-46e5-b70a-ac4ba6b01df2', 'multiverseId': 330501}, 'multiverseid': 330501}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331248&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '790e2990-4d5c-4d1c-a552-441ff97c285f', 'multiverseId': 331248}, 'multiverseid': 331248}, {'name': 'Лес', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Лес', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331746&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76fb8da1-982b-46f0-a776-b431b9e02e79', 'multiverseId': 331746}, 'multiverseid': 331746}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地～树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330252&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '496fe04c-28f9-4d8f-884e-7f64a5b31fd7', 'multiverseId': 330252}, 'multiverseid': 330252}, {'name': '樹林', 'type': '基本地～樹林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330750&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f85c7a9c-4105-4eac-b1b4-53fadf1e3a59', 'multiverseId': 330750}, 'multiverseid': 330750}]", "[{'name': 'Wald', 'type': 'Standardland — Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331996&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14ae4621-ab96-4b34-ab4d-df94ab6e2880', 'multiverseId': 331996}, 'multiverseid': 331996}, {'name': 'Bosque', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332245&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9202c896-2287-4169-9107-64e5aff7af99', 'multiverseId': 332245}, 'multiverseid': 332245}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331498&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dd8f520-e7be-4ebb-845e-ec29d9aa660b', 'multiverseId': 331498}, 'multiverseid': 331498}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332494&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e35fc7d-617a-4bfd-a0b9-3f5ce75382e1', 'multiverseId': 332494}, 'multiverseid': 332494}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332743&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '486985d0-c0ad-4613-8e06-e737baf0ab1a', 'multiverseId': 332743}, 'multiverseid': 332743}, {'name': '숲', 'type': '기본 대지 — 숲', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330502&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ceb1759-b5bc-4ef1-bdfa-d1afdd505a7d', 'multiverseId': 330502}, 'multiverseid': 330502}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331249&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e30a1fff-28e6-4920-aa2d-9d4bc048fa2f', 'multiverseId': 331249}, 'multiverseid': 331249}, {'name': 'Лес', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Лес', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331747&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9681984-06bf-4e05-8d27-4a905108fe52', 'multiverseId': 331747}, 'multiverseid': 331747}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地～树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330253&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '276309d3-754b-439a-aa88-bfe030e15caa', 'multiverseId': 330253}, 'multiverseid': 330253}, {'name': '樹林', 'type': '基本地～樹林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330751&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99594dc2-895c-46df-b617-59a50e96fa67', 'multiverseId': 330751}, 'multiverseid': 330751}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wandelnde Leiche\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine herkömmliche Armee verköstigen zu müssen ist eine Frage der Logistik. Bei Zombies ist das eher ein Vorteil. Ihr Hunger ist der Grund, warum sie kämpfen. Ihr Hunger ist der Grund, warum man sie fürchtet." —Jadar, Ghulrufer aus Nefalen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85633c5d-5939-4184-880e-f65aba3f0c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 332098}, \'multiverseid\': 332098}, {\'name\': \'Cadáver ambulante\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"La alimentación de un ejército normal supone un problema de logística. Con los zombies, es una ventaja. Su alimentación es aquello por lo que luchan. Su alimentación es aquello por lo que se les teme." —Jadar, llamamuertos de Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eda01a5f-110a-41e7-9d91-32f8b97c43ec\', \'multiverseId\': 332347}, \'multiverseid\': 332347}, {\'name\': \'Cadavre ambulant\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Nourrir une armée normale revient à résoudre un problème de logistique. Avec des zombies, pas de problème, bien au contraire. Ils combattent pour se nourrir. C\'est même pour ça qu\'on les redoute. » —Jadar, meneur de goule de Néphalie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331600&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b966670e-4f22-4aaf-8855-1f8c1cc81de1\', \'multiverseId\': 331600}, \'multiverseid\': 331600}, {\'name\': \'Cadavere Ambulante\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Sfamare un esercito normale è un problema di logistica. Con gli zombie, è un vantaggio. La fame è il motivo per cui combattono. La fame è il motivo per cui sono temuti." —Jadar, evocaghoul di Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba550b4e-5b37-41e6-9a71-69a173a28db0\', \'multiverseId\': 332596}, \'multiverseid\': 332596}, {\'name\': \'歩く死骸\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「普通の軍隊の場合、食糧確保には輸送が必要だ。ゾンビの場合、それが強みになる。奴らは食うために戦い、食うから恐れられる。」 ――ネファリアのグール呼び、ジャダー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad7c92fe-8f3f-49e5-9590-2c841558b423\', \'multiverseId\': 332845}, \'multiverseid\': 332845}, {\'name\': \'걸어다니는 시체\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"식량은 일반 부대의 병참술에서는 골치 아픈 문제이지만 좀비를 다룰 때는 중요한 자산이 된다. 식량이야말로 좀비들이 싸우는 이유이며, 적들이 그들을 두려워하는 원인이기 때문이다." —네팔리아의 악귀소환술사 자다르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5d3f9f-6bab-4b44-9408-f8b7c485b74c\', \'multiverseId\': 330604}, \'multiverseid\': 330604}, {\'name\': \'Cadáver Ambulante\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"A alimentação de um exército normal é um problema de logística. A alimentação de zumbis é uma vantagem. Eles lutam para comer. E são temidos por isso." — Jadar, invocador de carniçais de Nefália\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f91509e7-4c3a-4ade-bc7c-20def631591d\', \'multiverseId\': 331351}, \'multiverseid\': 331351}, {\'name\': \'Ходячий Труп\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Для обычной армии пища — это проблема снабжения. Для армии зомби — тактическое преимущество. Их пища — это то, почему они сражаются. Их пища — это то, почему их боятся». — Джадар, призыватель упырей из Нефалии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c303b41e-9f22-4c66-8b36-25892fd0088a\', \'multiverseId\': 331849}, \'multiverseid\': 331849}, {\'name\': \'行尸\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「正常的军队要考虑食粮补给的问题。而这正是灵俑部队的优点。他们因进食而战。也因进食而被人惧怕。」～涅非利亚尸鬼牧者贾达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e01887-6ac1-4344-9b11-af30be32b8b5\', \'multiverseId\': 330355}, \'multiverseid\': 330355}, {\'name\': \'行屍\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「正常的軍隊要考慮食糧補給的問題。而這正是殭屍部隊的優點。他們因進食而戰。也因進食而被人懼怕。」 ～涅非利亞屍鬼牧者賈達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7df6e23-1ae4-4e9f-8148-8a790a6dffac\', \'multiverseId\': 330853}, \'multiverseid\': 330853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wasserfließer\', \'text\': \'{U}: Der Wasserfließer erhält +1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Hüte dich vor Strudeln, wo keine sein sollten, oder Stellen, an denen das Wasser zu schnell oder zu langsam fließt." —Alte Gräte, Flussführer aus Martyne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec0fb89f-51bf-4a89-9669-dd7d284858b9\', \'multiverseId\': 332050}, \'multiverseid\': 332050}, {\'name\': \'Corcel acuático\', \'text\': \'{U}: El Corcel acuático obtiene +1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"No te fíes de un remolino que no debiera estar ahí ni de un tramo que fluya demasiado deprisa o demasiado lento." —Viejo Huesos de Pescado, guía de río de Martyne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc11861-9d3a-42cf-85b7-28f7959a2281\', \'multiverseId\': 332299}, \'multiverseid\': 332299}, {\'name\': \'Coursier des eaux\', \'text\': "{U} : Le Coursier des eaux gagne +1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Gare aux tourbillons qui ne sont pas à leur place ou aux cours d\'eau au débit anormal. » —Vieilles Arêtes, guide fluvial de Marteyne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e1d5919-1d05-47f2-9053-a841e93f3fec\', \'multiverseId\': 331552}, \'multiverseid\': 331552}, {\'name\': \'Solca-acqua\', \'text\': \'{U}: Il Solca-acqua prende +1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Guardati da un gorgo che non dovrebbe trovarsi lì o da una corrente che scorre troppo veloce o troppo lenta." —Vecchia Lisca, guida fluviale di Martyne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aefa619f-de8e-4847-803c-0f5e349c038d\', \'multiverseId\': 332548}, \'multiverseid\': 332548}, {\'name\': \'狩漁者\', \'text\': \'{U}：狩漁者はターン終了時まで＋１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「ないはずの所に出ている渦、それから速すぎる流れや遅すぎる流れに気を付けるんじゃぞ。」 ――マーティンの川案内人、魚骨老\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb9387a-b6f3-4c23-93a6-907d1f240af6\', \'multiverseId\': 332797}, \'multiverseid\': 332797}, {\'name\': \'급류의 정령\', \'text\': \'{U}: 급류의 정령은 턴종료까지 +1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"없어야 할 곳에 있는 소용돌이나 물이 흐르는 속도가 현저히 다른 곳을 조심하시오." —마르틴 강의 안내원 늙은이 피시본\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7e9a61-76f5-47ea-b871-7496b8012290\', \'multiverseId\': 330556}, \'multiverseid\': 330556}, {\'name\': "Cursor D\'água", \'text\': "{U}: Cursor D\'água recebe +1/-1 até o final do turno.", \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuidado com os redemoinhos que não deveriam existir ou com uma marola que se propague rápido demais ou devagar demais." — Velho Espinha de Peixe, guia do rio Martyne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60a30d6-8887-486c-b316-d88f00210b88\', \'multiverseId\': 331303}, \'multiverseid\': 331303}, {\'name\': \'Водобег\', \'text\': \'{U}: Водобег получает +1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«Берегись водоворотов там, где их не должно быть, и слишком быстрого или медленного течения». — Старик Рыбохвост, речной проводник из Мартайна\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c46802-87b4-42a1-87b7-6bd99110602a\', \'multiverseId\': 331801}, \'multiverseid\': 331801}, {\'name\': \'河道巡灵\', \'text\': \'{U}：河道巡灵得+1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「当心意外出现的漩涡，或水流过快或过慢的航程。」～马提涅河领路人老鱼骨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82da35a0-ab10-4648-95bb-f3d5c26ce90e\', \'multiverseId\': 330307}, \'multiverseid\': 330307}, {\'name\': \'河道巡靈\', \'text\': \'{U}：河道巡靈得+1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「當心意外出現的漩渦，或水流過快或過慢的航程。」 ～馬提涅河領路人老魚骨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'578dbf43-0de2-4130-bcec-474c4cb17245\', \'multiverseId\': 330805}, \'multiverseid\': 330805}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wasserwoge\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Bist du durstig?" —Drunvalus, Hydromagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb7eb7a-74f0-40ac-b003-5a0b103e740a\', \'multiverseId\': 332127}, \'multiverseid\': 332127}, {\'name\': \'Hidroleada\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Tienes sed?" —Drunvalus, hidromante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6044f9b-996e-4a7a-9fbc-2b0bbba712c9\', \'multiverseId\': 332376}, \'multiverseid\': 332376}, {\'name\': \'Hydrodéferlante\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -5/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Une petite soif ? » —Drunvalus, hydromancien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b709f601-f698-453d-aa97-425b78f71952\', \'multiverseId\': 331629}, \'multiverseid\': 331629}, {\'name\': \'Idroflusso\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Assetato?" —Drunvalus, idromante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff2cfb8c-aa99-4e40-8c81-51b9bf7839db\', \'multiverseId\': 332625}, \'multiverseid\': 332625}, {\'name\': \'打ち寄せる水\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで-5/-0の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「のど乾いた？」――水術師ドランヴァルス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d337a4-ec2f-4d58-bef7-ee1d589323cc\', \'multiverseId\': 332874}, \'multiverseid\': 332874}, {\'name\': \'물의 격류\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -5/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"목이 마른가?" —수력술사 드룬발루스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cba50c5-2771-4a55-9f8b-e094da20990d\', \'multiverseId\': 330633}, \'multiverseid\': 330633}, {\'name\': \'Hidrosurto\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -5/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Está com sede?" — Drunvalus, hidromante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe7ae4c-8c6a-4f75-bc02-46a5237e6aad\', \'multiverseId\': 331380}, \'multiverseid\': 331380}, {\'name\': \'Гидровсплеск\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -5/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пить хочешь?» — Друнвалус, гидромант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b8c7065-7a84-4475-94c6-3b1991aaede3\', \'multiverseId\': 331878}, \'multiverseid\': 331878}, {\'name\': \'水势翻腾\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-5/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「会渴吗？」～水流术士祝凡洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9686a47d-daaf-4b42-88eb-35923f48bb7b\', \'multiverseId\': 330384}, \'multiverseid\': 330384}, {\'name\': \'水勢翻騰\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-5/-0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「會渴嗎？」 ～水流術士祝凡洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c39bd6-084c-445c-a4fb-5a9727c922c0\', \'multiverseId\': 330882}, \'multiverseid\': 330882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weihung der Engel\', \'text\': \'Edelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl tappen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur die Tapfersten sind unseres Segens wert."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332170&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6067b437-2b3d-47e2-9f9d-2ba1653f51c8\', \'multiverseId\': 332170}, \'multiverseid\': 332170}, {\'name\': \'Reconocimiento angelical\', \'text\': \'Exaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que controles ataque sola, puedes girar la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Sólo los más valientes son dignos de recibir nuestra bendición."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6dcc5e-f3a3-4f28-a7f7-a7705c414949\', \'multiverseId\': 332419}, \'multiverseid\': 332419}, {\'name\': \'Oraison angélique\', \'text\': "Exaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, vous pouvez engager la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Seuls les plus braves méritent notre bénédiction. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c86e3d-8075-4347-b4c0-dcb0fd78d959\', \'multiverseId\': 331672}, \'multiverseid\': 331672}, {\'name\': \'Protezione Angelica\', \'text\': \'Esaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, puoi TAPpare una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo i più coraggiosi sono degni della nostra benedizione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbb1c5d-9236-4efb-b4aa-3d5caacdef91\', \'multiverseId\': 332668}, \'multiverseid\': 332668}, {\'name\': \'天使の祝祷\', \'text\': \'賛美（あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「もっとも勇敢な者だけが私達の祝福を受けられるのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b27bb8-526e-4319-8f5d-021480698c70\', \'multiverseId\': 332917}, \'multiverseid\': 332917}, {\'name\': \'천사의 축복기도\', \'text\': \'고귀 (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 탭할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"가장 용감한 자만이 우리의 축복을 받을 자격이 있다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b27b038c-8db8-4ce7-869d-ad9aa47fbc4e\', \'multiverseId\': 330676}, \'multiverseid\': 330676}, {\'name\': \'Bendição Angelical\', \'text\': \'Exaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, você pode virar a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Somente os mais bravos são dignos de nossas bênçãos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73fc4a3-6f51-4f90-b9b9-95ea3603f3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 331423}, \'multiverseid\': 331423}, {\'name\': \'Ангельское Освящение\', \'text\': \'Повышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, то существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, вы можете повернуть целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Лишь храбрейшие достойны нашего благословения».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57fdb71d-999e-499c-9541-b5b40190cd76\', \'multiverseId\': 331921}, \'multiverseid\': 331921}, {\'name\': \'天使祈福\', \'text\': \'颂威（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，你可以横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「只有最勇敢的人才值得我们祝福。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f30812-0658-406b-aabb-b3ae3ed1ef77\', \'multiverseId\': 330427}, \'multiverseid\': 330427}, {\'name\': \'天使祈福\', \'text\': \'頌威（每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，該生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\\n每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，你可以橫置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「只有最勇敢的人才值得我們祝福。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65feb6d0-cb9b-4c82-ba5e-361d842f5885\', \'multiverseId\': 330925}, \'multiverseid\': 330925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weissagung\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schlüssel zu diesem Rätsel steckt in dir." —Doriel, Mentor der Mistralinsel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332054&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54cf84c-dbc3-4b7f-844d-2d621f0d8728\', \'multiverseId\': 332054}, \'multiverseid\': 332054}, {\'name\': \'Adivinación\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La llave para desentrañar este misterio está dentro de ti." —Doriel, mentor de la Isla Mistral\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f960a3c-e32d-411f-b016-95cf099bd594\', \'multiverseId\': 332303}, \'multiverseid\': 332303}, {\'name\': \'Divination\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« La clé qui te permettra de résoudre ce mystère est en toi. » —Doriel, mentor de l\'Île de Mistral", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331556&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22090a9-793b-4d85-b055-3895803a69a5\', \'multiverseId\': 331556}, \'multiverseid\': 331556}, {\'name\': \'Divinazione\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La chiave per risolvere questo enigma è dentro di te." —Doriel, mentore dell\\\'Isola del Mistral\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bafec807-2b20-4f2e-bb94-ad60a16bb0bd\', \'multiverseId\': 332552}, \'multiverseid\': 332552}, {\'name\': \'予言\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この謎を解く鍵はお前の中にある。」――北風島の導師、ドリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72145b1-e04e-45c0-878d-d81d92086924\', \'multiverseId\': 332801}, \'multiverseid\': 332801}, {\'name\': \'점\', \'text\': \'카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이 수수께끼를 풀 열쇠는 자네 안에 있다네." —미스트랄 섬의 스승 도리엘\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe898d2-ecd7-408e-8747-022d5f2c4020\', \'multiverseId\': 330560}, \'multiverseid\': 330560}, {\'name\': \'Divinação\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"A chave para resolver este quebra-cabeças está dentro de você." — Doriel, mentor da Ilha Mistral\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78fbb08d-6e23-4eb0-834d-f533e776490a\', \'multiverseId\': 331307}, \'multiverseid\': 331307}, {\'name\': \'Прорицание\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ключ к этой загадке — в тебе». — Дориел, наставник с острова Мистраль\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2758435-aa74-4ca5-b153-29d92a8f1b45\', \'multiverseId\': 331805}, \'multiverseid\': 331805}, {\'name\': \'卜卦\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「解开谜题的关键就在你心中。」 ～西北风屿导师多瑞尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbb1635e-535c-444c-a9e7-c91519670491\', \'multiverseId\': 330311}, \'multiverseid\': 330311}, {\'name\': \'卜卦\', \'text\': \'抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「解開謎題的關鍵就在你心中。」 ～西北風嶼導師多瑞爾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ed6619-20e4-4978-aba0-9cdf38a154d4\', \'multiverseId\': 330809}, \'multiverseid\': 330809}]', '[{\'name\': \'Welpe der Schmelze\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{R}: Der Welpe der Schmelze erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Babydrachen werden aus Menschen nicht schlau — wenn sie nicht getötet werden wollen, warum bestehen sie dann aus Fleisch und bergen Schätze?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332204&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d11f3527-0977-4558-bbe9-d79d77eca534\', \'multiverseId\': 332204}, \'multiverseid\': 332204}, {\'name\': \'Cría del horno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{R}: La Cría del horno obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Las crías de dragón no entienden a los humanos. Si no quieren que los maten, ¿por qué los hicieron de carne y tesoro?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3fedc3-0d26-4f32-958d-3e32aa3a3eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 332453}, \'multiverseid\': 332453}, {\'name\': \'Dragonnet du fourneau\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{R} : Le Dragonnet du fourneau gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Les jeunes dragons ne comprennent pas les humains — s\'ils ne veulent pas être tués, pourquoi ne sont-ils faits que de viande et de trésors ?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f788a1a-d6d9-404f-9648-b2750128d7ca\', \'multiverseId\': 331706}, \'multiverseid\': 331706}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo della Fornace\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{R}: Il Cucciolo della Fornace prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'I cuccioli di drago non riescono a comprendere gli umani: se non vogliono essere uccisi, perché sono fatti di cibo e tesori?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9165eb82-fe0c-46c8-81ff-1cb5892ceb6e\', \'multiverseId\': 332702}, \'multiverseid\': 332702}, {\'name\': \'焼炉の仔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：焼炉の仔はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンの子供には、人間とは何なのか理解できない――殺されるのがいやなら、なんで彼らは肉と宝物でできてるんだろう？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8cadc72-9ff5-4876-a87c-833b823b4bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 332951}, \'multiverseid\': 332951}, {\'name\': \'용광로 새끼용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n{R}: 용광로 새끼용은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'새끼용들은 인간을 이해할 수가 없다. 고기로 된 몸에 온갖 보물을 지니고 있으면서 어찌 죽임을 당하지 않기를 바라는 것일까?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bceba84-de00-497b-9595-2e1df9e9390c\', \'multiverseId\': 330710}, \'multiverseid\': 330710}, {\'name\': \'Filhote da Fornalha\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{R}: Filhote da Fornalha recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Os filhotes de dragão não conseguem compreender os humanos: se eles não queriam ser comidos, por que foram feitos de carne e preciosidades?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf40edc-d998-4a96-9825-fd25cd1ce74f\', \'multiverseId\': 331457}, \'multiverseid\': 331457}, {\'name\': \'Детеныш Горнила\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{R}: Детеныш Горнила получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Крошки-драконы никак не могут понять: если люди не хотят, чтобы их убивали, почему они сделаны из мяса и драгоценностей?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'381f3c41-a183-41bb-877b-656e860bc7b6\', \'multiverseId\': 331955}, \'multiverseid\': 331955}, {\'name\': \'熔炉幼龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{R}：熔炉幼龙得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': \'幼龙无法了解人类这种生物～既然不想被杀，那他们又为什么是用肉跟宝藏做的？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18a142e9-e4bb-4463-8721-af4290218de9\', \'multiverseId\': 330461}, \'multiverseid\': 330461}, {\'name\': \'熔爐幼龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：熔爐幼龍得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': \'幼龍無法了解人類這種生物～既然不想被殺，那他們又為什麼是用肉跟寶藏做的？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a242fb-68d0-471c-8d8c-c1e700c2186a\', \'multiverseId\': 330959}, \'multiverseid\': 330959}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weltbrand\', \'text\': \'Schicke alle bleibenden Karten ins Exil. Schicke alle Karten von allen Händen und aus allen Friedhöfen ins Exil. Der Lebenspunktestand jedes Spielers wird zu 1.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst der kleinste Funke kann eine Welt in Brand setzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4644ff-ba50-46e1-9044-cbcb5656a32d\', \'multiverseId\': 332162}, \'multiverseid\': 332162}, {\'name\': \'Llamas globales\', \'text\': \'Exilia todos los permanentes. Exilia todas las cartas de todas las manos y cementerios. El total de vidas de cada jugador es 1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Hasta la chispa más pequeña puede encender el mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0194705-fd46-425d-824b-0c398e7f6d51\', \'multiverseId\': 332411}, \'multiverseid\': 332411}, {\'name\': \'Mondefeu\', \'text\': \'Exilez tous les permanents. Exilez toutes les cartes de toutes les mains et de tous les cimetières. Le total de points de vie de chaque joueur devient 1.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Il suffit parfois d\'une petite étincelle pour incendier tout un monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331664&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'084733d6-bbc8-40f7-9414-965f5dcb11b0\', \'multiverseId\': 331664}, \'multiverseid\': 331664}, {\'name\': \'Mondo in Fiamme\', \'text\': \'Esilia tutti i permanenti. Esilia tutte le carte da tutte le mani e da tutti i cimiteri. I punti vita di ogni giocatore diventano 1.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Anche la più piccola scintilla può incendiare un mondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c44520-aaab-495a-b7c3-364c89168b50\', \'multiverseId\': 332660}, \'multiverseid\': 332660}, {\'name\': \'世界火\', \'text\': \'すべてのパーマネントを追放する。すべての手札とすべての墓地にあるすべてのカードを追放する。各プレイヤーのライフの総量は１点になる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最小の灯でさえ、世界を輝かせうる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dffd31f5-4edc-4d62-9870-3e38025e09fd\', \'multiverseId\': 332909}, \'multiverseid\': 332909}, {\'name\': \'세상을 멸하는 화염\', \'text\': \'모든 지속물을 추방하고 각 플레이어의 손과 무덤에 있는 모든 카드들을 추방한다. 각 플레이어의 생명 총점은 1이 된다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'사소한 불씨도 세상을 불태울 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d79d1f4-1ed6-4397-a970-ed93a8186ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 330668}, \'multiverseid\': 330668}, {\'name\': \'Incêndio Mundial\', \'text\': \'Exile todas as permanentes. Exile todos os cards de todas as mãos e cemitérios. O total de pontos de vida de cada jogador se torna 1.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Até mesmo a menor centelha pode atear fogo no mundo todo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73fddd78-b283-4586-8c48-5c3d8c443f87\', \'multiverseId\': 331415}, \'multiverseid\': 331415}, {\'name\': \'Мировой Пожар\', \'text\': \'Изгоните все перманенты. Изгоните все карты из всех рук и кладбищ. Количество жизней каждого игрока становится равным 1.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Даже крохотная искра может запалить целый мир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb1b0a7-ab20-4905-9569-140b0361e503\', \'multiverseId\': 331913}, \'multiverseid\': 331913}, {\'name\': \'灼世劫\', \'text\': \'放逐所有永久物。从所有手牌和坟墓场放逐所有牌。每位牌手的总生命成为1。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'微不足道的火花也可能让整个世界起火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d16575d-ae48-45a6-b0e5-ccec36aff32a\', \'multiverseId\': 330419}, \'multiverseid\': 330419}, {\'name\': \'灼世劫\', \'text\': \'放逐所有永久物。從所有手牌與墳墓場放逐所有牌。每位玩家的總生命成為1。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'微不足道的火花也可能讓整個世界起火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bf2eb7d-2a4b-4777-a33b-418cadddb9e4\', \'multiverseId\': 330917}, \'multiverseid\': 330917}]', "[{'name': 'Weltenreinigung', 'text': 'Zerstöre alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332134&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19fa22a6-f3bd-4d6f-98e4-f7fd40320061', 'multiverseId': 332134}, 'multiverseid': 332134}, {'name': 'Purificación planar', 'text': 'Destruye todos los permanentes que no sean tierra.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332383&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c0e8b6a-0e49-4a4c-b3c9-c12899e60753', 'multiverseId': 332383}, 'multiverseid': 332383}, {'name': 'Dépuration planaire', 'text': 'Détruisez tous les permanents non-terrain.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331636&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f678f87-bf3a-4ce8-b667-894fe19b1979', 'multiverseId': 331636}, 'multiverseid': 331636}, {'name': 'Pulizia Planare', 'text': 'Distruggi tutti i permanenti non terra.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332632&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a156e1b-3755-4d62-9430-b4abfb25ffcb', 'multiverseId': 332632}, 'multiverseid': 332632}, {'name': '次元の浄化', 'text': 'すべての土地でないパーマネントを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332881&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '947f117f-5d01-4ba5-bdb6-f32ccd8e4177', 'multiverseId': 332881}, 'multiverseid': 332881}, {'name': '차원의 정화', 'text': '대지가 아닌 지속물을 모두 파괴한다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330640&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2727071f-9dc4-4136-a0fb-a66c0840adb2', 'multiverseId': 330640}, 'multiverseid': 330640}, {'name': 'Limpeza Planar', 'text': 'Destrua todas as permanentes que não sejam terrenos.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331387&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcb31a87-a834-46ab-b1cd-0b9dc05ebffe', 'multiverseId': 331387}, 'multiverseid': 331387}, {'name': 'Вселенское Очищение', 'text': 'Уничтожьте все перманенты, не являющиеся землями.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331885&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0b95503-acbb-4d27-b7dd-27fa2f0844e7', 'multiverseId': 331885}, 'multiverseid': 331885}, {'name': '净化时空', 'text': '消灭所有非地永久物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330391&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12373641-a679-4647-bc63-40d2bc1465c7', 'multiverseId': 330391}, 'multiverseid': 330391}, {'name': '淨化時空', 'text': '消滅所有非地永久物。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330889&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f43e509-0522-4816-9fe3-b158ee4b957d', 'multiverseId': 330889}, 'multiverseid': 330889}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wiederbelebung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine grüne Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst was unwiderruflich verloren ist kehrt zurück, wenn eine Dryade lockt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332146&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06904bbe-7eaa-4250-83fb-c5fd1fb12ced\', \'multiverseId\': 332146}, \'multiverseid\': 332146}, {\'name\': \'Revivir\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta objetivo verde de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso lo que nadie recuerda que se perdió regresa cuando es persuadido por la mano de una dríada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa7e6634-a414-4302-b8e7-1cdc9b984696\', \'multiverseId\': 332395}, \'multiverseid\': 332395}, {\'name\': \'Ravivement\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte verte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La main des dryades peut même rappeler ce qu\'on croit perdu à jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501d488b-a879-4f96-bc56-76b1ae96ab66\', \'multiverseId\': 331648}, \'multiverseid\': 331648}, {\'name\': \'Rivivere\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta verde bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Anche ciò che è perso oltre ogni speranza ritorna se viene richiamato dalla mano di una driade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de27620-5958-4ea0-9419-e45156fb943e\', \'multiverseId\': 332644}, \'multiverseid\': 332644}, {\'name\': \'生き返り\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にある緑のカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'二度と元に戻らないと思われるものでさえ、ドライアドの手にかかると修復される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe95ccc0-cf78-4841-b2b0-720a09145522\', \'multiverseId\': 332893}, \'multiverseid\': 332893}, {\'name\': \'소생\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 녹색 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'기억의 너머로 사라진 것이라도 드라이어드의 손놀림이라면 다시 돌아온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb4afb2-92cd-4e54-8578-f1b05d3d8da0\', \'multiverseId\': 330652}, \'multiverseid\': 330652}, {\'name\': \'Reviver\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card verde alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Mesmo aquilo que foi perdido além de qualquer esperança pode voltar pelas mãos de uma dríade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7fce3f-4d1b-4143-ac54-11a5b8fd7f88\', \'multiverseId\': 331399}, \'multiverseid\': 331399}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение к Жизни\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую зеленую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Руки дриады могут вернуть даже то, что, казалось, потеряно без возврата.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80faecae-18fe-4f3f-bfdd-2abc636f5d37\', \'multiverseId\': 331897}, \'multiverseid\': 331897}, {\'name\': \'复苏\', \'text\': \'将目标绿色牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'树灵的巧手能将失落已久的记忆引领回来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc43bd1-245b-4716-aae9-8b020cc0dec0\', \'multiverseId\': 330403}, \'multiverseid\': 330403}, {\'name\': \'復甦\', \'text\': \'將目標綠色牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'樹靈的巧手能將失落已久的記憶引領回來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'343c3b90-7408-415e-b904-3da761d98035\', \'multiverseId\': 330901}, \'multiverseid\': 330901}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wilde Vermutung\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um Wilde Vermutung zu wirken, eine Karte aus deiner Hand ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Kein Rückgrat, kein Ruhm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332029&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df0229a-c96e-47ff-83af-6b8cf34619f3\', \'multiverseId\': 332029}, \'multiverseid\': 332029}, {\'name\': \'Probar suerte\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar Probar suerte, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Sin riesgo no hay gloria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f556f7-57bf-417d-86f3-2f3988d589a1\', \'multiverseId\': 332278}, \'multiverseid\': 332278}, {\'name\': \'Supposition au hasard\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer la Supposition au hasard, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Pas de cran, pas de gloire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331531&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5241af7-4985-486e-a11b-7dc2c099238f\', \'multiverseId\': 331531}, \'multiverseid\': 331531}, {\'name\': \'Tentativo Disperato\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare il Tentativo Disperato, scarta una carta.\\nPesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Non c\'è gloria per chi non ha fegato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7ecc39-1902-4a0c-bb15-a3820d575167\', \'multiverseId\': 332527}, \'multiverseid\': 332527}, {\'name\': \'野生の勘\', \'text\': \'野生の勘を唱えるための追加コストとして、カードを１枚捨てる。\\nカードを２枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'覚悟なくば栄光なし。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a87528ca-adec-498f-a0d9-ffb199a6bd41\', \'multiverseId\': 332776}, \'multiverseid\': 332776}, {\'name\': \'엉뚱한 추측\', \'text\': \'엉뚱한 추측을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'용기없는 자, 영광을 누리지 못하리라.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47aee506-bba1-4f59-ae29-db8fa2591fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 330535}, \'multiverseid\': 330535}, {\'name\': \'Aposta Cega\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Aposta Cega, descarte um card.\\nCompre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Sem risco, não existe glória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a36991c9-f178-4c72-ad08-198caeb43f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 331282}, \'multiverseid\': 331282}, {\'name\': \'Случайная Догадка\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Случайной Догадки сбросьте карту.\\nВозьмите две карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Была не была!\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e5f71b-6612-46c5-b801-56ba4c467bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 331780}, \'multiverseid\': 331780}, {\'name\': \'胡乱推测\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放胡乱推测的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'没有勇气，就没有荣耀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e61da8-ccb5-4a3a-8461-f00ecc5031df\', \'multiverseId\': 330286}, \'multiverseid\': 330286}, {\'name\': \'胡亂推測\', \'text\': \'棄一張牌，以作為施放胡亂推測的額外費用。\\n抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'沒有勇氣，就沒有榮耀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c516a2e-0df4-4022-97b2-4b3d36bf71b7\', \'multiverseId\': 330784}, \'multiverseid\': 330784}]', "[{'name': 'Windsceada', 'text': 'Fliegend', 'type': 'Kreatur — Sceada', 'flavor': 'Sceadas sind die kleinen Vettern der Drachen und dienen oft mächtigen Zauberern als zusätzliche Augen und Ohren in der Luft.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332179&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b342213d-5714-4ed9-a358-7ace8acf3bc0', 'multiverseId': 332179}, 'multiverseid': 332179}, {'name': 'Draco del viento', 'text': 'Vuela.', 'type': 'Criatura — Draco', 'flavor': 'Un primo menor del dragón, el draco muchas veces es visto junto a poderosos hechiceros que los usan como ojos y oídos voladores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332428&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c3ba6f7-3688-4275-ba22-4abbe2c46a5f', 'multiverseId': 332428}, 'multiverseid': 332428}, {'name': 'Drakôn des vents', 'text': 'Vol', 'type': 'Créature : drakôn', 'flavor': 'Petit cousin du dragon, le drakôn est souvent vu en compagnie de puissants sorciers qui les utilisent comme espions aériens.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331681&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11873dd8-87dd-4bc6-a924-a333e07d55af', 'multiverseId': 331681}, 'multiverseid': 331681}, {'name': 'Draghetto del Vento', 'text': 'Volare', 'type': 'Creatura — Draghetto', 'flavor': 'Cugini più piccoli del drago, i draghetti vengono spesso visti al fianco di maghi potenti che li sfruttano come occhi e orecchie volanti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332677&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6a770e2-5cd2-4bcc-881f-780adbcaca87', 'multiverseId': 332677}, 'multiverseid': 332677}, {'name': '風のドレイク', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドレイク', 'flavor': 'ドラゴンの小さな従兄弟であるドレイクは、彼らを空からの目や耳として用いている強力な魔術師の脇に仕えていることがよくある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332926&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4499897d-93dc-49d6-a74e-5aa526aee345', 'multiverseId': 332926}, 'multiverseid': 332926}, {'name': '바람의 드레이크', 'text': '비행', 'type': '생물 — 드레이크', 'flavor': '드레이크는 용과 비슷하지만 덩치가 더 작으며, 강력한 마법사들은 드레이크를 창공의 눈과 귀로 사용한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330685&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7bb6c55-292b-4834-87be-72967eaa7ff0', 'multiverseId': 330685}, 'multiverseid': 330685}, {'name': 'Dragonete do Vento', 'text': 'Voar', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragonete', 'flavor': 'Primos menores dos dragões, os dragonetes costumam ser vistos ao lado de poderosos magos que os usam como olhos e ouvidos no céu.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331432&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df9127dc-1298-4e9e-9eb4-fbae57aa52d5', 'multiverseId': 331432}, 'multiverseid': 331432}, {'name': 'Ветряной Дрейк', 'text': 'Полет', 'type': 'Существо — Дрейк', 'flavor': 'Дрейков, малых родственников дракона, часто можно увидеть рядом с могущественными волшебниками, которые используют их как летающие глаза и уши.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331930&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daf1d264-0139-4f75-acd8-eebfaf8b00fc', 'multiverseId': 331930}, 'multiverseid': 331930}, {'name': '风龙兽', 'text': '飞行', 'type': '生物～龙兽', 'flavor': '龙兽是龙的远房亲戚，经常在强大法师的身旁出现，充任他们空中的耳目。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330436&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a8fec2f-af7d-491d-a41a-1f889835f88d', 'multiverseId': 330436}, 'multiverseid': 330436}, {'name': '風龍獸', 'text': '飛行', 'type': '生物～龍獸', 'flavor': '龍獸是龍的遠房親戚，經常在強大法師的身旁出現，充任他們空中的耳目。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330934&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e76b13f-8de7-4db7-a06f-19877f22ef7d', 'multiverseId': 330934}, 'multiverseid': 330934}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wolf des Waldrudels\', \'text\': \'Der Wolf des Waldrudels erhält +1/+1 für jede andere Kreatur namens Wolf des Waldrudels, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Wunsch nach einem Rudel steckt ihnen in den Knochen. Ihre wahre Stärke zeigen sie nie aus einem anderen Grund." —Garruk Wildsprecher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1bb9ff0-ed82-4606-87cc-4c0d7fc94b15\', \'multiverseId\': 331977}, \'multiverseid\': 331977}, {\'name\': \'Lobo manada de madera\', \'text\': \'El Lobo manada de madera obtiene +1/+1 por cada otra criatura que controles llamada Lobo manada de madera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"La necesidad de estar con su manada está grabada en sus huesos. Su auténtica fuerza no se mostrará por ningún otro propósito." —Garruk Portavoz Salvaje\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87b66872-9267-4360-9f0f-3db6a5b9e6b7\', \'multiverseId\': 332226}, \'multiverseid\': 332226}, {\'name\': \'Loup de la meute des forêts\', \'text\': \'Le Loup de la meute des forêts gagne +1/+1 pour chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez nommée Loup de la meute des forêts.\', \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils sentent le besoin de la meute dans leurs os. Leur vraie force ne servira que cet objectif. » —Garruk Languebestion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e0449b-fc08-4d54-8dcd-5ffbb6033b28\', \'multiverseId\': 331479}, \'multiverseid\': 331479}, {\'name\': \'Lupo di Legnobranco\', \'text\': \'Il Lupo di Legnobranco prende +1/+1 per ogni altra creatura che controlli chiamata Lupo di Legnobranco.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il bisogno del branco è marchiato nelle loro ossa. La loro vera forza non potrebbe manifestarsi per nessun altro scopo." —Garruk Lingua Selvaggia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c790ff81-4a4f-4110-ae01-d5d1d618b9d1\', \'multiverseId\': 332475}, \'multiverseid\': 332475}, {\'name\': \'森林群れの狼\', \'text\': \'森林群れの狼は、あなたがコントロールする他の「森林群れの狼」という名前のクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'「群れのために必要なことは奴らの骨に刻まれている。その他の目的のために、奴らが真の強さを発揮することはない。」――野生語りのガラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'623e6103-5798-4d79-aeea-d5df00a4090b\', \'multiverseId\': 332724}, \'multiverseid\': 332724}, {\'name\': \'얼룩떼 늑대\', \'text\': \'얼룩떼 늑대는 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물 중 얼룩떼 늑대라는 이름을 가진 생물 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': \'"늑대들은 무리를 갈망하는 것이 본능이다. 다른 목적에는 그들의 진정한 힘이 드러나지 않는다." —개럭 와일드스피커\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85443d14-6148-4188-98f5-32b2799c4f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 330483}, \'multiverseid\': 330483}, {\'name\': \'Lobo da Alcateia do Arvoredo\', \'text\': \'Lobo da Alcateia do Arvoredo recebe +1/+1 para cada outra criatura chamada Lobo da Alcateia do Arvoredo que você controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"As necessidades da alcateia estão entranhadas nos ossos deles. A verdadeira força deles não se mostrará por nenhum outro propósito." — Garruk Falabravo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36a79270-ff97-4d61-a81b-5e4f450ad1de\', \'multiverseId\': 331230}, \'multiverseid\': 331230}, {\'name\': \'Волк Лесной Стаи\', \'text\': \'Волк Лесной Стаи получает +1/+1 за каждое другое существо с именем Волк Лесной Стаи под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': \'«В их крови заложена нужда сбиваться в стаи. Ни для чего иного не проявляется их истинная сила». — Гаррук Дикоречивый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73de9c4d-9392-4051-928e-9cfa3c21b6af\', \'multiverseId\': 331728}, \'multiverseid\': 331728}, {\'name\': \'林群狼\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个名称为林群狼的其他\\n生物，林群狼便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「他们打从骨子里仰赖群体。他们真正的力量不会因其它目的展露。」～召兽使贾路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9611b7-4128-4287-832e-367f403c9d10\', \'multiverseId\': 330234}, \'multiverseid\': 330234}, {\'name\': \'林群狼\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個名稱為林群狼的其他生物，林群狼便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「他們打從骨子裡仰賴群體。他們真正的力量不會因其他目的展露。」 ～召獸使賈路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f754a0d-c8c3-4173-b6ed-560e6bfd93ca\', \'multiverseId\': 330732}, \'multiverseid\': 330732}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächter von Akrasa\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger (Diese Kreatur kann nicht angreifen.)\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Tapferkeit derer, denen Treue wichtiger war als Ruhm, verdanken wir es, dass unsere Heimat unzerstört blieb." —Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332180&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d64aee-a727-405a-8b2b-5bc01f871ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 332180}, \'multiverseid\': 332180}, {\'name\': \'Guardianes de Akrasa\', \'text\': \'Defensor. (Esta criatura no puede atacar.)\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sólo la valentía de aquellos que anteponen la lealtad a la gloria protegerá nuestro hogar." —Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f82092ec-b4be-4206-ab94-526f0ce3cc38\', \'multiverseId\': 332429}, \'multiverseid\': 332429}, {\'name\': "Vigiles d\'Akrasa", \'text\': "Défenseur (Cette créature ne peut pas attaquer).\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est uniquement la bravoure de ceux qui chérissent la loyauté plus que la gloire qui protège notre foyer. » —Elspeth Tirel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331682&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41188b69-eb75-4a1e-8d8a-47a3392c9761\', \'multiverseId\': 331682}, \'multiverseid\': 331682}, {\'name\': \'Guardiani di Akrasa\', \'text\': \'Difensore (Questa creatura non può attaccare.)\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"È solo grazie al coraggio di quanti mettono la lealtà al di sopra della gloria che la nostra casa è al sicuro." —Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e458fb-542b-4589-a91b-c06b7d724a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 332678}, \'multiverseid\': 332678}, {\'name\': \'アクラサの守護者\', \'text\': \'防衛（このクリーチャーでは攻撃できない。）\\n賛美（あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「栄光よりも忠誠を上とする勇気だけがあれば、我々の故郷は安全なのです。」 ――エルズペス・ティレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09b7cb69-8c22-4102-ac5d-01c4903b9b74\', \'multiverseId\': 332927}, \'multiverseid\': 332927}, {\'name\': \'아크라사의 수호자\', \'text\': \'수비태세 (이 생물은 공격할 수 없다.)\\n고귀 (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리의 고향은 개인의 영달보다 의리를 더 소중하게 여긴 자들의 용기 덕분에 안전한 것이다." —엘스페스 티렐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f20fbc3c-207d-4f87-8d67-7f0dc96cfadb\', \'multiverseId\': 330686}, \'multiverseid\': 330686}, {\'name\': \'Guardiões de Akrasa\', \'text\': \'Defensor (Esta criatura não pode atacar.)\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Somente a bravura daqueles que colocam a lealdade acima da glória protege agora nosso lar." — Elspeth Tirel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e04cfc-d0c4-4ab8-8952-b36cb098d1f8\', \'multiverseId\': 331433}, \'multiverseid\': 331433}, {\'name\': \'Стражи Акрасы\', \'text\': \'Защитник (Это существо не может атаковать.)\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, то существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Только благодаря храбрости тех, кто ставит преданность выше славы, наш дом остается в безопасности». — Элспет Тирел\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19e5a9c-3719-483f-a624-95f25d9515e4\', \'multiverseId\': 331931}, \'multiverseid\': 331931}, {\'name\': \'阿卡沙守护者\', \'text\': \'守军（此生物不能攻击。）\\n颂威（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「靠着重视忠诚甚于荣耀者的义行，我们的家园方保安宁。」～艾紫培提瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'189aa4a1-5dd7-4108-8657-8aaa746af382\', \'multiverseId\': 330437}, \'multiverseid\': 330437}, {\'name\': \'阿卡沙守護者\', \'text\': \'守軍（此生物不能攻擊。）\\n頌威（每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，該生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「靠著重視忠誠甚於榮耀者的義行，我們的家園方保安寧。」 ～艾紫培提瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d7e11d-9b43-4772-b1dd-00d0233ae5ab\', \'multiverseId\': 330935}, \'multiverseid\': 330935}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächterlöwen\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit (Diese Kreatur wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Komme in Frieden oder gar nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332169&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d23b8c8-1844-4cd8-bfcc-c5797a04dbbe\', \'multiverseId\': 332169}, \'multiverseid\': 332169}, {\'name\': \'Leones guardianes\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia. (Esta criatura no se gira al atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Acércate en paz o no te acerques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'826ffed2-c718-46bc-954d-062a1f7b67f5\', \'multiverseId\': 332418}, \'multiverseid\': 332418}, {\'name\': \'Lions gardiens\', \'text\': "Vigilance (Attaquer avec cette créature ne la fait pas s\'engager.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': \'Approchez en paix... ou abstenez-vous.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331671&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9781b54-3c78-4189-8015-69f14bf66982\', \'multiverseId\': 331671}, \'multiverseid\': 331671}, {\'name\': \'Leoni Guardiani\', \'text\': \'Cautela (Questa creatura attacca senza TAPpare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Venite in pace, o non venite affatto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a9831d-2b27-441f-89a1-6fb9c4ae8ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 332667}, \'multiverseid\': 332667}, {\'name\': \'守護ライオン\', \'text\': \'警戒（このクリーチャーは攻撃してもタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'平和裡に近寄れぬなら、避けよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e9ff8c0-4580-4b60-ba3a-655a07401d81\', \'multiverseId\': 332916}, \'multiverseid\': 332916}, {\'name\': \'수호의 사자\', \'text\': \'경계 (이 생물은 공격하면서 탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'악의 없이 접근하지 않을 것이라면 아예 접근하지 말도록.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64093d42-5063-4007-a658-bee72be93fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 330675}, \'multiverseid\': 330675}, {\'name\': \'Leões Guardiões\', \'text\': \'Vigilância (Esta criatura não é virada para atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Aproxime-se pacificamente ou não se aproxime.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f371aa63-8c91-41e4-9adc-616b2732b791\', \'multiverseId\': 331422}, \'multiverseid\': 331422}, {\'name\': \'Львы-Стражники\', \'text\': \'Бдительность (Атакуя, это существо не поворачивается.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'Приходи с миром или не приходи вовсе.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20763a3a-7e67-4c5c-830d-d6db6a78c76c\', \'multiverseId\': 331920}, \'multiverseid\': 331920}, {\'name\': \'守护雄狮\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻击时不需横置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': \'不达和平誓不休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6186acc5-c298-42b4-8c20-2e45fa9d545c\', \'multiverseId\': 330426}, \'multiverseid\': 330426}, {\'name\': \'守護雄獅\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻擊時不需橫置。）\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': \'不達和平誓不休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fdb1cb-16de-4776-961e-6af062e03457\', \'multiverseId\': 330924}, \'multiverseid\': 330924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächterspinne\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit (Diese Kreatur wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\\nReichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine erste Reaktion wird sein, dass du in der Bewegung erstarrst und hoffst, dass sie dich nicht gesehen hat. Doch das hat sie, glaub es mir." —Endril, kalonischer Naturalist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad15bb0-bb81-4e5f-9f87-66b255fffc37\', \'multiverseId\': 331970}, \'multiverseid\': 331970}, {\'name\': \'Araña centinela\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia. (Esta criatura no se gira al atacar.)\\nAlcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu primera reacción puede ser quedarte muy quieto con la esperanza de que no te haya visto. Créeme, te ha visto." —Endril, naturalista kaloniana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c59358e4-3ee1-4a79-8cb9-fe58d2d8338c\', \'multiverseId\': 332219}, \'multiverseid\': 332219}, {\'name\': \'Araignée sentinelle\', \'text\': "Vigilance (Attaquer avec cette créature ne la fait pas s\'engager.)\\nPortée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "« Votre première réaction sera de rester immobile et d\'espérer qu\'elle ne vous aura pas vu. Croyez-moi, elle vous aura vu. » —Endril, naturaliste kalonienne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0c074d-2e07-4bc9-97c6-250f972c44c0\', \'multiverseId\': 331472}, \'multiverseid\': 331472}, {\'name\': \'Ragno Sentinella\', \'text\': \'Cautela (Questa creatura attacca senza TAPpare.)\\nRaggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'"La tua prima reazione potrebbe essere di rimanere immobile e sperare che non ti abbia visto. Credimi, ti ha visto." —Endril, naturalista di Kalonia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bb7960c-8bc2-4752-93a3-8d92de8cad7e\', \'multiverseId\': 332468}, \'multiverseid\': 332468}, {\'name\': \'歩哨蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'警戒（このクリーチャーは攻撃してもタップしない。）\\n到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは、立ち尽くして見つからないように祈ることしかできないかもしれません。大丈夫、見つかってます。」 ――カロニアの自然主、義者エンドリル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'796717b4-fb3a-4370-821b-bdd115209d52\', \'multiverseId\': 332717}, \'multiverseid\': 332717}, {\'name\': \'보초 거미\', \'text\': \'경계 (이 생물은 공격하면서 탭되지 않는다.)\\n대공 (이 생물은 비행 능력을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': \'"마주치면 본능적으로 가만히 서서 너를 못 봤기를 바라겠지. 그런데 그때쯤이면 이미 그건 널 봤어." —칼로니아의 박물학자 엔드릴\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9665b2a1-3219-4235-9425-b756ce7f2120\', \'multiverseId\': 330476}, \'multiverseid\': 330476}, {\'name\': \'Aranha Sentinela\', \'text\': \'Vigilância (Esta criatura não é virada para atacar.)\\nAlcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'"A sua primeira reação pode ser ficar imóvel na esperança de que ela não tenha te visto. Acredite, ela te viu." — Endril, naturalista kaloniano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ecfa3b-a50d-4829-b266-ba4bee72b1d5\', \'multiverseId\': 331223}, \'multiverseid\': 331223}, {\'name\': \'Паук-Часовой\', \'text\': \'Бдительность (Атакуя, это существо не поворачивается.)\\nЗахват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'«Ваша первая реакция — замереть в надежде, что он вас не заметил. Поверьте мне, заметил». — Эндриль, натуралист из Калонии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e25442b-a1f5-411a-8db1-b9cd2679ef24\', \'multiverseId\': 331721}, \'multiverseid\': 331721}, {\'name\': \'哨兵蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻击时不需横置。）\\n延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'「你的第一个反应可能会是僵直不动，希望她没看到你。相信我，她看到了。」～卡隆尼亚博物学家安缀儿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194d0274-7265-41e5-9946-08207c460352\', \'multiverseId\': 330227}, \'multiverseid\': 330227}, {\'name\': \'哨兵蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻擊時不需橫置。）\\n延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'「你的第一個反應可能會是僵直不動，希望她沒看到你。相信我，她看到了。」 ～卡隆尼亞博物學家安綴兒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9764ff0f-3b0b-4705-9f84-b92fc58702e6\', \'multiverseId\': 330725}, \'multiverseid\': 330725}]', '[{\'name\': \'Xathrid-Gorgo\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Lege eine Versteinerungsmarke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie erhält Verteidiger und wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einem farblosen Artefakt. Ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden. (Eine Kreatur mit Verteidiger kann nicht angreifen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gorgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332042&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c4e4dc-ef9b-45a4-8dce-de2007cfe310\', \'multiverseId\': 332042}, \'multiverseid\': 332042}, {\'name\': \'Gorgona de Xathrid\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Pon un contador de petrificación sobre la criatura objetivo. Gana la habilidad de defensor y se convierte en un artefacto incoloro además de sus otros tipos. No pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas. (Una criatura con la habilidad de defensor no puede atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gorgona\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fde4d0e-a2f2-4550-9779-fb8ab9127b12\', \'multiverseId\': 332291}, \'multiverseid\': 332291}, {\'name\': \'Gorgone de Xathrid\', \'text\': "Contact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)\\n{2}{B}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « pétrification » sur la créature ciblée. Elle acquiert le défenseur et devient un artefact incolore en plus de ses autres types. Ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées. (Une créature avec le défenseur ne peut pas attaquer.)", \'type\': \'Créature : gorgonoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d289136e-d1cc-40be-a719-c8a5936539d4\', \'multiverseId\': 331544}, \'multiverseid\': 331544}, {\'name\': \'Gorgone di Xathrid\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Metti un segnalino pietrificazione su una creatura bersaglio. Ha difensore e diventa un artefatto incolore in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate. (Una creatura con difensore non può attaccare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gorgone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c40756e-a8ff-4789-bb81-f82beba8d9de\', \'multiverseId\': 332540}, \'multiverseid\': 332540}, {\'name\': \'ザスリッドのゴルゴン\', \'text\': \'接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えた場合、それだけで破壊される。）\\n{2}{B}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に石化カウンターを１個置く。それは防衛を得るとともに無色になり、他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトになる。それの起動型能力は起動できない。（防衛を持つクリーチャーは攻撃できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴルゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2049e411-5cca-43f9-9a8f-b531b69c6bb0\', \'multiverseId\': 332789}, \'multiverseid\': 332789}, {\'name\': \'자쓰리드 고르곤\', \'text\': \'치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 석화 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 수비태세 능력을 얻으며, 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 무색 마법물체가 된다. 그 생물의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다. (수비태세 능력을 가진 생물은 공격할 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고르곤\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5263b2d4-e605-43a0-bcf5-ec55da7b3d06\', \'multiverseId\': 330548}, \'multiverseid\': 330548}, {\'name\': \'Górgona de Xathrid\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Coloque um marcador de petrificação na criatura alvo. Ela ganha defensor e se torna um artefato incolor além de seus outros tipos. As suas habilidades ativadas não podem ser ativadas. (Uma criatura com defensor não pode atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Górgona\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe1399e-d322-4250-ae97-f377d940c5be\', \'multiverseId\': 331295}, \'multiverseid\': 331295}, {\'name\': \'Горгона Затрида\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: положите один жетон окаменения на целевое существо. Оно получает способность Защитника и становится бесцветным артефактом в дополнение к своим другим типам. Его активируемые способности не могут быть активированы. (Существо со способностью Защитника не может атаковать.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Горгона\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8e7199-23ca-4371-969c-f8ca4e6ce8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 331793}, \'multiverseid\': 331793}, {\'name\': \'札兹离蛇发妖\', \'text\': \'死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\\n{2}{B}，{T}：在目标生物上放置一个石化指示物。它获得守军异能，成为无色，且额外具有神器此类别。其起动式异能不能起动。（具有守军异能的生物不能攻击。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蛇发妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0411580c-6100-486f-9e10-f1bd865e2986\', \'multiverseId\': 330299}, \'multiverseid\': 330299}, {\'name\': \'札茲離蛇髮妖\', \'text\': \'死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\\n{2}{B}，{T}：在目標生物上放置一個石化指示物。它獲得守軍異能，成為無色，且額外具有神器此類別。其起動式異能不能起動。（具有守軍異能的生物不能攻擊。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蛇髮妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faa4f0ca-83f5-49fc-8831-a526c5be56e9\', \'multiverseId\': 330797}, \'multiverseid\': 330797}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yeva, die Botin der Natur\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nDu kannst grüne Kreaturenkarten wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann mit einem Zwinkern eine ganze Armee zur Hilfe rufen. Zwinker mich daher besser nicht an."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836d4ee1-184d-4750-a5d5-7558c6b03073\', \'multiverseId\': 331969}, \'multiverseid\': 331969}, {\'name\': \'Yeva, heraldo de la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nPuedes lanzar las cartas de criatura verdes como si tuvieran la habilidad de destello.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedo convocar a un ejército en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. Te aconsejo que no parpadees."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'258d9a43-7010-4d68-a14e-c41fe88df4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 332218}, \'multiverseid\': 332218}, {\'name\': \'Yeva, héraut de la Nature\', \'text\': \'Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nVous pouvez lancer des cartes de créature vertes comme si elles avaient le flash.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Je peux avoir une armée à mes côtés en un clin d\'œil. Alors ne fermez pas les yeux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34cfb249-70cf-40ff-bb18-a7f3879c3ab9\', \'multiverseId\': 331471}, \'multiverseid\': 331471}, {\'name\': \'Yeva, Messaggera della Natura\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nPuoi lanciare carte creatura verdi come se avessero lampo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso convocare un esercito al mio fianco in un batter d\\\'occhio. Meglio non batter gli occhi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7b183f-e3fe-4449-a778-d5789e7f7628\', \'multiverseId\': 332467}, \'multiverseid\': 332467}, {\'name\': \'自然の伝令、イェヴァ\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\nあなたは緑のクリーチャー・カードを、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私は、瞬きする間に軍勢を呼び寄せることも出来るわ。瞬きしないことね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03426440-ea8b-4f76-b861-516c246f1458\', \'multiverseId\': 332716}, \'multiverseid\': 332716}, {\'name\': \'자연의 전령 예바\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)\\n당신은 녹색 생물 카드를 섬광 능력을 가진 것처럼 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 엘프 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"나는 순식간에 군대를 바로 옆에 불러올 수 있지. 눈을 깜빡이지 않는 것이 좋을 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df22d96-d5ec-460d-b379-23472e85da53\', \'multiverseId\': 330475}, \'multiverseid\': 330475}, {\'name\': \'Yeva, Arauto da Natureza\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nVocê pode conjurar cards de criatura verdes como se tivessem lampejo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu posso invocar um exército num piscar de olhos. É melhor não piscar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3174068e-373f-45ba-b404-7e799e637145\', \'multiverseId\': 331222}, \'multiverseid\': 331222}, {\'name\': \'Йева, Глашатай Природы\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nВы можете разыгрывать карты зеленых существ, как будто у них есть Миг.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Я могу призвать на мою сторону целое войско, и глазом моргнуть не успеете. Так что лучше не моргайте».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f64d4a2-1f6a-416a-9ed6-6b90a944315f\', \'multiverseId\': 331720}, \'multiverseid\': 331720}, {\'name\': \'自然传令使叶娃\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n你可以将绿色生物牌视同具有闪现异能来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一眨眼的功夫，我就能让整个部队来到身边。你最好别眨眼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e355fb5a-e043-48b6-bb0b-d368578f366b\', \'multiverseId\': 330226}, \'multiverseid\': 330226}, {\'name\': \'自然傳令使葉娃\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\\n你可以將綠色生物牌視同具有閃現異能地來施放。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～妖精／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一眨眼的功夫，我就能讓整個部隊來到身邊。你最好別眨眼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c218588c-354e-4b5f-8e40-3bdea5c22c95\', \'multiverseId\': 330724}, \'multiverseid\': 330724}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yevas Kraftmagier\', \'text\': \'Wenn Yevas Kraftmagier ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Natur kann nicht aufgehalten werden. Sie reißt an Ravnicas höchsten Gebäuden herum, um mehr Sonne zu bekommen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ec2c43-3df8-4492-baf8-c9046a85ee71\', \'multiverseId\': 332118}, \'multiverseid\': 332118}, {\'name\': \'Magofuerza de Yeva\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Magofuerza de Yeva entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No se puede detener a la naturaleza. Quiebra y rasga los edificios más altos de Rávnica para reclamar su lugar en el sol."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f70b5f-e1fa-4a03-99d4-73e7aab5b82a\', \'multiverseId\': 332367}, \'multiverseid\': 332367}, {\'name\': \'Mageforce de Yeva\', \'text\': "Quand le Mageforce de Yeva arrive sur le champ de bataille, la créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« La nature est inexorable. Elle étrangle les plus hautes tours de Ravnica pour recouvrer sa place au soleil. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b322adf9-26b0-4e6c-803c-e05b2a3c937a\', \'multiverseId\': 331620}, \'multiverseid\': 331620}, {\'name\': \'Mago della Forza di Yeva\', \'text\': \'Quando il Mago della Forza di Yeva entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La natura non può essere fermata. Trancia e squarcia gli edifici più alti di Ravnica per reclamare il proprio posto al sole."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b90892b3-884c-49e3-ac74-5cd43888618a\', \'multiverseId\': 332616}, \'multiverseid\': 332616}, {\'name\': \'イェヴァの腕力魔道士\', \'text\': \'イェヴァの腕力魔道士が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/+2の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「自然は立ち止まらない。ラヴニカ最大の建物をも引き裂き、引きちぎって、太陽目指して伸びていくのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d7d4e7-f22f-4934-adc5-efdb35ee180c\', \'multiverseId\': 332865}, \'multiverseid\': 332865}, {\'name\': \'예바의 완력술사\', \'text\': \'예바의 완력술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"자연은 태양을 보기 위하여 라브니카의 건물들을 부숴버릴 것이다. 그것을 막을 수 있는 자는 아무도 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d94631-2686-446b-8148-dc51df2fa6d3\', \'multiverseId\': 330624}, \'multiverseid\': 330624}, {\'name\': \'Mago da Força de Yeva\', \'text\': \'Quando Mago da Força de Yeva entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"A natureza não pode ser detida. Ela rompe e rasga tudo em seu caminho até a construção mais alta de Ravnica para reivindicar seu lugar ao sol."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4974e1b4-4ac1-426b-bf8a-671d0548905f\', \'multiverseId\': 331371}, \'multiverseid\': 331371}, {\'name\': \'Природомаг Йевы\', \'text\': \'Когда Природомаг Йевы выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Природу невозможно остановить. Она крушит и ломает самые высокие здания в Равнике, чтобы найти себе место под солнцем».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'496d4f07-a620-4db3-90e5-048eab6cf86d\', \'multiverseId\': 331869}, \'multiverseid\': 331869}, {\'name\': \'叶娃的力法师\', \'text\': \'当叶娃的力法师进战场时，目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「大自然无法阻抗。他将拉尼卡最高耸的建筑扯坏拉倒，在太阳底下挣回地盘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8611a3a3-e050-4e09-a60f-86685b8afe43\', \'multiverseId\': 330375}, \'multiverseid\': 330375}, {\'name\': \'葉娃的力法師\', \'text\': \'當葉娃的力法師進戰場時，目標生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「大自然無法阻抗。他將拉尼卡最高聳的建築扯壞拉倒，在太陽底下掙回地盤。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9790648e-fec0-4497-bb73-bd2c5ba83887\', \'multiverseId\': 330873}, \'multiverseid\': 330873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberwindung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof und eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil. Kopiere diese Karten. Wirke die Kopien, falls möglich, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Schicke die Zauberwindung ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332192&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa3e2fa-c032-47dd-a3ac-458f0b4bafab\', \'multiverseId\': 332192}, \'multiverseid\': 332192}, {\'name\': \'Entrelazahechizo\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio y la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo del cementerio de un oponente. Copia esas cartas. Si puedes, lanza las copias sin pagar sus costes de maná. Exilia el Entrelazahechizo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f48f5ba-c7f0-4211-b4d3-02204c8bbddf\', \'multiverseId\': 332441}, \'multiverseid\': 332441}, {\'name\': \'Entrelacs de sorts\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée de votre cimetière et une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée du cimetière d\'un adversaire. Copiez ces cartes. Si possible, lancez les copies sans payer leur coût de mana. Exilez l\'Entrelacs de sorts.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331694&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'128359dd-7caa-4895-9c58-be8d4066e2a2\', \'multiverseId\': 331694}, \'multiverseid\': 331694}, {\'name\': \'Torcimagia\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero e una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario. Copia quelle carte. Lancia le copie, se puoi farlo, senza pagare il loro costo di mana. Esilia la Torcimagia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ce4aca4-8cbe-4cbe-9ec5-d1dce638c348\', \'multiverseId\': 332690}, \'multiverseid\': 332690}, {\'name\': \'呪文ねじり\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カード１枚と、いずれかの対戦相手の墓地にあるインスタント・カード１枚かソーサリー・カード１枚を対象とし、それらを追放する。それらのカードをコピーする。可能ならば、それらのコピーをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。呪文ねじりを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df788db-17f3-4a53-9009-36eec5ca0f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 332939}, \'multiverseid\': 332939}, {\'name\': \'주문 엮기\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드 한 장과 상대의 무덤에 있는 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 추방한 후 복사한다. 가능하면 마나비용을 지불하지 않고 그 복사본들을 발동한다. 주문 엮기를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0e0748d-6c5d-477f-ba7f-7c90b82aba3e\', \'multiverseId\': 330698}, \'multiverseid\': 330698}, {\'name\': \'Entrelace de Mágicas\', \'text\': \'Exile o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo do seu cemitério e o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo do cemitério de um oponente. Copie os dois cards. Conjure as cópias se estiver apto sem pagar seus custos de mana. Exile Entrelace de Mágicas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9880c0eb-045f-4599-a2cc-b8a82babb867\', \'multiverseId\': 331445}, \'multiverseid\': 331445}, {\'name\': \'Переплетение Заклинаний\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища и целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из кладбища оппонента. Скопируйте те карты. Разыграйте те копии, если можете, без уплаты их мана-стоимости. Изгоните Переплетение Заклинаний.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2282dc1b-71ef-4a5d-9d58-9b283252f44c\', \'multiverseId\': 331943}, \'multiverseid\': 331943}, {\'name\': \'咒语纠结\', \'text\': \'将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场放逐，并将目标瞬间或法术牌从任一对手的坟墓场放逐。复制这些牌。如果能施放这些复制品则施放之，且不需支付其法术力费用。放逐咒语纠结。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3fb33da-273b-48ac-a4a5-4d74572e3b36\', \'multiverseId\': 330449}, \'multiverseid\': 330449}, {\'name\': \'咒語糾結\', \'text\': \'將目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場放逐，並將目標瞬間或巫術牌從任一對手的墳墓場放逐。複製這些牌。如果能施放這些複製品則施放之，且不需支付其魔法力費用。放逐咒語糾結。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c0e649-b07b-4d9b-a880-e0ff54f5131f\', \'multiverseId\': 330947}, \'multiverseid\': 330947}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeichen der Meuterei\', \'text\': \'Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und enttappe sie. Diese Kreatur erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie kann in diesem Zug angreifen und {T}.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Flammen der Wut sind schwer zu löschen, sobald sie sich erst einmal entzündet haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86356b6d-4d92-463f-aa6d-3be9a7098d64\', \'multiverseId\': 332197}, \'multiverseid\': 332197}, {\'name\': \'Marca de sedición\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de la criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y enderézala. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. (Puede atacar y {T} este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las llamas de la ira son difíciles de apagar una vez encendidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa3872c-e97d-42a4-b886-b617ffb881b0\', \'multiverseId\': 332446}, \'multiverseid\': 332446}, {\'name\': \'Marque de mutinerie\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle de la créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et dégagez-la. Cette créature acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle peut attaquer et {T} ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La flamme de la colère est difficile à étouffer une fois allumée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b32ce91-5e33-4552-a930-ca2919cdbd8c\', \'multiverseId\': 331699}, \'multiverseid\': 331699}, {\'name\': "Marchio dell\'Ammutinamento", \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e STAPpala. Quella creatura ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. (Può attaccare e {T} in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "La fiamma dell\'ira è difficile da spegnere una volta accesa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feaf92cb-b7e3-41d7-8894-2221c6f1ca66\', \'multiverseId\': 332695}, \'multiverseid\': 332695}, {\'name\': \'反逆の印\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、ターン終了時までそれのコントロールを得る。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、それをアンタップする。そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。（このターン、それは攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'怒りの炎は、一度火がついたら簡単には消せない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'100b86cf-1667-4ab1-9fd6-3f333ba60fc6\', \'multiverseId\': 332944}, \'multiverseid\': 332944}, {\'name\': \'반란의 표식\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후 언탭한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 신속 능력을 얻는다. (그 생물은 이 턴에 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'불붙은 분노는 쉽게 꺼지지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8539571d-0fd7-48f2-8a03-6be0e858973b\', \'multiverseId\': 330703}, \'multiverseid\': 330703}, {\'name\': \'Marca de Rebelião\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo até o final do turno. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre ela e desvire-a. Aquela criatura ganha ímpeto até o final do turno. (Ela pode atacar e {T} neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A chama do ódio é difícil de apagar depois de acesa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf80113f-6d4d-4722-884a-d24d3bd52e36\', \'multiverseId\': 331450}, \'multiverseid\': 331450}, {\'name\': \'Знак Бунта\', \'text\': \'Получите контроль над целевым существом до конца хода. Положите на него один жетон +1/+1 и разверните его. То существо получает Ускорение до конца хода. (Оно может атаковать и {T} в этом ходу.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Однажды распаленный огонь гнева тяжело потушить.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a056045f-db7e-4d9d-a4b1-1df57f8b66ae\', \'multiverseId\': 331948}, \'multiverseid\': 331948}, {\'name\': \'反乱印记\', \'text\': \'获得目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。在上面放置一个+1/+1指示物并重置它。该生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。（它此回合便能攻击与{T}。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'愤怒火焰一旦燃起便难以浇熄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6058a848-275e-4514-81d0-b2b359cca680\', \'multiverseId\': 330454}, \'multiverseid\': 330454}, {\'name\': \'反亂印記\', \'text\': \'獲得目標生物的操控權直到回合結束。在上面放置一個+1/+1指示物並重置它。該生物獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。（它此回合便能攻擊與{T}。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'憤怒火焰一旦燃起便難以澆熄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b24f749-6009-4389-8a91-a2f939c667fd\', \'multiverseId\': 330952}, \'multiverseid\': 330952}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zentauren-Renner\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Zentauren kennen die wahre Freiheit. Nie wird die Versuchung sie zähmen oder die Furcht sie übermannen. Sie leben in vollkommener Harmonie, was wir noch lange nicht erreicht haben." —Ramal, Weiser aus Westtor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332189&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f218567-934a-4131-91e8-54e89a4d8373\', \'multiverseId\': 332189}, \'multiverseid\': 332189}, {\'name\': \'Cazador centauro\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los centauros son realmente libres. Nunca serán dominados por la tentación o controlados por el miedo. Viven en completa armonía, algo todavía no logrado por nuestra gente." —Ramal, sabio del Portón Occidental\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac9f5333-ceb4-4023-b260-5c12ad1ac79c\', \'multiverseId\': 332438}, \'multiverseid\': 332438}, {\'name\': \'Coursier centaure\', \'type\': \'Créature : centaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Les centaures sont véritablement libres. Ils ne seront jamais apprivoisés par la tentation ou contrôlés par la peur. Ils vivent en parfaite harmonie, un exploit que nous sommes encore loin d\'accomplir. » —Ramal, sage de Portorient", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331691&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c76a3d2-6a33-4906-9859-444e86d1e6ca\', \'multiverseId\': 331691}, \'multiverseid\': 331691}, {\'name\': \'Corsiera Centaura\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"I centauri sono realmente liberi. Non saranno mai domati dalla tentazione né controllati dalla paura. Vivono in totale armonia, un\\\'impresa non ancora realizzata dalla nostra gente." —Ramal, saggio di Westgate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170f8001-652f-4c79-b25e-4c256bace7a1\', \'multiverseId\': 332687}, \'multiverseid\': 332687}, {\'name\': \'ケンタウルスの狩猟者\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ケンタウルスは真に自由だ。誘惑に負けることもなければ、恐怖に操られることもない。彼らの生き様は、我らの類がまだ達していない完全な調和を成している。」 ――西門の賢者、ラマール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668c84ea-c977-4ecc-9c2f-6fffb5ef63f4\', \'multiverseId\': 332936}, \'multiverseid\': 332936}, {\'name\': \'발빠른 켄타우로스\', \'type\': \'생물 — 켄타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"이 생물은 진정으로 자유로운 존재다. 어떤 유혹으로도 이들을 길들일 수 없고 두려움을 이용해 조종할 수도 없다. 이들은 완벽한 조화를 이루며 살아가는데, 이는 우리 종족이 아직 달성하지 못한 위대한 업적이다." —서쪽 관문의 현인 라말\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc5aa306-150c-438c-b607-e4f252ad5d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 330695}, \'multiverseid\': 330695}, {\'name\': \'Centaura-Caçadora\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Centauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Os centauros são verdadeiramente livres. Não são domados pela tentação nem controlados pelo medo. Vivem em total harmonia — um feito ainda não alcançado por nossa raça." — Ramal, sábio de Portão Ocidental\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08944591-3714-4639-b639-87a432aee558\', \'multiverseId\': 331442}, \'multiverseid\': 331442}, {\'name\': \'Быстроногий Кентавр\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кентавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Кентавры по-настоящему свободны. Их нельзя ни укротить соблазном, ни подчинить страхом. Они живут в полной гармонии, до сих пор не ведомой таким, как мы». — Рамаль, мудрец из Вестгейта\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e468fbb-7a4d-44f2-8407-4da5c4e15f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 331940}, \'multiverseid\': 331940}, {\'name\': \'半人骏马\', \'type\': \'生物～半人马／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「半人马享有真正的自由。他们永远不会因诱惑而被驯服，也不会因恐惧而遭控制。生活在完全的和谐中，这是我们族类尚未达到的境界。」～西门智者拉默\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3c8126-32f6-4300-90f5-358d59b580e6\', \'multiverseId\': 330446}, \'multiverseid\': 330446}, {\'name\': \'半人駿馬\', \'type\': \'生物～半人馬／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「半人馬享有真正的自由。他們永遠不會因誘惑而被馴服，也不會因恐懼而遭控制。生活在完全的和諧中，這是我們族類尚未達到的境界。」 ～西門智者拉默\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc88cda8-0bdd-472c-9e99-43307b616287\', \'multiverseId\': 330944}, \'multiverseid\': 330944}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerkratern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Ganz und gar\\\' ist meine bevorzugte Methode, etwas zu zerstören." —Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332031&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdbf1260-7d8b-4fb7-89a9-6e4498f789ad\', \'multiverseId\': 332031}, \'multiverseid\': 332031}, {\'name\': \'Craterizar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Por completo\\\' es mi forma favorita de destruir algo." —Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d2fb78c-c16f-43cd-a3b0-ff90625198ac\', \'multiverseId\': 332280}, \'multiverseid\': 332280}, {\'name\': \'Cratèriser\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne détruis jamais les choses à moitié. » —Chandra Nalaàr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331533&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b50f5cf1-9341-416d-b99f-be08b37b6c51\', \'multiverseId\': 331533}, \'multiverseid\': 331533}, {\'name\': \'Craterizzare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Completamente\\\' è il mio modo preferito di distruggere qualcosa." —Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e443448-056b-4d47-9fbd-6fb26b598d5c\', \'multiverseId\': 332529}, \'multiverseid\': 332529}, {\'name\': \'火口化\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、その土地を破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「破壊するときは『跡形もなく』が一番好きね。」 ――チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25df2d92-200c-439c-aa2c-be9c86c5342a\', \'multiverseId\': 332778}, \'multiverseid\': 332778}, {\'name\': \'크레이터화\', \'text\': \'대지 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"파괴는 철저하게, 그것이 나의 방식이다." —찬드라 날라르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ae27d4e-7962-4e23-8a8d-7264b8a06b67\', \'multiverseId\': 330537}, \'multiverseid\': 330537}, {\'name\': \'Craterizar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Totalmente\\\' é o meu modo favorito de destruir as coisas." — Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b098de-75b4-4068-b952-e35b0029c651\', \'multiverseId\': 331284}, \'multiverseid\': 331284}, {\'name\': \'Кратеризация\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«"Дотла" — мой любимый способ уничтожать вещи». — Чандра Налаар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d2ffb48-f7a7-4153-96fe-5fe918495234\', \'multiverseId\': 331782}, \'multiverseid\': 331782}, {\'name\': \'化为陨坑\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「彻底是我在消灭东西时最爱的方式。」～茜卓纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a813e17f-fc06-4730-bdee-50bfbef43a00\', \'multiverseId\': 330288}, \'multiverseid\': 330288}, {\'name\': \'化為隕坑\', \'text\': \'消滅目標地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「徹底是我在消滅東西時最愛的方式。」 ～茜卓納拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c41428a-d5f3-4c82-848f-99b81f22dae8\', \'multiverseId\': 330786}, \'multiverseid\': 330786}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zombie-Goliath\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Riese\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Entfernen von nutzlosen Hirnzellen ist mehrfach nützlich: deine Beweglichkeit wird erhöht, deine Feinde ekeln sich, und du schaffst sogar manchmal noch Platz für Passagiere." —Zul Ashur, Lichfürst\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332148&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77153ea6-bd76-4ab8-8a07-1d6aecd26211\', \'multiverseId\': 332148}, \'multiverseid\': 332148}, {\'name\': \'Goliat zombie\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Remover el estorbo del tejido cerebral no usado otorga varias ventajas: un pequeño aumento de la movilidad, una respuesta de repulsión y horror del enemigo y, en el caso de los especímenes más grandes, espacio para pasajeros." —Zul Ashur, señor liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7266bac6-9602-4baa-b543-53ab740fb0c9\', \'multiverseId\': 332397}, \'multiverseid\': 332397}, {\'name\': \'Goliath zombie\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et géant\', \'flavor\': "« Retirer le tissu cérébral inutile présente plusieurs avantages : une petite augmentation de rapidité, une réaction de révulsion et d\'horreur chez l\'ennemi et, dans le cas de spécimens de grande taille, un espace pour des passagers. » —Zul Ashur, seigneur liche", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331650&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868307bf-4bda-4eb6-bec5-c3de767cb2f7\', \'multiverseId\': 331650}, \'multiverseid\': 331650}, {\'name\': \'Golia Zombie\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Rimuovere l\\\'ingombro di tessuto cerebrale inutile fornisce parecchi vantaggi: un leggero miglioramento nella mobilità, una reazione di repulsione e orrore da parte del nemico e, nel caso di grossi esemplari, spazio per dei passeggeri." —Zul Ashur, signore dei lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5865983f-8a57-47b2-a94b-acb3d5dd3642\', \'multiverseId\': 332646}, \'multiverseid\': 332646}, {\'name\': \'ゾンビの大巨人\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「役立たずの脳の邪魔な部分を取り除くことは、いくつかの点において有益だ。機動性の向上、敵からの恐怖と嫌悪反応、そしてこと大型の種族においては、人員運搬用の空間にもなる。」 ――死者の王、ザル・アシュール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e74a17f-3abf-4d42-85a2-3f563cb66a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 332895}, \'multiverseid\': 332895}, {\'name\': \'좀비 골리앗\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 거인\', \'flavor\': \'"거추장스러운 뇌 조직을 없애버리면 여러 가지 이점이 있지. 기동력이 약간 좋아지고, 적들로부터 혐오감과 공포를 유발할 수 있으며, 대형 객체의 경우 탑승 공간이 마련되지." —리치 군주 줄 아슈르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12fd4c6e-8aac-49bb-be35-9c211aa3f578\', \'multiverseId\': 330654}, \'multiverseid\': 330654}, {\'name\': \'Golias Zumbi\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"A remoção do estorvo do tecido cerebral inútil oferece diversas vantagens: uma leve melhoria na mobilidade, uma resposta de repulsa e horror por parte do inimigo, e, no caso de espécimes grandes, espaço para passageiros." — Zul Ashur, senhor lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72602b81-2bc8-4ff8-b137-85870c79c24c\', \'multiverseId\': 331401}, \'multiverseid\': 331401}, {\'name\': \'Зомби-Голиаф\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'«Удаление обременительной и бесполезной мозговой ткани дает следующие преимущества: небольшое повышение подвижности, чувство отвращения и страха у врагов и, в случае крупных особей, место для пассажиров». — Зул Ашур, лорд-лич\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95fa179-a263-4ca6-aa65-eb748d1413f1\', \'multiverseId\': 331899}, \'multiverseid\': 331899}, {\'name\': \'巨硕灵俑\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「把无用又占空间的脑部组织拿掉，能带来些好处：移动力略增，让敌人感到嫌恶与恐惧，并且若是大型样本，还能搭载乘员。」～巫妖领主祝亚许\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88550c36-6476-473b-b59e-5435bce1d75e\', \'multiverseId\': 330405}, \'multiverseid\': 330405}, {\'name\': \'巨碩殭屍\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「把無用又佔空間的腦部組織拿掉，能帶來些好處：移動力略增，讓敵人感到嫌惡與恐懼，並且若是大型樣本，還能搭載乘員。」 ～巫妖領主祝亞許\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe6c882-99b4-45ea-98d7-f0d6355bad0e\', \'multiverseId\': 330903}, \'multiverseid\': 330903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu Schlacke werden\', \'text\': \'Zu Schlacke werden fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu. Zerstöre alle Ausrüstung, die an diese Kreatur angelegt ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn es vorher keine geschwärzte, stinkende, geschmolzene Abscheulichkeit war, dann aber jetzt!" —Koth vom Hammerclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b816dc-2de3-491c-86ef-01adbb119517\', \'multiverseId\': 332144}, \'multiverseid\': 332144}, {\'name\': \'Convertir en escoria\', \'text\': \'Convertir en escoria hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Destruye todos los equipos anexados a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si no era una abominación fundida, ennegrecida y apestosa antes, ahora seguro que lo es." —Koth del Martillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f025162-b173-4e1b-8370-d7d30310c8aa\', \'multiverseId\': 332393}, \'multiverseid\': 332393}, {\'name\': \'Amalgame\', \'text\': "L\'Amalgame inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée. Détruisez tous les équipements attachés à cette créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Si ce n\'était pas une abomination puante et déliquescente auparavant, à présent, ça l\'est. » —Koth du Marteau", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331646&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a718ee2e-5c56-44a7-a3a9-d74c80676c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 331646}, \'multiverseid\': 331646}, {\'name\': \'Tramutare in Scorie\', \'text\': \'Tramutare in Scorie infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Distruggi tutti gli Equipaggiamenti assegnati a quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non era un annerito abominio puzzolente e sciolto prima, di certo lo è adesso." —Koth del Martello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28a00409-80c5-4f57-99ca-2a401d20bde0\', \'multiverseId\': 332642}, \'multiverseid\': 332642}, {\'name\': \'金屑化\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。金屑化はそれに５点のダメージを与える。それにつけられているすべての装備品を破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「それが以前に黒焦げでも臭っても溶けてもいなかった怪物だって言うんなら、今なら確実にそうだな。」 ――槌のコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c93471-f1c4-41e9-ae98-95a1823980d4\', \'multiverseId\': 332891}, \'multiverseid\': 332891}, {\'name\': \'용광로 찌꺼기\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 용광로 찌꺼기는 그 생물에게 피해 5점을 입힌다. 그 생물에게 부착된 모든 장비를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"예전에 무엇이었던, 지금은 그을리고 냄새나며 녹아버린 흉물일 뿐이지." —망치의 코쓰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d62a72-1b3b-44fa-bea8-07f44f756af0\', \'multiverseId\': 330650}, \'multiverseid\': 330650}, {\'name\': \'Transformar em Escória\', \'text\': \'Transformar em Escória causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Destrua todos os Equipamentos anexados àquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Se antes não era uma abominação enegrecida, derretida e fedorenta, certamente é agora." — Koth do Martelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8373acff-ca6d-4a28-9a16-b185c4cbc55f\', \'multiverseId\': 331397}, \'multiverseid\': 331397}, {\'name\': \'Превращение в Шлак\', \'text\': \'Превращение в Шлак наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу. Уничтожьте все Снаряжение, прикрепленное к тому существу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Если оно не было обугленной, вонючей, расплавленной мерзостью раньше, то теперь точно ею стало». — Кос из племени Молота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42b7d109-b97b-4e41-a51d-8662f6d873c8\', \'multiverseId\': 331895}, \'multiverseid\': 331895}, {\'name\': \'化为渣滓\', \'text\': \'化为渣滓对目标生物造成5点伤害。消灭所有装备在该生物上的武具。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「如果它之前不是个发黑、发臭、融化的憎恨兽，现在就真的是了。」～锤族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6c1bff-dddf-4dad-93a2-4287d3623274\', \'multiverseId\': 330401}, \'multiverseid\': 330401}, {\'name\': \'化為渣滓\', \'text\': \'化為渣滓對目標生物造成5點傷害。消滅所有裝備在該生物上的武具。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「如果它之前不是個發黑、發臭、融化的憎恨獸，現在就真的是了。」 ～鎚族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7b48139-7b05-49f2-8360-37c49a62c0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 330899}, \'multiverseid\': 330899}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zurückdrehen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Enttappe bis zu vier Länder.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die besten Verweigerungszauber funktionieren ganz einfach: Sie rauben die Erinnerung und lassen das Umfeld intakt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332191&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505fd499-8cf7-4e50-b687-5434e129ee95\', \'multiverseId\': 332191}, \'multiverseid\': 332191}, {\'name\': \'Retroceder\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Endereza hasta cuatro tierras.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las mejores negaciones no son más que eso: un principio y un final inalterados, un sueño sin memoria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd9666cf-5910-4837-a1b8-5b38841f5260\', \'multiverseId\': 332440}, \'multiverseid\': 332440}, {\'name\': \'Rembobinage\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Dégagez jusqu\'à quatre terrains.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Le meilleur déni se résume ainsi : un commencement et une fin inchangés, un rêve qui ne laisse pas de trace dans la mémoire. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331693&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af3094f-f6c0-4ca5-8a7f-d2810bdaeab7\', \'multiverseId\': 331693}, \'multiverseid\': 331693}, {\'name\': \'Rifare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. STAPpa fino a quattro terre.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il miglior diniego è semplicemente questo: un inizio e una fine immutati, un sogno di cui non si serbano ricordi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7079e1bf-d7a6-46d3-b6e9-91c3d169edbf\', \'multiverseId\': 332689}, \'multiverseid\': 332689}, {\'name\': \'巻き直し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。土地を最大４つまでアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「一番強烈な否認というのは、要するに『始めと終わりはそのままで、記憶に残らない夢』だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06e94f6-a250-4ecb-b560-cf5393493056\', \'multiverseId\': 332938}, \'multiverseid\': 332938}, {\'name\': \'되감기\', \'text\': \'주문 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 최대 네 개의 대지를 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"최고의 부정은 시작과 끝을 그대로 둔 채 기억만을 없앤 꿈과도 같다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c3189f-6743-4df7-965b-4e113a2cd542\', \'multiverseId\': 330697}, \'multiverseid\': 330697}, {\'name\': \'Retroceder\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Desvire até quatro terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"As melhores negações são simplesmente isso: um começo e fim inalterados, um sonho sem memória."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4975afd9-c87a-4738-9f15-cc0846f95fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 331444}, \'multiverseid\': 331444}, {\'name\': \'Перемотка\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Разверните до четырех земель.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Такую природу имеют лучшие запреты. Начало и конец неизменны, сон без сновидений, ускользающий из памяти».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9cf482e-8787-4fd8-8816-fd8228cc8ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 331942}, \'multiverseid\': 331942}, {\'name\': \'倒退\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。重置至多四张地牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「最出色的否定就像这样：开始与结束没有任何变化，一如没留下记忆的梦。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa5bf74-0f58-427f-89b1-0f53c863ea4b\', \'multiverseId\': 330448}, \'multiverseid\': 330448}, {\'name\': \'倒退\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。重置至多四張地牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「最出色的否定就像這樣：開始與結束沒有任何變化，一如沒留下記憶的夢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddee3884-1886-4d59-8ef6-a56ab9cf3537\', \'multiverseId\': 330946}, \'multiverseid\': 330946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwang\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl zeigt die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor. Du bestimmst eine Karte davon, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist. Dieser Spieler wirft diese Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Keine Panik. Ich werde dir nicht alle Geheimnisse entlocken. Nur das wichtigste." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be39c438-bde5-453c-bbf1-174c1c069ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 332093}, \'multiverseid\': 332093}, {\'name\': \'Coacción\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo muestra su mano. Eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra ni criatura. Ese jugador descarta esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No te preocupes. No voy a despojarte de todos tus secretos. Sólo del más valioso." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22994f67-abf5-481a-b7f5-830ea0907330\', \'multiverseId\': 332342}, \'multiverseid\': 332342}, {\'name\': \'Contrainte\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main. Vous y choisissez une carte non-créature, non-terrain. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ne vous en faites pas. Je ne vais pas m\'emparer de tous vos secrets. Seulement des plus précieux. » —Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b65b13-05fc-4ef8-866a-e9513440ac28\', \'multiverseId\': 331595}, \'multiverseid\': 331595}, {\'name\': \'Costrizione\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano. Scegli una carta non terra, non creatura da quella mano. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non preoccuparti. Non ti sottrarrò tutti i tuoi segreti. Solo quello più prezioso." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6599d810-db86-4c79-a122-2cf1b4a9a242\', \'multiverseId\': 332591}, \'multiverseid\': 332591}, {\'name\': \'強迫\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中のクリーチャーでも土地でもないカードを１枚選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「心配しなくていいよ。お前の秘密を全部奪うつもりはない。一番大事なやつだけさ。」――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7eb348-d20a-4cf5-ba81-a5833f04d9ee\', \'multiverseId\': 332840}, \'multiverseid\': 332840}, {\'name\': \'구속\', \'text\': \'상대 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 그 중 생물이 아니고 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 선택한다. 그 플레이어는 그 카드를 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"걱정하지 마. 너의 비밀을 전부 빼앗지는 않을 테니까. 가장 귀중한 비밀 딱 하나만 가져갈 거야." —릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'696e82c7-6efd-41a9-a8fb-2131b2031210\', \'multiverseId\': 330599}, \'multiverseid\': 330599}, {\'name\': \'Coagir\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo revela a própria mão. Você escolhe um card que não seja um terreno nem uma criatura da mão dele. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Não se preocupe. Eu não vou roubar todos os seus segredos. Só o mais valioso." — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e78ecf-48bc-4b87-8820-b4524e83851e\', \'multiverseId\': 331346}, \'multiverseid\': 331346}, {\'name\': \'Насилие\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент показывает свою руку. Вы выбираете из нее карту, не являющуюся ни существом, ни землей. Тот игрок сбрасывает ту карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Не беспокойся. Я не собираюсь лишать тебя всех твоих секретов. Только самых ценных». — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c164458-8c8b-4c61-9801-efbccbc40423\', \'multiverseId\': 331844}, \'multiverseid\': 331844}, {\'name\': \'逼从\', \'text\': \'目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非生物且非地的牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「放心。我不会把你所有的秘密都夺走。我只拿最珍贵的那个。」～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'262ebdc9-2b7b-4866-991d-1687e3076229\', \'multiverseId\': 330350}, \'multiverseid\': 330350}, {\'name\': \'逼從\', \'text\': \'目標對手展示其手牌。你選擇其中一張非生物且非地的牌。該玩家棄掉該牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「放心。我不會把你所有的秘密都奪走。我只拿最珍貴的那個。」 ～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5079d679-1c81-4e93-be07-7a6ee4040302\', \'multiverseId\': 330848}, \'multiverseid\': 330848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätzender Schleim\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die er einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\\nWenn der Ätzende Schleim ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4dc9970-f9d0-4160-bc98-5569ba59b5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 332109}, \'multiverseid\': 332109}, {\'name\': \'Fango ácido\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\\nCuando el Fango ácido entre al campo de batalla, destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4572cf73-78d5-47a6-8b02-c68924884c01\', \'multiverseId\': 332358}, \'multiverseid\': 332358}, {\'name\': \'Boue acide\', \'text\': "Contact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)\\nQuand la Boue acide arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, l\'enchantement ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331611&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45896e18-90ef-4767-9a92-11b2022bd07b\', \'multiverseId\': 331611}, \'multiverseid\': 331611}, {\'name\': \'Melma Acida\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\\nQuando la Melma Acida entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un artefatto, un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0085d38c-a92e-48fe-9859-b78b6b9990b5\', \'multiverseId\': 332607}, \'multiverseid\': 332607}, {\'name\': \'酸のスライム\', \'text\': \'接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えた場合、それだけで破壊される。）\\n酸のスライムが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'604a2c0a-0900-4524-bb79-e5442b621a28\', \'multiverseId\': 332856}, \'multiverseid\': 332856}, {\'name\': \'산성 슬라임\', \'text\': \'치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\\n산성 슬라임이 전장에 들어올 때, 마법물체, 부여마법 또는 대지 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 점액괴물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba8b5ad-d686-4b83-ba54-8c63418c54da\', \'multiverseId\': 330615}, \'multiverseid\': 330615}, {\'name\': \'Limo Ácido\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\\nQuando Limo Ácido entrar no campo de batalha, destrua o artefato, encantamento ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2be6f1-719c-4c80-b5ac-9082f4a5c922\', \'multiverseId\': 331362}, \'multiverseid\': 331362}, {\'name\': \'Кислотная Слизь\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\\nКогда Кислотная Слизь выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевой артефакт, чары или землю.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c92e342c-7d5d-404c-8992-76f93a82b49b\', \'multiverseId\': 331860}, \'multiverseid\': 331860}, {\'name\': \'酸液黏菌\', \'text\': \'死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\\n当酸液黏菌进战场时，消灭目标神器，结界，或地。\', \'type\': \'生物～流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed2783d-3405-4b83-8079-1454c1dd4b39\', \'multiverseId\': 330366}, \'multiverseid\': 330366}, {\'name\': \'酸液黏菌\', \'text\': \'死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\\n當酸液黏菌進戰場時，消滅目標神器，結界，或地。\', \'type\': \'生物～流漿\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd07bbe-cd76-4a76-981a-81abae90a2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 330864}, \'multiverseid\': 330864}]', '[{\'name\': \'Öffentliche Hinrichtung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Jede andere Kreatur, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, erhält -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Henker musste nicht sprechen, damit die Dorfbewohner ihn verstanden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c866e37-977b-4b39-ba30-fcaaa7f38712\', \'multiverseId\': 332046}, \'multiverseid\': 332046}, {\'name\': \'Ejecución pública\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Cada otra criatura que controla ese jugador obtiene -2/-0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque el verdugo no dijo nada, los aldeanos entendieron el mensaje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f71020e-fcf7-47a6-93d7-c3d6697ae435\', \'multiverseId\': 332295}, \'multiverseid\': 332295}, {\'name\': \'Exécution publique\', \'text\': "Détruisez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Chaque autre créature que ce joueur contrôle gagne -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'exécuteur n\'ouvrit pas la bouche, mais les villageois comprirent le message.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc28f440-e2d6-4d6e-8ba5-86ea28e1d2f0\', \'multiverseId\': 331548}, \'multiverseid\': 331548}, {\'name\': \'Esecuzione Pubblica\', \'text\': "Distruggi una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Ogni altra creatura controllata da quell\'avversario prende -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Sebbene il boia non abbia parlato, gli abitanti del villaggio hanno recepito il messaggio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1593f34f-2f33-4fa7-9f26-b35ad5ae2bea\', \'multiverseId\': 332544}, \'multiverseid\': 332544}, {\'name\': \'公開処刑\', \'text\': \'いずれかの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。そのプレイヤーがコントロールする他のクリーチャーはそれぞれ、ターン終了時まで－２/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'処刑者は何も言わなかったが、村人にはそのメッセージが伝わった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=332793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b37151a-23af-4dc0-8bef-d7130b22351a\', \'multiverseId\': 332793}, \'multiverseid\': 332793}, {\'name\': \'공개 처형\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 그 플레이어가 조종하는 다른 생물들은 턴종료까지 -2/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'처형 집행자가 직접 말하지는 않았지만, 마을 사람들은 모두 그 의미를 이해했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e297e982-2e36-4d3c-9f34-66a5f9da27e6\', \'multiverseId\': 330552}, \'multiverseid\': 330552}, {\'name\': \'Execução Pública\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Cada outra criatura que aquele jogador controla recebe -2/-0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Embora o carrasco não tenha falado, os aldeões entenderam a mensagem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dfeb8df-b672-443f-9311-1c7248968fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 331299}, \'multiverseid\': 331299}, {\'name\': \'Публичная Казнь\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо под контролем оппонента. Каждое другое существо под контролем того игрока получает -2/-0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Хотя палач не проронил ни слова, жители деревушки все и так поняли.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=331797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f00d7c-4c01-4f38-ae5a-1abde4473208\', \'multiverseId\': 331797}, \'multiverseid\': 331797}, {\'name\': \'公开处决\', \'text\': \'消灭目标由对手操控的生物。由该牌手操控的其他生物各得-2/-0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'刽子手不用开口，村民也懂得意思。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62afcdf6-d402-49c5-b297-99548f511bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 330303}, \'multiverseid\': 330303}, {\'name\': \'公開處決\', \'text\': \'消滅目標由對手操控的生物。由該玩家操控的其他生物各得-2/-0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'劊子手不用開口，村民也懂得意思。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=330801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ab50b5-d608-4a4f-9b45-14bc282cf8a6\', \'multiverseId\': 330801}, \'multiverseid\': 330801}]']
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5DN', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AER', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'AJMP', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'APC', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'ATQ', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BCHR', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BNG', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BRR', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CHR', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CON', 'CST', 'DBL', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DGM', 'DIS', 'DKA', 'DKM', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DRK', 'DST', 'DTK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'E02', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EMN', 'EVE', 'EVG', 'F05', 'F08', 'F09', 'F10', 'F12', 'F13', 'FBB', 'FNM', 'FRF', 'FUT', 'G17', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GTC', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HA1', 'HA3', 'HA7', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JOU', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'ME4', 'MED', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MIC', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKC', 'MKM', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MOR', 'MP2', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'O90P', 'OANA', 'ODY', 'OGW', 'OLEP', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTJ', 'OTP', 'P02', 'P09', 'P10', 'P22', 'P23', 'P30A', 'P30H', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PCMP', 'PD2', 'PD3', 'PDCI', 'PDGM', 'PDOM', 'PDP13', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PF23', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PHUK', 'PIDW', 'PIP', 'PL24', 'PLG20', 'PLS', 'PLST', 'PM10', 'PM13', 'PM19', 'PM20', 'PMDA', 'PMEI', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PRES', 'PRIX', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSDC', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PSUS', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PTKDF', 'PURL', 'PW21', 'PW24', 'PWAR', 'PWOS', 'PXLN', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'RVR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SIS', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SS1', 'STA', 'STH', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UDS', 'UGL', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V13', 'V15', 'VOC', 'VOW', 'W16', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'WOT', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['+1: Chandra, the Firebrand deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\n-2: When you cast your next instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\\n-6: Chandra, the Firebrand deals 6 damage to each of up to six target creatures and/or players.', '+1: Draw a card. Target player puts the top card of his or her library into his or her graveyard.\\n0: Target player puts the top ten cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.\\n-7: Any number of target players each draw twenty cards.', '+1: Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature.\\n-3: Target creature gains flying and double strike until end of turn.\\n-8: Put X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens onto the battlefield, where X is your life total.', '+1: Put a 3/3 green Beast creature token onto the battlefield.\\n-3: Draw cards equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\\n-6: Put a 6/6 green Wurm creature token onto the battlefield for each land you control.', '+1: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.\\n-3: Target creature gets +X/+X or -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Swamps you control.\\n-6: You get an emblem with "Swamps you control have ‘{T}: Add {B}{B}{B}{B} to your mana pool.\'"', '+3: Destroy target noncreature permanent.\\n-2: Gain control of target creature.\\n-9: Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker deals 7 damage to target player. That player discards seven cards, then sacrifices seven permanents.', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn for each Swamp you control.', 'As Phylactery Lich enters the battlefield, put a phylactery counter on an artifact you control.\\nPhylactery Lich is indestructible.\\nWhen you control no permanents with phylactery counters on them, sacrifice Phylactery Lich.', "As Primal Clay enters the battlefield, it becomes your choice of a 3/3 artifact creature, a 2/2 artifact creature with flying, or a 1/6 Wall artifact creature with defender in addition to its other types. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", 'As Stuffy Doll enters the battlefield, choose a player.\\nStuffy Doll is indestructible.\\nWhenever Stuffy Doll is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to the chosen player.\\n{T}: Stuffy Doll deals 1 damage to itself.', 'As an additional cost to cast Wild Guess, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, count the number of permanents you control. Your life total becomes that number.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, draw a card.\\n{T}: Staff of Nin deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 200 or more cards in your library, you win the game.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'B', 'Cathedral of War enters the battlefield tapped.\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.', "Chandra's Fury deals 4 damage to target player and 1 damage to each creature that player controls.", 'Copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', 'Creatures you control gain double strike until end of turn. (They deal both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 until end of turn. Each creature your opponents control blocks this turn if able.', 'Creatures you control have flying, first strike, vigilance, trample, haste, and protection from black and from red.', 'Creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Crimson Muckwader gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Swamp.\\n{2}{B}: Regenerate Crimson Muckwader. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Crusader of Odric's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nWhen Acidic Slime enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', "Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Put a petrification counter on target creature. It gains defender and becomes a colorless artifact in addition to its other types. Its activated abilities can't be activated. (A creature with defender can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nFlying\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by Fog Bank.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\n{R}: Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Destroy all nonland permanents.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Destroy target creature an opponent controls. Each other creature that player controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Door to Nothingness enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{W}{W}{U}{U}{B}{B}{R}{R}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Door to Nothingness: Target player loses the game.', 'Dragonskull Summit enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Swamp or a Mountain.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R} to your mana pool.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Drowned Catacomb enters the battlefield tapped unless you control an Island or a Swamp.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B} to your mana pool.', "Enchant artifact or creature\\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and is unblockable.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has lifelink. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has mountainwalk. (It's unblockable as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Dark Favor enters the battlefield, you lose 1 life.\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+1.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Divine Favor enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has flying.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Equipped creature has haste. (It can attack and {T} no matter when it came under your control.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's red.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Equipped creature has trample. (If it would assign enough damage to its blockers to destroy them, you may have it assign the rest of its damage to defending player or planeswalker.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's green.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Equipped creature has vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's white.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Essence Drain deals 3 damage to target creature or player and you gain 3 life.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', "Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{3}{B}: Regenerate Duty-Bound Dead. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Exchange control of two target creatures.', "Exile all permanents. Exile all cards from all hands and graveyards. Each player's life total becomes 1.", 'Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Put a 2/2 black Zombie creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Exile target enchantment.', "Exile target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard and target instant or sorcery card from an opponent's graveyard. Copy those cards. Cast the copies if able without paying their mana costs. Exile Spelltwine.", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhen Attended Knight enters the battlefield, put a 1/1 white Soldier creature token onto the battlefield.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhenever Odric, Master Tactician and at least three other creatures attack, you choose which creatures block this combat and how those creatures block.', 'Flames of the Firebrand deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target creatures and/or players.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nYou may cast green creature cards as though they had flash.', 'Flinthoof Boar gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Mountain.\\n{R}: Flinthoof Boar gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Flying', 'Flying\\nArctic Aven gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Plains.\\n{W}: Arctic Aven gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Flying\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nLifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nOther creatures you control have exalted. (If a creature has multiple instances of exalted, each triggers separately.)', 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever Nefarox, Overlord of Grixis attacks alone, defending player sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\\nHaste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Thundermaw Hellkite enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to each creature with flying your opponents control. Tap those creatures.', "Flying\\nJace's Phantasm gets +4/+4 as long as an opponent has ten or more cards in his or her graveyard.", "Flying\\nSlumbering Dragon can't attack or block unless it has five or more +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, put a +1/+1 counter on Slumbering Dragon.", "Flying\\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Flying\\nWar Falcon can't attack unless you control a Knight or a Soldier.", 'Flying\\nWelkin Tern can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nWhen Battleflight Eagle enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Bloodhunter Bat enters the battlefield, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sphinx of Uthuun enters the battlefield, reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', "Flying\\nWhenever Shimian Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals his or her hand. You choose a nonland card from it. Search that player's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that card and exile them. Then that player shuffles his or her library.", 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Griffin Protector gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{1}{R}{R}{R}: Return Firewing Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Hatchling gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'G', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it and untap it. That creature gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Glacial Fortress enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Plains or an Island.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U} to your mana pool.', 'Harbor Bandit gets +1/+1 as long as you control an Island.\\n{1}{U}: Harbor Bandit is unblockable this turn.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nReckless Brute attacks each turn if able.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", "Islandwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nAll lands are Islands in addition to their other types.\\nCreatures without flying or islandwalk can't attack.", "Islandwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nHarbor Serpent can't attack unless there are five or more Islands on the battlefield.", 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\\nIf you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Magmaquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each planeswalker.', "Mogg Flunkies can't attack or block alone.", 'Other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool for each Elf you control.', 'Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1 and have islandwalk. (They are unblockable as long as defending player controls an Island.)', 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\\nAs long as the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus and other Vampire creatures you control get +2/+1 and have flying.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to you and creatures you control this turn.', 'Primordial Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, double the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra.\\nPrimordial Hydra has trample as long as it has ten or more +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Prized Elephant gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Forest.\\n{G}: Prized Elephant gains trample until end of turn. (If this creature would assign enough damage to its blockers to destroy them, you may have it assign the rest of its damage to defending player or planeswalker.)', "Protection from black (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", "Protection from white (This creature can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything white.)\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", 'Put X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens onto the battlefield, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'Put three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens onto the battlefield.', 'Put two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens onto the battlefield.', 'Put two 2/2 blue Drake creature tokens with flying onto the battlefield.', 'R', 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\n{X}{G}{G}: Silklash Spider deals X damage to each creature with flying.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target green card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return to the battlefield all permanent cards in your graveyard that were put there from the battlefield this turn.', 'Rootbound Crag enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain or a Forest.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G} to your mana pool.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Bloodthrone Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Search your library for a Plains, Island, Swamp, or Mountain card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of lands you control, and put them onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for up to X cards and put those cards into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for up to two Forest cards and put them onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Searing Spear deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', "Serra Avatar's power and toughness are each equal to your life total.\\nWhen Serra Avatar is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Sunpetal Grove enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Forest or a Plains.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool.', "Tap all creatures target player controls. Those creatures don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Tap two untapped artifacts you control: Untap target artifact.', 'Tap up to three target creatures.', 'Target creature gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -5/-0 until end of turn.', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Target opponent puts the top seven cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards his or her hand.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Timberpack Wolf gets +1/+1 for each other creature you control named Timberpack Wolf.', "Tormented Soul can't block and is unblockable.", 'Trample (If this creature would assign enough damage to its blockers to destroy them, you may have it assign the rest of its damage to defending player or planeswalker.)', 'Trample\\nWhen Elderscale Wurm enters the battlefield, if your life total is less than 7, your life total becomes 7.\\nAs long as you have 7 or more life, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 7 reduces it to 7 instead.', 'Turn to Slag deals 5 damage to target creature. Destroy all Equipment attached to that creature.', 'U', "Veilborn Ghoul can't block.\\nWhenever a Swamp enters the battlefield under your control, you may return Veilborn Ghoul from your graveyard to your hand.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nOther Soldier creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.\\nWhen Captain of the Watch enters the battlefield, put three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens onto the battlefield.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nReach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)", 'Volcanic Geyser deals X damage to target creature or player.', 'W', 'When Archaeomancer enters the battlefield, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Augur of Bolas enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an instant or sorcery card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'When Bond Beetle enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "When Disciple of Bolas enters the battlefield, sacrifice another creature. You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is that creature's power.", 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Goblin Arsonist dies, you may have it deal 1 damage to target creature or player.', "When Ground Seal enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nCards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities.", "When Liliana's Shade enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.\\n{B}: Liliana's Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'When Mindclaw Shaman enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals his or her hand. You may cast an instant or sorcery card from it without paying its mana cost.', 'When Mwonvuli Beast Tracker enters the battlefield, search your library for a creature card with deathtouch, hexproof, reach, or trample and reveal it. Shuffle your library and put that card on top of it.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Ravenous Rats enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, put a 3/3 green Beast creature token onto the battlefield.', 'When War Priest of Thune enters the battlefield, you may destroy target enchantment.', "When Yeva's Forcemage enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", 'Whenever Scroll Thief deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.', "Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, that creature's controller loses 1 life.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 2 life.', "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Hamletback Goliath, where X is that creature's power.", 'Whenever another creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.', "Whenever you cast a red spell, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Whenever you cast a white, blue, black, or red spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Quirion Dryad.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, put a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', "You can't cast Serra Avenger during your first, second, or third turns of the game.\\nFlying\\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", 'You gain 1 life for each land you control.', 'You gain 7 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.', 'You may cast nonland cards from your hand without paying their mana costs.', 'You may choose new targets for target spell.', 'You may have Clone enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield.', '{1}, {T}, Discard a card: You gain 4 life.\\n{1}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Put a 0/1 white Goat creature token onto the battlefield.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', '{1}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Chronomaton.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Arms Dealer deals 4 damage to target creature.', "{2}, {T}: You gain 5 life. Shuffle Elixir of Immortality and your graveyard into their owner's library.", "{2}: Equipped creature gains hexproof until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's blue.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{2}: Regenerate equipped creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on equipped creature if it's black.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "{2}{U}, {T}: Put Void Stalker and target creature on top of their owners' libraries, then those players shuffle their libraries.", '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Gem of Becoming: Search your library for an Island card, a Swamp card, and a Mountain card. Reveal those cards and put them into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{R}, Sacrifice Torch Fiend: Destroy target artifact.', '{T}, Discard a card: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', "{T}, Sacrifice Tormod's Crypt: Exile all cards from target player's graveyard.", '{T}: Add three mana of any one color to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Put a pressure counter on Hellion Crucible.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Remove two pressure counters from Hellion Crucible and sacrifice it: Put a 4/4 red Hellion creature token with haste onto the battlefield. (It can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', '{T}: Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Put X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens onto the battlefield, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', '{T}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.\\n{T}: Target creature blocks this turn if able.', '{T}: Untap target Forest.', '{U}, {T}: Target player puts the top two cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', '{U}: Watercourser gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{X}, {T}: Target player puts the top X cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.']
